Okay, you have a data center, you'll have a standby data center backup system, right?

1455
02:09:17,550 --> 02:09:20,688
如果其中一个宕机，另一个会立即接管。
Which will work if one goes down, the other will take on immediately.

1456
02:09:20,848 --> 02:09:24,228
你可能已经准备好了备份和归档，这些都是有效的，对吧？
You may have backups in place, archives in place, which works, right?

1457
02:09:24,590 --> 02:09:25,316
所以这很有帮助。
So that helps.

1458
02:09:25,488 --> 02:09:32,164
同时，你还有保护机制，也就是 IPS，入侵防御系统和入侵检测系统。
