1466
02:09:55,456 --> 02:10:00,964
基本上，它是事件发生的概率或可能性的结合。
Basically, it's a combination of probability of or a likelihood of an event.

1467
02:10:01,326 --> 02:10:09,284
现在，它可以是正面的也可以是负面的，但我们在这里讨论的是已经发生的负面事件。
Right now, even can be positive and negative, but what we are discussing
over here, we're talking about a negative incident, event which has happened.

1468
02:10:09,678 --> 02:10:10,532
这就是风险。
That is a risk.

1469
02:10:10,976 --> 02:10:17,616
关于负面事件，假设我们有一组数据，我们可以讨论两种不同的事件。
With reference to negative incident, let's say uh there is a data which we can have two different incidents talked about.

1470
02:10:17,776 --> 02:10:22,916
假设你的数据中心电源连接中断了。
Let's say your power uh connectivity to the data center goes down.

1471
02:10:23,694 --> 02:10:24,656
这是一个事件，对吧？
It's an event, right?

1472
02:10:24,816 --> 02:10:25,956
一个负面事件。
A negative event.

1473
02:10:26,256 --> 02:10:27,748
那风险是什么？
And what is the risk?

1474
02:10:28,096 --> 02:10:34,736
因为发生了这件事，你的服务器或者网络系统的可用性可能会下降，对吧？
Because that happens, your server uh availability or net system availability may go down, right?

1475
02:10:34,896 --> 02:10:38,576
与此同时，还有硬件损坏发生的可能性。
At the same time, there's a possibility that there's a hardware damage which will happen.

1476
02:10:38,638 --> 02:10:38,939
同意吗？
agree?

1477
02:10:39,216 --> 02:10:40,416
所以这就是风险。
So that's a risk.

1478
02:10:40,654 --> 02:10:41,936
现在，什么是风险？
Now, what is a risk?

1479
02:10:42,176 --> 02:10:45,860
它是这个电力系统会中断的概率。
It is the probability that this power system will go down.

1480
02:10:46,446 --> 02:10:47,296
这就是风险。
That is risk.

1481
02:10:47,438 --> 02:10:48,176
明白了吗？
Do you understand?

1482
02:10:48,416 --> 02:10:53,616
风险本身，是某种事情发生的可能性与这种性质的结合。
Risk as such, it's a combination of likelihood that something will happen of this sort.

1483
02:10:53,696 --> 02:10:54,500
这就是风险。
That is risk.

1484
02:10:55,182 --> 02:10:56,176
它是一个概率。
It's a probability.

1485
02:10:56,336 --> 02:10:56,736
是的。
Yeah.

1486
02:10:56,896 --> 02:11:02,724
现在，在公式的情况下，你可以说风险可以分解为影响和可能性。
Now, in formula's case, you can say risk can be impact into likelihood.

1487
02:11:03,536 --> 02:11:05,924
影响乘以可能性。
Impact multiplied by likelihood.

1488
02:11:06,656 --> 02:11:09,376
发生这种情况的可能性是多少？
What is the possibility of a right?

1489
02:11:09,539 --> 02:11:11,056
现在我们谈到了数据中心。
now We talked about data center.

1490
02:11:11,136 --> 02:11:15,620
现在，这个数据中心里的数据被泄露的可能性是多少？
Now, what is the possibility your data in this data center may be breached?

1491
02:11:15,918 --> 02:11:17,056
这就是可能性。
That's a likelihood.

1492
02:11:17,136 --> 02:11:19,044
它发生的概率是多少？
What is the probability that it will help?

1493
02:11:19,534 --> 02:11:24,416
一旦数据被泄露，对业务本身会有什么影响？
And once the data is breached, what would be impact on the business as such?

1494
02:11:24,576 --> 02:11:26,096
损失会有多大？
How much will be the damage?

1495
02:11:26,176 --> 02:11:27,936
这就是影响，对吧？
That is the impact, right?

1496
02:11:28,096 --> 02:11:33,124
这种损失可以用金钱价值来计算，对吧？
This damage can be calculated in terms of dollar values, money, right?

1497
02:11:33,422 --> 02:11:34,736
或者是名誉损失。
Or reputation as such.

1498
02:11:34,816 --> 02:11:37,188
所以我们上次讨论了 Coca-Cola 的配方。
So we discussed about Coca-Cola's formula last time.

1499
02:11:37,518 --> 02:11:39,940
那么与之相关的风险是什么？
So what is the risk associated to it?

1500
02:11:40,336 --> 02:11:46,340
是这个 Coca-Cola 配方被泄露的可能性，对吧？
It is the likelihood that this Coke's formula is breached, right?

1501
02:11:47,136 --> 02:11:48,096
可能性是多少？
What is the likelihood?

1502
02:11:48,176 --> 02:11:49,476
这是一个百分比数值。
It is a percentage value.

1503
02:11:49,856 --> 02:11:59,936
如果这个配方被泄露，考虑到潜在的损害、金钱损失以及对组织的声誉影响，后果会是什么？
And if this formula is breached, what would be the impact with reference to the
damage potential and the dollar value and reputation loss for the organizations?

1504
02:12:00,256 --> 02:12:00,816
很高，对吧？
High, right?

1505
02:12:01,006 --> 02:12:02,308
所以风险很高。
So the risk is high.

1506
02:12:02,606 --> 02:12:05,764
因为影响更大，可能性就是一种概率。
Because impact is higher, likelihood is a possibility.

1507
02:12:06,256 --> 02:12:09,636
所以影响乘以可能性就得到了风险。
So impact multiplied by likelihood will give you risk.

1508
02:12:09,998 --> 02:12:11,136
现在明白什么是风险了吗？
Do you understand risk now?

1509
02:12:11,296 --> 02:12:13,060
可能性乘以影响。
Likelihood M2 impact.

1510
02:12:13,456 --> 02:12:14,500
这就是风险。
That's risk.

1511
02:12:15,214 --> 02:12:16,804
大家听明白了吗，风险理解了吗？
With me, all of you, risk understood?

1512
02:12:17,582 --> 02:12:18,016
对。
Right.

1513
02:12:18,256 --> 02:12:20,772
所以，呃，我已经举过这个例子了。
So uh I gave this example already.

1514
02:12:21,134 --> 02:12:23,136
就是屏幕上显示的这个内容。
The same thing which is available on the screen.

1515
02:12:23,296 --> 02:12:26,468
呃，服务器是组织的一项资产。
Uh, a server is an asset to the organization.

1516
02:12:26,958 --> 02:12:29,776
关于这个服务器，我在上次讨论中举过这个例子。
In this server, I gave this example during a last discussion.

1517
02:12:30,016 --> 02:12:35,620
在这个服务器中，大约 25% 的数据是未加密格式。
In this server, about 25% of the data is in unencrypted format.

1518
02:12:35,982 --> 02:12:40,964
有 25% 的数据是未加密格式。
There's a 25% data which is in unencrypted format.

1519
02:12:41,582 --> 02:13:00,132
如果某个特定的漏洞，也就是防火墙中的一条弱规则，允许
威胁主体入侵这些数据，好吗，那么这个风险就变成了现实。
And if a particular vulnerability, that is a weak rule in the firewall, allows
a threat agent to compromise this data, okay, then this risk is materialized.

1520
02:13:00,398 --> 02:13:02,176
好，我是在讲术语。
Okay, I am talking about the terminology.

1521
02:13:02,336 --> 02:13:03,296
风险已成真。
Risk is materialized.

1522
02:13:03,376 --> 02:13:07,556
组织会遭受数据损失。
There's a loss of data to the organization.

1523
02:13:08,014 --> 02:13:09,284
那对策是什么？
And what is the countermeasure?

1524
02:13:09,456 --> 02:13:17,860
你基本上要确保防火墙中的弱规则被替换、修改或重新配置。
You basically ensure that the weak rule in the firewall is replaced, amended, reconfigured.

1525
02:13:18,638 --> 02:13:22,016
是的，明白了，好，好。
Yeah, got it okay, okay.

1526
02:13:22,336 --> 02:13:26,692
回到正题，这就是这里的例子。
Coming back to right, so that is the example over here.

1527
02:13:27,296 --> 02:13:29,456
对，这就是风险的例子。
right, so examples of the risk.

1528
02:13:29,536 --> 02:13:39,588
可能是火灾或者威胁主体，威胁主体可以是火灾，也可以
是毫无头绪的用户，或者是缺乏教育、毫无意识的用户。
There could be a fire or threat agent, can be a fire, a clueless user, or uneducated, unaware user can be a threat agent.

1529
02:13:39,982 --> 02:13:40,976
恶意内部人员。
Malicious insider.

1530
02:13:41,056 --> 02:13:51,616
现在有个用户，有个员工因为某些原因没能晋升，可能怀有破坏组织的恶意企图。
Now there's a user, there is an employee who's not promoted due to whatever reason,
has may have malicious intent for compromising the organization.

1531
02:13:52,526 --> 02:13:53,856
这就是恶意内部人员。
So that's a malicious insider.

1532
02:13:54,016 --> 02:14:04,976
黑客就是利用自己的技能破坏组织，从而获取经济利益的人，对吧？
Hacker, someone who has ulterior motives to gain financial benefits by compromising an organization using his or her skills, right?

1533
02:14:05,376 --> 02:14:06,628
这就是黑客。
That is a hacker.

1534
02:14:07,438 --> 02:14:08,228
明白了吗？
Is that clear?

1535
02:14:08,528 --> 02:14:20,528
所以风险可能与自然灾害有关，呃，也可能与员工、
用户、供应商、承包商等人的疏忽有关，对吧？
So a risk can be associated with natural disasters, uh, can be associated
with unawareness of an employee, user, vendor, contractor, human being, right?

1536
02:14:20,688 --> 02:14:24,452
而且也可能与恶意的外部实体有关。
And can be associated a malicious external entity.

1537
02:14:25,262 --> 02:14:29,764
还有技术控制方面，比如你的电力系统或 HVAC 系统可能发生故障。
And the technical option also, wherein your power systems, HVAC systems may fail.

1538
02:14:30,286 --> 02:14:30,928
明白了吗？
You understand?

1539
02:14:31,150 --> 02:14:32,964
这些都是风险的例子。
Those are the examples of risk.

1540
02:14:33,488 --> 02:14:33,956
很好。
Great.

1541
02:14:34,638 --> 02:14:34,848
好的。
Okay.

1542
02:14:35,008 --> 02:14:36,768
我们还讨论了资产。
We also discussed about asset.

1543
02:14:36,928 --> 02:14:40,768
我们呃再讨论一下，资产可以是有的，也可以是无形的。
We are uh rediscussing asset can be tangible, intangible.

1544
02:14:40,928 --> 02:14:45,728
有形的，就是你可以触摸到的东西；无形的，就是我们能理解但无法触摸到的东西。
Tangible, something which you can touch, intangible, something we understand but cannot touch.

1545
02:14:45,808 --> 02:14:45,968
对吧？
Right?

1546
02:14:46,254 --> 02:14:48,368
有形的，你的服务器就是一件有形的东西。
Tangible, your server is a tangible thing.

1547
02:14:48,622 --> 02:14:50,788
服务器里的数据就是一件无形的东西。
The data inside the server is an intangible thing.

1548
02:14:51,022 --> 02:14:54,288
组织的声誉也是一件无形的东西，对吧？
Your reputation of an organization is an intangible thing, right?

1549
02:14:54,928 --> 02:14:55,728
这些都是资产。
This is an asset.

1550
02:14:55,808 --> 02:15:00,900
所以任何对组织有价值的东西都可以被视为资产，对吧？
So anything which has value to the organization can be considered as an asset, right?

1551
02:15:01,678 --> 02:15:07,728
好的，呃，与资产相关，有两个主要的术语我们需要理解。
Okay, uh, in connection with uh asset, there are two major terminologies we should understand.

1552
02:15:07,982 --> 02:15:10,468
一个是敏感度，一个是关键性。
One is sensitivity, one is criticality.

1553
02:15:10,688 --> 02:15:18,128
现在，敏感度就是指信息未经授权泄露可能对组织造成的影响程度。
Now, sensitivity is nothing but a unit of impact that this unauthorized disclosure of information may have an organization.

1554
02:15:18,368 --> 02:15:32,004
也就是说，当风险实现时，这个风险或未经授权的泄露对组织造成的冲击程度就是敏感度。
As in when a risk materializes, the amount of impact this risk or
unauthorized disclosure will have on the organization is sensitivity.

1555
02:15:32,462 --> 02:15:33,648
这就是敏感度。
Is sensitivity.

1556
02:15:34,379 --> 02:15:35,979
我们再来说说关键性本身。
We talk about criticality per se.

1557
02:15:36,398 --> 02:15:41,968
同样，它是衡量系统无法按要求运行对组织造成的影响。
Again, it's a measure of impact that failure of a system to function as required will have an organization.

1558
02:15:42,048 --> 02:15:45,328
所以它决定了资产对业务的重要性。
So it will determine how important an asset is to the business.

1559
02:15:45,408 --> 02:15:47,648
业务还能继续运作吗？
Will the business continue to work or not?

1560
02:15:47,808 --> 02:15:50,048
业务还能继续经营吗？
Will the business continue to business or not?

1561
02:15:50,208 --> 02:15:53,313
业务是否会遭受声誉损失？
Will the business have a reputation loss or not?

1562
02:15:53,582 --> 02:15:56,740
那就是敏感度和关键性。
that is sensitivity and criticality.

1563
02:15:57,102 --> 02:15:57,488
是的。
Yeah.

1564
02:15:57,728 --> 02:15:59,568
好，资产分类。
Okay, asset classification.

1565
02:15:59,728 --> 02:16:06,052
刚才我们讨论了如何盘点组织中的各种资产，对吧？
Now we discussed about uh inventorizing various assets and organization, right?

1566
02:16:06,448 --> 02:16:11,364
当我们盘点资产时，还需要对资产进行优先级排序，对吧？
When we inventorize assets, we also need to prioritize the assets, right?

1567
02:16:11,726 --> 02:16:18,308
而且这种资产优先级排序必须通过特定的进程来完成。
And this prioritization of the assets have uh has to be done in a certain uh using certain processes.

1568
02:16:18,798 --> 02:16:19,568
那该怎么做呢？
So what do you do?

1569
02:16:19,728 --> 02:16:26,288
你要根据业务价值来对资产进行优先级排序，对吧？
You prioritize the asset based on based on the business value, right?

1570
02:16:26,638 --> 02:16:30,928
我们已经讨论过这个了，我相信你们还记得。
Now uh we've already discussed this, and uh, I am sure you remember that.

1571
02:16:31,088 --> 02:16:32,848
业务价值是指什么？
What do you mean by the business value?

1572
02:16:33,008 --> 02:16:38,448
你要问：如果这个资产丢失了，会对业务产生什么影响？
You ask the question what will be the impact on the business if this asset is lost?

1573
02:16:38,766 --> 02:16:40,928
这就给出了业务价值，对吧？
That will give you the business value, right?

1574
02:16:41,248 --> 02:16:47,428
所以 Coca-Cola 的配方具有巨大的业务价值，是高优先级资产。
So Coca-Cola's formula big business value, so high priority asset.

1575
02:16:47,727 --> 02:16:58,688
也许大门上的 CCTV 摄像头坏了，业务价值可能较低，影响也较小，对吧？
Maybe uh a CCTV camera going faulty on the gate, maybe lesser business value, lesser impact, right?

1576
02:16:58,924 --> 02:17:00,516
这就是资产分类。
So that's asset classification.

1577
02:17:01,294 --> 02:17:07,972
现在，业务价值可以根据关键性和敏感度的组合来分配。
Now, this business value can be assigned based on combination of criticality and the sensitivity.

1578
02:17:08,368 --> 02:17:15,620
这也能让我们了解，如果某个特定资产价值较高，它相关的风险是什么？
This will also allow us to understand if a particular asset is of higher value, what are the risks associated with it?

1579
02:17:16,174 --> 02:17:20,128
该资产暴露在多少风险之下？
How much is the asset exposed to a risk?

1580
02:17:20,366 --> 02:17:22,436
可能性是多少，影响是什么？
What is the likelihood, what is the impact?

1581
02:17:22,766 --> 02:17:26,436
哪些人会对这个特定资产感兴趣？
Who all would be interested in this particular asset?

1582
02:17:26,830 --> 02:17:32,548
竞争对手、恶意内部人员、黑客，还有配置错误等等。
The competitors, the malicious insiders, the hackers, yeah, the misconfiguration, so on.

1583
02:17:32,897 --> 02:17:39,325
你知道谁是威胁主体，风险是什么，可能产生什么影响，以及敏感度和关键性是什么。
Do You know who's the threat agent, what is the risk, what could be the impact, and what is the sensitivity and criticality.

1584
02:17:39,406 --> 02:17:42,448
所以当你了解自己的资产是什么时，你就能有所认识。
So you get an understanding when you know what is your asset.

1585
02:17:42,528 --> 02:17:50,276
一旦你知道什么是重要的，那么对我们重要的这些重要事物，威胁又是什么，对吧？
So once you know what is important, would be the threat to that important thing which is important to us, right?

1586
02:17:50,448 --> 02:17:55,940
基于此，我们可以为资产分配分类级别。
And based on that, we can have the classification level assigned to an asset.

1587
02:17:56,608 --> 02:18:06,688
分类可以是秘密、绝密、机密、未分类，就是这类分类。
So the classification can be secret, top secret, confidential, unclass, yeah, that kind of uh classification.

1588
02:18:06,928 --> 02:18:17,156
一旦你知道某个特定数据，比如 Coca-Cola 的配方，是绝密的，它就拥有绝密数据分类。
Once you know that a particular data, Coca-Cola's formula for Coke, is a top secret uh has top secret data classification.

1589
02:18:17,566 --> 02:18:27,406
我们知道只有特定的人可以处理这些数据，并且你应该为这些数据配备必要的保护机制，对吧？
We know that only only certain people can should handle this data and
you should have requisite protection mechanisms on this data, right?

1590
02:18:27,852 --> 02:18:31,683
非常、非常强大的保护机制，其中之一就是加密。
Very, very strong protection mechanisms, one of them being encryptions.

1591
02:18:32,206 --> 02:18:42,500
现在，一旦你知道它的分类级别是什么，有哪些保护机制在起作用，
