system by hacking into it with permission in order to defend the organization.

2666
03:41:37,392 --> 03:41:40,752
这种形式的黑客攻击是完全合法且符合伦理的。
This form of hacking is absolutely legal and ethical.

2667
03:41:40,912 --> 03:41:44,192
因此，他们也经常被称为道德黑客。
Hence, they are also often referred to as ethical hackers.

2668
03:41:44,432 --> 03:41:48,192
除了这些黑客，我们还有灰帽黑客。
In addition to these hackers, we also have the gray hat hackers.

2669
03:41:48,352 --> 03:41:52,832
顾名思义，灰色是白色和黑色的混合。
As the name suggests, the color gray is a blend of both white and black.

2670
03:41:52,992 --> 03:41:59,872
这些黑客发现系统中的漏洞并报告给系统所有者，这本身是件好事。
