他利用客户投资的资金进行在线培训。
He does online training with the money his customers invest.

2676
03:42:24,192 --> 03:42:30,752
一切进展顺利，Dan 的生意正红火，直到一名黑客决定攻击公司的服务器。
Everything was going well, and Dan's business was booming until a hacker decided to hack the company's servers.

2677
03:42:30,992 --> 03:42:34,112
黑客窃取了各种交易账户的凭据。
The hacker stole the credentials of various trading accounts.

2678
03:42:34,272 --> 03:42:38,192
他要求支付一笔巨额赎金来换回被盗的凭据。
He asked for a lump sum ransom in exchange for the stolen credentials.

2679
03:42:38,432 --> 03:42:42,432
Dan 对黑客的话不以为然，没有支付赎金。
Dan took the hacker's words lightly and didn't pay the hacker.

2680
03:42:42,672 --> 03:42:49,552
结果，黑客从各种客户账户中提取了资金，Dan 必须负责赔偿给这些客户。
As a result, the hacker withdrew money from various customers' accounts, and Dan was liable to pay back the customers.

2681
03:42:49,872 --> 03:42:53,712
丹损失了大量的金钱，也失去了客户的信任。
Dan lost a lot of money and also the trust of his customers.

2682
03:42:53,952 --> 03:43:00,352
这次事件后，丹一直在思考公司的安全基础设施出了什么问题。
