In no time, he spotted several vulnerabilities in Dan's organization and closed all the loopholes.

2688
03:43:32,912 --> 03:43:38,352
聘请道德黑客帮助丹在未来保护客户免受进一步的攻击。
Hiring an ethical hacker helped Dan protect his customers from further attacks in the future.

2689
03:43:38,672 --> 03:43:44,192
这反过来提高了公司的生产力，并维护了公司的声誉。
This in turn increased the company's productivity and guarded the company's reputation.

2690
03:43:44,592 --> 03:43:47,792
所以，现在你知道了，黑客攻击并不总是坏事。
So, now you know hacking is not always bad.

