在这一情境中，约翰暴露了现有网络中的漏洞，这种黑客攻击被称为道德黑客。
John, in this scenario, exposed the vulnerabilities in the existing network, and such hacking is known as ethical hacking.

2692
03:43:55,392 --> 03:43:58,752
道德黑客分为六个不同的阶段。
Ethical hacking is distributed into six different phases.

