我们来看看 Kali Linux 的历史，从它的起源故事到目前的漏洞利用
We take a look at the history of Kali Linux from the story of its origin to its current day exploits.

3463
04:57:40,238 --> 04:57:46,596
接下来，我们学习 Kali 的一些独特功能，这些功能使其成为全球渗透测试人员心仪的选择
Next, we learn a few distinct features of Kali that make it an attractive choice for penetration testers worldwide.

3464
