最后，我们看看安装 Kali Linux 的多种方式，以此开启你的渗透测试之旅
Finally, we take a look at the multiple ways we can install Kali Linux to start a journey in the world of penetration testing.

3465
04:57:55,534 --> 04:57:58,276
让我们先从了解 Kali Linux 的概况开始
Let's start by learning about Kali Linux in general.

3466
04:58:00,910 --> 04:58:09,572
Kali Linux 原名 Backtrack Linux，是一个开源 Linux 发行版，
旨在用于高级渗透测试和安全审计
Kali Linux, which is formerly known as Backtrack Linux, is an open source
Linux distribution aimed at advanced penetration testing and security auditing.

3467
04:58:10,606 --> 04:58:21,380
它包含数百种工具，针对各种信息安全任务，如渗透测试、安全研究、计算机取证和逆向工程
It contains several hundred tools that are targeted towards various information security tasks such as penetration testing,
security research, computer forensics, and reverse engineering.

3468
04:58:21,742 --> 04:58:29,764
Kali Linux 是一个多平台解决方案，信息安全专业人员和爱好者都可以轻松获取并免费使用
Kali Linux is a multiple platform solution, accessible and freely available to information security professionals and hobbyists.

3469
04:58:31,278 --> 04:58:36,528
在所有的 Linux 发行版中，Kali Linux 源于 Debian 操作系统
Among all the Linux distributions, Kali Linux takes its roots from the Debian operating system.

3470
04:58:36,974 --> 04:58:44,420
Debian 多年来一直是高度可靠且稳定的发行版，为 Kali 桌面提供了同样强大的基础
Debian has been a highly dependable and stable distribution for many
years, providing a similarly strong foundation to the Kali desktop.

3471
04:58:45,646 --> 04:58:54,308
虽然该操作系统能够修改我们安装的几乎每一个部分，但 Kali 的网络组件默认是禁用的
While the operating system is capable of practically modifying every single part of our installation,
the networking components of Kali become disabled by default.

3472
04:58:54,798 --> 04:59:02,148
这样做是为了防止任何外部因素影响安装过程，这在关键环境中可能会带来风险
This is done to prevent any external factors from affecting the installation procedure which may pose a risk in critical environments.

3473
04:59:02,702 --> 04:59:08,644
除了增强安全性，它还允许最热心的用户拥有更深层次的控制权
Apart from boosting security, it allows a deeper element of control to the most enthusiastic of users.

3474
04:59:11,022 --> 04:59:13,380
Kali Linux 从第一天起就不是现在的样子
We did not get Kali Linux since the first day.

3475
04:59:13,806 --> 04:59:15,408
它是如何诞生的呢？
How did it come into existence?

3476
04:59:15,648 --> 04:59:17,604
让我们来看看它的部分历史
Let's take a look at some of its history.

3477
04:59:20,302 --> 04:59:26,148
Kali Linux 是基于多年在构建渗透测试和操作系统方面的知识和经验
Kali Linux is based on years of knowledge and experience in building penetration, testing, and operating systems.

3478
04:59:26,670 --> 04:59:32,004
在这些项目的整个生命周期中，开发人员一直很少，团队规模一直很小
During all these project lifelines, there have been only a few different developers as the team has always been small.

3479
04:59:32,558 --> 04:59:36,452
第一个项目叫 WAPEx，代表 White Hat Network
The first project was called WAPEx, which stands for White Hat Nopex.

3480
04:59:36,910 --> 04:59:42,340
从名字中可以看出，它是基于 Knopx 操作系统作为底层 OS
As can be inferred from the name, it was based on the Knopx operating system as its underlying OS.

3481
04:59:42,830 --> 04:59:46,788
WAPEX 发布了从 2.0 到 2.7 的版本
WAPEX had releases ranging from version 2.0 to 2.7.

3482
04:59:47,502 --> 04:59:53,220
这为下一个项目让出了空间，它被称为 WAX，或者长名称是 White Hat Slacks
This made way for the next project, which was known as WAX, or the long hand being White Hat Slacks.

3483
04:59:53,550 --> 04:59:57,796
更名是因为基础 OS 从 Knopx 变更为 Slacks
The name change was because the base OS was changed from Knopx to Slacks.

3484
04:59:58,318 --> 05:00:02,276
Wax 从 3 版本开始作为 NOD，它是从 WAPEX 延续下来的。
Wax started at version 3 as a NOD, it carrying on from WAPEX.

3485
05:00:02,958 --> 05:00:11,234
与此同时，还有另一个类似的 OS 在生产，就是 Auditor Security Collection，
通常简称为 Auditor，它同样使用了 NOPIX。
There was a similar OS being produced at the same time, Auditor Security
Collection, often being shorted to just Auditor, which was once again using NOPIX.

3486
05:00:12,270 --> 05:00:15,364
它的成果与 WAX 结合，生产出了 Backtrack。
Its efforts were combined with WAX to produce Backtrack.

3487
05:00:15,854 --> 05:00:22,820
Backtrack 从 1 版本到 3 版本基于 Slackware，但从 4 版本到 5 版本切换到了 Ubuntu。
Backtrack was based on Slackware from version 1 to version 3, but switched to Ubuntu later on with version 4 to version 5.

3488
05:00:23,342 --> 05:00:28,868
利用从这些经历中获得的经验，Kali Linux 在 2013 年诞生于 Backtrack 之后。
Using the experience gained from all of this, Kali Linux came after Backtrack in 2013.

3489
05:00:29,328 --> 05:00:37,412
Kali 最初使用 Debian stable 作为底层引擎，在 Kali
Linux 变成滚动更新操作系统时，切换到了 Debian testing。
Kali started off using Debian stable as the engine under the hood before
moving to Debian testing when Kali Linux became a rolling operating system.

3490
05:00:39,598 --> 05:00:46,148
既然我们了解了 Kali Linux 的历史和用途，让我们进一步了解一下它的独特功能。
Now that we understand the history and the purpose of Kali Linux, let us learn a little more about its distinct features.

3491
05:00:48,686 --> 05:00:53,412
最新版本的 Kali 预装了 600 多种渗透测试工具。
The latest version of Kali comes with more than 600 penetration tools pre-installed.

3492
05:00:54,062 --> 05:01:05,988
在审查了 Backtrack 中包含的每种工具后，开发人员剔除了大量要么根本无法运行，
要么与提供相同或类似功能的其他工具重复的工具。
After reviewing every tool that was included in Backtrack, developers have eliminated a great number of tools that either simply did
not work or which duplicated other tools that provided the same or similar functionality.

3493
05:01:08,334 --> 05:01:19,428
Kali Linux 团队由一小群人组成，他们是唯一被信任提交软件包并与软件源交互的人，
所有操作都是通过多种安全协议完成的。
The Kali Linux team is made up of a small group of individuals who are the only ones trusted to commit packages and interact with the
repositories, all of which is done using multiple secure protocols.

3494
05:01:19,822 --> 05:01:32,196
限制外部资产访问关键代码库，可以大大降低源码污染的风险，
否则全球的 Kali Linux 用户可能会作为网络犯罪的直接受害者遭受巨大损失。
Restricting access of critical code bases to external assets greatly reduces the risk of source contamination,
which can cause Kali Linux users worldwide a great deal of damage as a direct victim of cybercrime.

3495
05:01:34,830 --> 05:01:46,980
虽然渗透测试工具往往是用英文编写的，但开发人员确保了 Kali 支持真正的多语言，
允许更多用户使用母语操作并找到他们需要的工具。
Although penetration tools tend to be written in English, the developers have ensured that Kali includes true multilingual support,
allowing more users to operate in their native language and locate the tools they need for the job.

3496
05:01:47,328 --> 05:01:56,164
用户对操作系统的复杂细节越熟悉，就越容易掌控配置和设备本身。
The more comfortable a user feels with the intricacies of the operating system, the
easier it is to maintain a stronghold over the configuration and the device in general.

3497
05:01:58,414 --> 05:02:12,036
由于像 Raspberry Pi 这样的基于 ARM 的单板计算机变得越来越普及且廉价，
开发团队知道 Kali 的 ARM 支持需要尽可能稳健，并实现完全可用的安装。
Since ARM-based single board systems like the Raspberry Pi are becoming more and more prevalent and inexpensive,
the development team knew that Kali's ARM support would need to be as robust as they could manage with fully working installations.

3498
05:02:12,750 --> 05:02:24,196
Kali Linux 可在广泛的 ARM 设备上运行，并且其 ARM 软件源已与主发行版集成，
因此 ARM 工具会与发行版的其他部分同步更新。
Kali Linux is available on a wide range of ARM devices and has ARM repositories integrated with the mainline distributions,
so the tools for ARM are updated in conjunction with the rest of the distribution.

3499
05:02:25,102 --> 05:02:30,308
这些信息对于用户判断 Kali Linux 是否是正确的选择非常必要。
All this information is necessary for users to determine if Kali Linux is the correct choice for them.

3500
05:02:30,848 --> 05:02:36,644
如果是的话，他们可以通过哪些方式进行安装并开始他们的渗透测试之旅呢？
If it is, what are the ways that they can go forward with this installation and start their penetration testing journey?

3501
05:02:37,774 --> 05:02:42,596
使用 Kali Linux 的第一种方法是启动发行版的 Live USB 模式。
The first way to use Kali Linux is by launching the distribution in the live USB mode.

3502
05:02:42,926 --> 05:02:52,612
这可以通过从 Kali Linux 网站下载安装镜像文件或 ISO 文件，
并将其烧录到容量至少为 8 GB 的 USB 驱动器上来实现。
This can be achieved by downloading the installer image file or the ISO file from the
Kali Linux website and flashing it to a USB drive with a capacity of at least 8 GB.

3503
05:02:53,326 --> 05:02:59,396
有些人不需要永久保存那些数据，在这种情况下，Live USB 是完美的解决方案。
Some people don't need to save that data permanently, and a live USB is the perfect solution for such cases.

3504
05:02:59,918 --> 05:03:11,524
ISO 镜像烧录完成后，可以使用该 U 盘启动一个完全可用的操作系统安装，但需要注意的是，
在此模式下对 OS 做出的任何更改都不会被永久写入。
After the ISO image is flashed, the thumb drive can be used to boot a fully working installation of the operating system with the
caveat that any changes made to the OS in this mode are not written permanently.

3505
05:03:11,822 --> 05:03:18,468
某些情况允许在 Live USB 中进行持久化使用，但这些情况比正常情况需要更多的配置。
Some cases allow persistent usage in live USBs, but those require further configuration than normal situations.

3506
05:03:19,310 --> 05:03:23,204
但如果用户想在安装的 OS 中永久存储数据呢？
But what if the user wants to store data permanently in the installed OS?

3507
05:03:23,694 --> 05:03:28,676
确保这一点最好且最可靠的方法是完整的硬盘安装。
The best and the most reliable way to ensure this is the full-fledged hard disk installation.

3508
05:03:29,198 --> 05:03:37,252
这将确保完全利用系统的硬件能力，并且会考虑到对 OS 进行的所有更新和配置。
This will ensure the complete usage of the system's hardware capabilities and
will take into account the updates and the configurations being made to the OS.

3509
05:03:37,582 --> 05:03:45,412
此方法旨在覆盖电脑上任何预先安装的操作系统，无论是 Windows 还是任何其他 Linux 变体。
This method is supposed to override any pre-existing operating system
installed on the computer, be it Windows or any other variant of Linux.

3510
05:03:46,510 --> 05:03:53,668
安装 Kali Linux 的下一个替代路线是使用 VMware 或 VirtualBox 等虚拟化软件。
The next alternative route for installing Kali Linux would be to use virtualization software such as VMware or VirtualBox.

3511
05:03:54,126 --> 05:04:03,588
该软件将作为独立应用程序安装在现有的 OS 上，Kali
Linux 可以作为窗口在同一台电脑上运行为一个操作系统。
The software will be installed as a separate application on an already existing OS,
and Kali Linux can be run as an operating system in the same computer as a window.

3512
05:04:04,206 --> 05:04:10,340
硬件要求将完全可自定义，从分配的 RAM 到虚拟硬盘容量。
The hardware requirements will be completely customizable, starting with the allotted RAM to the virtual hard disk capacity.

3513
05:04:11,342 --> 05:04:19,844
同时使用主机和像 Kali Linux 这样的客户机操作系统，可
以让用户在不让系统面临风险的情况下获得安全的学习环境。
The usage of both a host and guest operating system like Kali Linux allows
users a safe environment to learn while not putting their systems at risk.

3514
05:04:20,430 --> 05:04:30,212
如果你想了解更多关于如何使用这种方法的细节，我们有一段专门的视频，
展示了如何在 Windows 10 操作系统上运行并安装 VMware 中的 Kali Linux。
If you want to learn more about how one can go forward with this method, we have a dedicated video where Kali Linux is being installed
on VMware while running on a Windows 10 operating system.

