Another very important command for Linux operating system is the sudo command.

3980
06:00:29,102 --> 06:00:31,428
Sudo 是 超级用户执行 的缩写
Sudo is short for super user do.

3981
06:00:32,014 --> 06:00:36,356
这个命令能让你执行需要管理员权限或 root权限的任务
The command enables you to perform tasks that require administrative or root permissions.

3982
06:00:36,878 --> 06:00:40,868
你可以把它理解为我们在 Windows 系统上以管理员身份运行程序
You can think of it as how we run programs as administrator on Windows systems.

3983
06:00:41,232 --> 06:00:46,468
不建议在日常使用中频繁使用这个命令，因为很容易出错
It is not advisable to use this command for daily use because it might be easy for an error to occur.

3984
06:00:46,832 --> 06:00:50,032
而且 root 的权限非常复杂
And the permissions of root are very intricate.

3985
06:00:50,350 --> 06:00:55,780
所以建议初学者仅在绝对必要时才使用 sudo 命令
So new beginners are advised to use the sudo command only when absolutely necessary.

3986
06:00:56,192 --> 06:00:59,072
例如，sudo su
For example, sudo su.

3987
06:00:59,982 --> 06:01:04,324
通过这个命令，我赋予了这个终端 root权限
With this command, I am giving this terminal a root permission.

3988
06:01:04,942 --> 06:01:06,788
这个 SU 代表这个用户
This SU stands for this user.

3989
06:01:08,014 --> 06:01:10,628
此时，它会要求我输入管理员密码
At this point, it's going to ask for my admin password.

3990
06:01:11,822 --> 06:01:17,252
输入密码后，我现在就拥有了根权限
Once I enter my password, and I now have root access.

3991
06:01:17,678 --> 06:01:20,272
注意，我输入的密码在这里并没有显示出来
Note how the password that I entered did not show up here.

3992
06:01:20,366 --> 06:01:26,244
这是一种安全措施，防止别人窥探你的 root密码，而这是整个操作系统的核心
This is a security measure to prevent people from snooping on your root password, which is the end game of all this operating system.

3993
06:01:26,670 --> 06:01:28,932
如你所见，符号也变了
As you also can see, the symbol changed.

3994
06:01:29,198 --> 06:01:32,100
如果显示美元符号，表示是标准用户
If the dollar symbol is showing, it shows as a standard user.

3995
