当你切换到 root 时，你可以很容易看到哈希符号
When you switch to root, you can easily see a hash symbol.

3996
06:01:41,422 --> 06:01:45,412
这在这个终端命令中开启了一个独立的壳
This opens up a separate shell inside this terminal command.

3997
