For example, when updating the Kali Linux system, we have to use apt update.

4001
06:02:07,790 --> 06:02:12,388
如你所见，它提示由于权限被拒绝，无法取消链接文件
As you can see it says problem unlinking the file because permission denied.

4002
06:02:12,718 --> 06:02:14,724
现在让我们试着用 sudo 来执行这个命令。
Now let's try this using sudo.

4003
