4004
06:02:21,902 --> 06:02:27,556
如你所见，它正在更新软件包仓库，这些仓库就是系统中安装的软件。
As you can see, it is updating the package repositories which work as the software installed on the system.

4005
06:02:28,814 --> 06:02:38,340
这可以通过两种方式完成：要么是我们每次想要获取根权限时都加上 sudo 命令，
要么是先输入一次 sudo su，然后再单独输入 apt update。
This can be done using either writing the sudo command every time we want to perform a root access,
or we can just write sudo su once and write apt update alone.

4006
06:02:41,358 --> 06:02:42,820
这里的获取已经完成了。
The fetching is complete over here.

4007
06:02:46,062 --> 06:02:58,112
对于第二个例子，假设我只输入 sudo su，这次它不会再要求我输入密码，
因为在当前的终端进程中，我已经输入过一次 root密码了，它现在还在内存里。
For the second example, let's say I just write sudo su and this time it is not going to ask me the password because at this current
terminal process I have already provided the root password once and it is in memory right now.

4008
06:02:58,352 --> 06:03:03,232
现在当我们更新系统时，我们必须输入 sudo apt update。
Now when we used to update the system, we had to write sudo apt update.

