代理是指通过多个机器转发你的网络流量，以此隐藏原始机器身份的技术。
Proxying refers to the technique of bouncing your internet traffic
through multiple machines to hide the identity of the original machine.

4038
06:05:47,440 --> 06:05:52,100
黑客用来实现这一目标的一个好工具就是代理链。
It is a good tool that hackers use to accomplish this goal is proxy chains.

4039
06:05:52,974 --> 06:05:56,932
本质上，你可以使用代理链通过代理服务器运行任何程序。
Essentially, you can use proxy chains to run any program through a proxy server.

4040
06:05:57,360 --> 06:06:02,724
这将允许你在受限的防火墙后访问互联网，同时隐藏你的 IP 地址。
This will allow you to access internet from behind a restrictive firewall which hides your IP address.

4041
06:06:03,040 --> 06:06:08,036
ProxyChains 甚至允许你通过将多个代理串联在一起来同时使用它们。
ProxyChains even allows you to use multiple proxies at once by chaining them together.

4042
06:06:08,782 --> 06:06:15,492
代理链在安全领域被广泛使用的一个最重要原因是它很容易规避检测。
One of the most important reasons that proxy chains is used in a security context is that it's easy to evade detection.

4043
06:06:15,840 --> 06:06:20,996
攻击者经常使用代理来隐藏他们的真实身份并执行攻击。
Attackers often use proxies to hide their true identities while executing an attack.

4044
06:06:24,960 --> 06:06:33,668
当多个代理串联在一起时，取证专家就越来越难追踪流量到原始机器。
And when multiple proxies are chained together, it becomes harder and harder
for forensic professional to trace the traffic back to the original machine.

4045
06:06:34,254 --> 06:06:42,052
当这些代理分布在不同国家时，调查人员必须在每个代理所在的本地司法管辖区获取授权。
When these proxies are located across countries, investigators would have to
obtain warranties in the local jurisdictions where every proxy is located.

