如果你经常练习这些工具，它将帮助你提高技能，同
时也会帮助你理解道德黑客和保障系统安全的重要性。
If you do a regular practice with these tools, it will help you to improve your skill,
and it is also going to help you to understand the importance of ethical hacking and securing systems.

4962
07:45:39,950 --> 07:45:42,852
