Firstly, let us have a quick introduction to what cyber attacks are.

4963
07:45:43,246 --> 07:45:51,268
现在，数字时代的兴起带来了前所未有的连接性和便利性，
但它也为恶意行为者利用漏洞开辟了新的途径。
Now, the rise of the digital age has brought unprecedented connectivity and convenience,
but it has also introduced new avenues for malicious actors to exploit vulnerabilities.

4964
07:45:51,662 --> 07:46:00,320
网络攻击涵盖广泛的恶意活动，其中对手利用技术来渗透、破坏或破坏数字系统和数据。
Cyberattacks encompasses a broad range of malicious activities where adversaries
leverage technology to infiltrate, disrupt, or compromise digital systems and data.

4965
07:46:00,560 --> 07:46:12,720
简而言之，你可以说这是故意且恶意的企图，旨在破坏计算机系统、网络或设备，
目的是造成伤害、窃取敏感信息或获取任何形式的未经授权的访问。
So, in a nutshell, you can say it is a deliberate and malicious attempt to compromise computer systems, networks,
or devices with the intention of causing harm, stealing sensitive information, or gaining any kind of unauthorized access.

4966
07:46:13,422 --> 07:46:22,944
话虽如此，随着网络攻击变得越来越普遍和严重，解决网
络安全技能差距并克服网络安全人才短缺变得至关重要。
Now, having said that, with cyber attacks becoming more prevalent and severe, it has become crucial to address the cybersecurity skill
gap and overcome the shortage of cybersecurity talent.

4967
