Similarly, to calculate the value of the second output that is s, we use the following formula that is shown on the screen.

5499
08:34:26,126 --> 08:34:29,952
签名随后可以打包成一个包含 R 和 S 的组合。
The signature can then be packaged as a bundle having R and S.

5500
08:34:32,974 --> 08:34:37,252
这个组合连同明文消息一起发送给接收者。
This bundle along with the plain text message is then passed on to the receiver.

5501
08:34:39,310 --> 08:34:42,212
现在进入第三个阶段，我们需要验证签名。
Now with the third phase, we have to verify the signature.

5502
08:34:42,734 --> 08:34:48,036
我们首先通过相同的哈希函数计算收到的组合中的消息摘要。
We first calculate the message digest received in the bundle by passing it to the same hash function.

5503
08:34:48,846 --> 08:34:55,012
我们使用屏幕上显示的公式计算 W、U1 和 U2 的值。
We calculate the value of W, U1, and U2 using the formulas shown on the screen.

5504
08:34:55,790 --> 08:35:02,308
我们需要计算一个验证组件，然后将其与发送者发送的 R 值进行比较。
We have to calculate a verification component which is then to be compared with the value of R being sent by the sender.

5505
08:35:02,862 --> 08:35:06,852
这个验证组件可以使用以下公式计算。
This verification component can be calculated using the following formula.

5506
08:35:07,758 --> 08:35:11,300
计算完成后，可以将其与 R 值进行比较。
Once calculated, this can be compared with the value of R.

5507
08:35:11,566 --> 08:35:22,980
如果数值匹配，则签名验证成功，我们的整个流程就
完成了，从密钥生成到签名生成，一直到签名的验证。
If the values match, then the signature verification is successful and our entire process is complete starting from key generation to
the signature generation all the way up to the verification of the signature.

5508
08:35:26,478 --> 08:35:32,996
由于有这么多步骤需要遵循，我们肯定拥有一些优势来推动这个过程，我们的想法是正确的。
With so many steps to follow, we are bound to have a few advantages to boot this, and we would be right to think so.

5509
08:35:33,806 --> 08:35:41,412
与其他的签名验证算法相比，DSA 在安全性和稳定性方面非常强健。
DSA is highly robust in the security and stability aspect when compared to alternative signature verification algorithms.

5510
08:35:41,934 --> 08:35:49,988
我们还有其他一些密码算法旨在实现 DSA 的简洁性和灵活性，
但对所有其他方案来说这都是个难题。
We have a few other ciphers that aim to achieve the simplicity and the flexibility of DSA,
but it has been a tough ask for all the other suits.

5511
08:35:51,502 --> 08:35:56,100
与 RSA 等算法相比，它的密钥生成速度要快得多。
The key generation is much faster when compared to the RSA algorithm and such.

5512
08:35:56,590 --> 08:36:05,668
虽然实际的加密和解密过程可能会稍逊一筹，但众所周知，更快的初始启动可以优化很多框架。
While the actual encryption and decryption process may falter a little in comparison,
a quicker start in the beginning is well known to optimize a lot of frameworks.

5513
08:36:07,246 --> 08:36:10,916
DSA 在完成整个周期时需要的存储空间更少。
DSA requires less storage space to work its entire cycle.

5514
08:36:11,566 --> 08:36:20,324
相比之下，它的直接对应算法，即 RSA 算法，需要一定数量的计算和存储空间才能高效运行。
In contrast, its direct correspondent, i.e. RSA algorithm, needs a
certain amount of computational and storage space to function efficiently.

5515
08:36:20,846 --> 08:36:26,532
DSA的情况并非如此，它经过优化，可以在较弱的硬件和较少的资源下运行。
This is not the case with DSA, which has been optimized to work with weaker hardware and lesser resources.

5516
08:36:28,014 --> 08:36:33,476
DSA是专利技术，但 NIST 已将其专利在全球范围内免版税开放。
The DSA is patented, but NIST has made this patent available worldwide royalty free.

5517
08:36:34,062 --> 08:36:47,300
FIPS 1865 的草案版本表明，DSA 将不再被批准用于数字签名生成，
但它仍可用于验证在该标准实施日期之前生成的签名。
A draft version of the speculation FIPS 1865 indicates that DSA will no longer be approved for digital signature generation,
but it may be used to verify signatures generated prior to the implementation date of that standard.

5518
08:36:51,054 --> 08:36:58,500
RSA 算法是由 Ron Revest、Adi Shamir 和 Leonard Edelman 开发的公钥签名算法。
The RSA algorithm is a public key signature algorithm developed by Ron Revest, Adi Shamir, and Leonard Edelman.

5519
08:36:59,342 --> 08:37:11,204
该论文最早于 1977 年发表，该算法使用对数函数来保持足够的复杂度以抵御暴力破解，
同时确保在部署后足够精简以实现快速运行。
The paper was first published in 1977, and the algorithm uses logarithmic functions to keep the working complex enough to withstand
brute force and streamlined enough to be fast post-deployment.

5520
08:37:11,918 --> 08:37:19,588
RSA 还可以对通用信息进行加密和解密，以安全地交换数据，同时处理数字签名验证。
RSA can also encrypt and decrypt general information to securely exchange data along with handling digital signature verification.

5521
08:37:20,080 --> 08:37:22,052
让我们来看看它是如何实现的。
Let us understand how it achieved this.

5522
08:37:22,766 --> 08:37:30,980
我们获取明文消息 M，将其通过哈希函数生成摘要 H，然后使用发送者的私钥对其进行加密。
We take our plain text message M, we pass it through a hash function to generate the digest H,
which is then encrypted using the sender's private key.

5523
08:37:31,566 --> 08:37:36,000
这被附加到原始明文消息中，并发送给接收者。
This is appended to the original plain text message and sent over to the receiver.

5524
08:37:36,974 --> 08:37:47,200
接收者收到数据包后，我们可以将明文消息通过相同的哈希函数生成摘要，
而密文可以使用发送者的公钥进行解密。
Once the receiver receives the bundle, we can pass the plain text message to the same hash function to generate a digest and the
ciphertext can be decrypted using the public key of the sender.

5525
08:37:47,360 --> 08:37:49,220
然后对比剩余的哈希值。
The remaining hashes are compared.

5526
08:37:49,520 --> 08:37:54,880
如果数值匹配，则数据完整性得到验证，且发送者的身份得到验证。
If the values match, then the data integrity is verified and the sender is authenticated.

5527
08:37:55,086 --> 08:38:03,492
除了数字签名，RSA 的主要用途是在通过通信信道传输之前，对私密信息进行加密和解密。
Apart from digital signatures, the main case of RSA is encryption and decryption
of private information before being transmitted across communication channel.

5528
08:38:04,206 --> 08:38:06,560
这就是数据加密发挥作用的地方。
This is where the data encryption comes into play.

5529
08:38:06,894 --> 08:38:12,292
当使用 RSA 对通用数据进行加密和解密时，它会反转密钥集的用法。
When using RSA for encryption and decryption of general data, it reverses the key set usage.

5530
08:38:12,686 --> 08:38:21,412
与签名验证不同，它接收接收者的公钥来加密数据，并使用接收者的私钥来解密数据。
Unlike signature verification, it receives the receiver's public key to
encrypt the data and uses the receiver's private key in decrypting the data.

5531
08:38:21,806 --> 08:38:25,028
因此，在这种情况下不需要交换任何密钥。
Thus, there is no need to exchange any keys in this scenario.

5532
08:38:25,294 --> 08:38:28,560
RSA 密码学包含两个主要的组成部分。
There are two broad components when it comes to RSA cryptography.

5533
08:38:28,720 --> 08:38:30,240
其中之一是密钥生成。
One of them is key generation.

5534
08:38:30,480 --> 08:38:38,468
密钥生成包含生成私钥和公钥的步骤，这些密钥将用于数据的加密和解密。
Key generation employs a step of generating the private and the public
keys that are going to be used for encrypting and decrypting the data.

5535
08:38:39,040 --> 08:38:42,400
第二部分是加密和解密函数。
The second part is the encryption and decryption functions.

5536
08:38:42,560 --> 08:38:49,156
这些是在对数据进行混淆或从密文中恢复数据时需要运行的密码算法和步骤。
These are the ciphers and steps that need to be run when scrambling the data or recovering the data from the ciphertext.

5537
08:38:49,614 --> 08:38:52,868
在下一个子话题中，你将了解其中的每一个步骤。
You will now understand each of these steps in our next subtopic.

5538
08:38:53,230 --> 08:39:03,140
记住前两个概念，让我们继续看看整个流程是如何运作的，从创建密钥对到信息的加密和解密。
Keeping the previous two concepts in mind, let us go ahead and see how the entire process works,
starting from creating the key pair to encrypting and decrypting the information.

5539
08:39:04,160 --> 08:39:10,212
在运行生成密文和明文的函数之前，你需要生成公钥和私钥。
You need to generate the public and private keys before running the functions to generate ciphertext and plaintext.

5540
08:39:10,510 --> 08:39:13,956
它们使用某些变量和参数，所有这些都会得到解释。
They use certain variables and parameters, all of which are explained.

5541
08:39:14,640 --> 08:39:19,300
我们首先使用两个大的质数，可以表示为 P 和 Q。
We first use two large prime numbers which can be denoted by P and Q.

5542
08:39:20,078 --> 08:39:27,748
我们可以计算 n 的值，即 n 等于 p 乘以 q，并计算 z 的值，即 p 减 1 乘以 q 减 1。
We can compute the value of n as n equal to p into q and compute the value of z as p minus 1 into q minus 1.

5543
08:39:28,654 --> 08:39:41,060
随机选择一个满足以下条件的数字 e，同时按照公式 ed 取模 z
等于 1 随机选择一个数字 d，它可以用下面的公式计算出来。
A number e is chosen at random satisfying the following conditions, and a number d is also selected at random following the formula ed
mod z equal to 1 and it can be calculated with the formula given below.

5544
08:39:42,000 --> 08:39:49,924
公钥随后被打包成包含 n 和 e 的组合，而私钥被打包成包含 n 和 d 的组合。
The public key is then packaged as a bundle with n and e and the private key is packaged as a bundle using n and d.

5545
08:39:51,054 --> 08:39:53,156
这就是密钥生成过程的总结。
This sums up the key generation process.

5546
08:39:54,222 --> 08:39:58,880
对于加密和解密函数，我们使用公式 c 和 m。
For the encryption and decryption function, we use the formula c and m.

5547
08:39:59,438 --> 08:40:09,120
密文可以计算为 c 等于 m 的 e 次方模 n，而明文可以从密文计算为 c 的 d 次方模 n。
The ciphertext can be calculated as c equal to m to the power e mod n and
the plaintext can be calculated from the ciphertext as c power d mod n.

5548
08:40:09,582 --> 08:40:14,948
在数据加密的例子中，我们假设 P 和 Q 分别为 7 和 13。
When it comes to a data encryption example, let's take P and Q as 7 and 13.

5549
08:40:15,470 --> 08:40:18,404
n 的值可以计算为 91。
The value of n can be calculated as 91.

5550
08:40:19,310 --> 08:40:24,420
如果我们选择 E 的值为 5，它符合我们所需的所有标准。
If we select the value of E to be 5, it satisfies all the criteria that we need it to.

5551
