It can be done actively or passively or both.

6629
10:42:42,990 --> 10:42:49,156
它帮助安全公司收集有关目标系统、网络组件、活动机器等信息。
It helps security firms gather information about the target system, network components, active machines, etc.

6630
10:42:49,998 --> 10:42:54,884
这项活动可以通过利用公开可用的信息和使用不同的工具来执行。
This activity can be performed by using the information publicly available and by using different tools.

6631
10:42:56,334 --> 10:42:59,716
扫描阶段更偏向于工具操作，而不是手动执行。
The scanning phase is more tool-oriented rather than being performed manually.

6632
10:43:00,686 --> 10:43:04,164
测试人员运行一个或多个扫描器工具来收集更多关于目标的信息。
The tester runs one or more scanner tools to gather more information about the target.

6633
10:43:04,878 --> 10:43:17,412
通过使用各种扫描器，如拨号器、端口扫描器、网络映射工具和漏洞扫描器，
渗透测试人员收集尽可能多的漏洞，从而帮助以更高级的方式攻击目标。
By using various scanners such as wall dialers, port scanners, network mappers, and vulnerability scanners,
the penetration tester collects as many vulnerabilities which help in turn to attack a target in a more sophisticated manner.

6634
10:43:19,726 --> 10:43:27,364
在获取权限阶段，渗透测试人员尝试与目标建立连接，并利用在前一阶段发现的漏洞。
