6636
10:43:34,926 --> 10:43:41,252
基本上，渗透测试人员通过使用不同的工具获取权限，从服务器中提取信息和敏感数据。
Basically, the penetration tester extracts information and sensitive data from the servers by gaining access with different tools.

6637
10:43:42,286 --> 10:43:46,916
在维持权限阶段，渗透测试人员会尝试为自己创建一个后门。
In the maintaining access phase, the penetration tester tries to create a backdoor for himself.

6638
10:43:47,534 --> 10:43:54,820
这有助于他识别系统中的隐藏漏洞，同时让他能够再次进入系统以获取更多数据。
It helps him to identify hidden vulnerabilities in the system while
allowing him to come back to the system to retrieve more data further on.

6639
10:43:57,006 --> 10:44:04,356
在清除痕迹阶段，测试人员会尝试删除所有日志和痕迹，以免管理员发现他的存在。
In the clearing tax phase, the tester tries to remove all logs and
footprints which might help the administrator identify his presence.

6640
10:44:05,006 --> 10:44:10,052
这有助于测试人员像黑客一样思考，并采取纠正措施来缓解这些活动。
This helps the tester to think like a hacker and perform corrective actions to mitigate those activities.

6641
