10:47:42,382 --> 10:47:46,788
SYN扫描是最有用的 Nmap 扫描类型，而且它的运行非常隐蔽。
The SYN scan is the most useful type of Nmap scan which does work very quietly.

6669
10:47:47,086 --> 10:47:53,444
它通过 TCP 协议或传输控制协议向所有目标端口发送一个 SYN 数据包。
It sends an SYN packet via the TCP protocol or the transfer control protocol to all the intended ports.

6670
10:47:53,998 --> 10:47:58,468
如果系统收到了确认包，那么可以确定该端口是开放的。
If an acknowledgement pack is received to the system, it is sure that a port is opened there.

6671
10:47:58,990 --> 10:48:02,276
如果没有响应，意味着该端口是关闭的或者不可用的。
No response means that the port is either closed or not available.

6672
10:48:02,830 --> 10:48:07,652
在这种情况下，确认包不会发回给系统，因为假设连接是无效的。
Here the acknowledgement pack is not sent back to the system, assuming that the connection is not valid.

6673
10:48:08,558 --> 10:48:15,172
这种扫描不会出现在大多数扫描日志中，因此使用 SYN 扫描来识别开放端口是安全的。
The scan is not shown in most of the scan logs and hence it is safe to use SYN scan to identify the open ports.

6674
10:48:17,102 --> 10:48:24,164
TCP连接扫描在许多方面与 SYN 扫描相似，因为它使用 TCP 层发送数据包并传递到所有端口。
The TCP Connect scan is similar to SYN scan in many aspects as it uses the TCP layer to send packets and is passed to all the ports.

6675
10:48:24,784 --> 10:48:29,444
这里的区别在于，通过发送确认包来完成完整的连接。
Here, the difference is that the full connection is done by sending the acknowledgement packets back.

6676
10:48:30,030 --> 10:48:36,484
