RPC 扫描或远程过程调用是由黑客执行的，目的是让系统容易受到病毒攻击。
The RPC scans or remote procedure calls are done by hackers to make the system vulnerable to virus attacks.

6683
10:49:17,710 --> 10:49:22,660
因此，有必要知道我们的系统是否会响应此类调用，以及是否会让我们的系统暴露给恶意软件。
It is thus necessary to know whether our systems answer such calls and make our system open to malware.

6684
10:49:23,694 --> 10:49:28,804
RPC 扫描通过查找由 RPC 运行特定命令时开放的端口来检查这一点。
RPC scan is done to check this by finding the ports open with certain commands being run by RPC.

6685
10:49:30,126 --> 10:49:37,124
Windows 扫描是一种简单的扫描，应用程序在发送 SYN 数据包后，会扫描从端口接收到的确认包。
The Windows scan is a simple scan where the application scans the
acknowledgement packets received from the ports once the SYN packets are sent.

6686
10:49:37,646 --> 10:49:45,508
如果接收到的 ACK 数据包有任何异常，扫描会报告
出来，并帮助识别哪些端口是以不同方式运行的。
If there are any abnormalities in the ACK packets received, the scan reports the
