11:22:02,222 --> 11:22:08,900
除了增强安全性，它还为最资深的用户的安全控制提供了更深层次的元素。
Apart from boosting security, it allows a more profound element of security control to the most enthusiastic of users.

6948
11:22:11,246 --> 11:22:14,404
现在，让我们来看看 Parrot Security Operating System。
Now, let's take a look at Parrot Security Operating System.

6949
11:22:25,230 --> 11:22:29,952
它是基于 Debian 的测试分支构建的，并使用自定义的加固的Linux内核。
It is built on the Debian's testing branch and uses a custom hardened Linux kernel.

6950
11:22:31,598 --> 11:22:41,252
Parrot Security 包含数百种工具，针对渗透测试、计算机取证、逆向工程和安全研究等任务。
Parrot Security contains several hundred tools targeted towards tasks such as
penetration testing, computer forensics, reverse engineering, and security research.

6951
11:22:41,550 --> 11:22:47,524
它被认为是一个普遍轻量级的发行版，可以在严格的硬件和软件规范下运行。
It is seen as a generally lightweight distribution that can work under rigorous hardware and software specifications.

6952
11:22:48,654 --> 11:22:59,300
它具有独特的取证模式，不会挂载系统的任何硬盘或分
区，且不会影响宿主机，这使其比常规模式更具隐蔽性。
It features a distinct forensics mode that does not mount any of the system's hard disks or partitions and has no influence on the
host system, making it much more stealthy than its regular occurrence.

6953
11:22:59,888 --> 11:23:03,940
此模式用于在宿主机上执行取证流程。
This mode is used on the host system to execute forensic procedures.

6954
11:23:05,486 --> 11:23:12,676
滚动更新是一种软件开发模式，软件升级是不断推出的，而不是按版本批量发布的。
A rolling release is a paradigm in which software upgrades are rolled out
constantly rather than in batches of versions in software development.

6955
11:23:13,390 --> 11:23:16,388
这确保了软件始终保持最新状态。
This ensures that the software is constantly up to date.

6956
11:23:16,814 --> 11:23:21,316
像 Pirate Security OS 这样的滚动更新发行版遵循同样的理念。
A rolling release distribution such as Pirate Security OS follows the same concept.

6957
11:23:22,062 --> 11:23:26,916
它在最新的 Linux 内核和软件版本发布时，就能提供这些最新版本。
It provides the most recent Linux kernel and software versions as soon as they become available.

6958
11:23:29,390 --> 11:23:37,796
在简单介绍了这些操作系统之后，让我们来看看
