With a basic introduction to the operating systems out of the way, let us
take a look at the unique features of both Kali Linux and Parrot Security OS.

6959
11:23:43,790 --> 11:23:48,804
最新版本的 Kali Linux 预装了 600 多种渗透测试工具。
The latest version of Kali Linux comes with more than 600 penetration tools pre-installed.

6960
11:23:49,422 --> 11:24:01,572
在审查了 Backtrack 中的每种工具后，开发人员剔除了大量要么根本无法工作，
