After reviewing every tool included in Backtrack, developers have eliminated a significant number of tools that either simply did not
work or duplicated other tools that provided the same and similar functionality.

6961
11:24:02,766 --> 11:24:13,860
Kali Linux 团队由一小群人组成，他们是唯一被信任提交软件包并与软件源交互的人，
所有操作都是通过多个安全协议完成的。
The Kali Linux team comprises a small group of individuals who are the only ones trusted to commit packages and interact with the
repositories, all of which is done using multiple secure protocols.

6962
11:24:15,054 --> 11:24:27,716
将关键代码库的访问权限限制在外部资产之外，可以大幅降低源码污染的风险，
否则全球的 Kali Linux 用户可能会作为网络犯罪的直接受害者遭受巨大损失。
Restricting access of critical code bases to external assets dramatically reduces the risk of source contamination,
which can cause Kali Linux users worldwide a great deal of damage as a direct victim of cybercrime.

6963
11:24:29,838 --> 11:24:42,212
虽然渗透测试工具往往是用英文编写的，但开发人员确保了 Kali 包含完善的多语言支持，
允许更多用户使用母语操作并找到他们工作所需的工具。
Although penetration tools tend to be written in English, the developers have ensured that Kali includes proper multilingual support,
allowing more users to operate in the native language and locate the tools they need for their job.

6964
11:24:42,958 --> 11:24:52,196
用户对操作系统的复杂细节越熟悉，就越容易掌控配置和设备本身。
The more comfortable a user feels with the intricacies of the operating system, the
easier it is to maintain a strong hold over the configuration and the device in general.

6965
11:24:53,966 --> 11:25:06,980
由于像 Raspberry Pi 这样的基于 ARM 的单板计算机变得越来越普及且价格低廉，
