Since ARM-based single board systems like the Raspberry Pi are becoming more prevalent and inexpensive,
the development team knew that Kali's ARM support would need to be as robust as they could manage with fully working installations.

6966
11:25:07,822 --> 11:25:14,948
Kali Linux 可用于广泛的 ARM 设备，并且 ARM 软件源已与主发行版集成。
Kali Linux is available on a wide range of ARM devices and has ARM repositories integrated with the mainline distribution.

6967
11:25:15,438 --> 11:25:19,684
因此，ARM 的工具会与发行版的其他部分同步更新。
So the tools for ARM are updated in conjunction with the rest of the distribution.

6968
11:25:21,902 --> 11:25:25,604
现在让我们来看看 Parrot Security 操作系统的一些功能。
Let's take a look at some of the features of Parrot Security operating system now.

6969
11:25:29,390 --> 11:25:42,468
除了庞大的脚本目录外，Parrot Security OS 还拥有专门修改过的加固的Linux内核，
旨在提供尽可能强的安全性，并在第一道防线中抵御黑客攻击。
