security and resistance to hackers as possible in the first line of defense.

6970
11:25:43,566 --> 11:25:49,732
操作系统中的配置充当第二道网关，负责处理并拦截恶意请求。
The configurations in the operating system act as the second gateway, taking care of malicious requests and dropping them off.

6971
11:25:50,318 --> 11:26:02,884
这一点特别有好处，因为如果 Linux kernel 出现某些特定问题，
