This is particularly beneficial since should there be a scenario where the latex Linux kernel is causing some particular issue,
the Parrot OS development team will most likely iron it out first before passing it on as an update.

6972
11:26:06,510 --> 11:26:16,836
如果定制的 hardened kernel 还不够，Parrot Security 开发人员还安装了更多的黑客攻击工具
