If the custom hardnail kernel wasn't reason enough, parrot security developers managed to install more hacking tools and scripts to
ensure a smooth transition for the Kali Linux users.

6973
11:26:17,582 --> 11:26:22,628
你在 Kali 中找到的所有工具在 Parrot OS 中都有，而且还额外增加了一些工具。
All the tools you find in Kali are present in Parrot OS and a few extra ones for good measure.

6974
11:26:23,374 --> 11:26:28,388
