6977
11:26:42,094 --> 11:26:48,580
对于不熟悉 Linux 术语的人来说，你可以把桌面环境理解为发行版的主要 UI。
For those unfamiliar with Linux terminology, you can think of desktop environments as the main UI for a distribution.

6978
