6981
11:27:13,344 --> 11:27:22,020
这意味着它运行所需的磁盘空间和计算能力显著降低，甚至只需要 320 MB 的 RAM 即可正常运行。
This implies that it takes significantly less disk space and computing
power to function correctly, with as little as 320 MB of RAM required.

6982
