Both of these operating systems have a recommended disk storage of minimum of 20 GB in Kali Linux and a minimum of 15 GB in Parrot
Security so they can install all the tools necessary in the ISO file.

6995
11:29:08,590 --> 11:29:18,660
说到工具的类别和选择，Kali Linux 一直是渗透测试行业中为黑客提供所有可用工具的首选。
When it comes to the category and the selection of tools, Kali Linux has always been the first in securing every single tool available
for hackers in the penetration testing industry.

6996
11:29:19,374 --> 11:29:22,756
另一方面，Parrot Security 成功更进一步。
Parrot Security, on the other hand, has managed to take it up a notch.

6997
11:29:24,046 --> 11:29:36,110
虽然专注于无线渗透测试，但 Parrot Security 确保将 Kali Linux 提供的所有工具都包含在
ISO 中，同时还加入了一些许多用户在 Kali Linux 中必须从第三方来源安装的额外工具。
While specializing in wireless pen testing, Parrot Security makes it a point that all the tools that Kali Linux provides has been
included in the ISO while simultaneously adding some extra tools that

6998
11:29:36,110 --> 11:29:40,452
虽然专注于无线渗透测试，但 Parrot Security 确保将 Kali Linux 提供的所有工具都包含在
ISO 中，同时还加入了一些许多用户在 Kali Linux 中必须从第三方来源安装的额外工具。
many users will have to install from third-party sources in Kali Linux.

6999
11:29:44,270 --> 11:29:51,908
作为一款拥有十年历史的渗透测试发行版，Kali
Linux 已经形成了一个拥有强大支持特征的大型社区。
Being a decade-old penetration testing distribution, Kali Linux has formed up a very big community with strong support signature.

7000
11:29:52,398 --> 11:30:00,324
另一方面，Parrot Security 仍在不断成长，并且在
