Parasecurity, on the other hand, is still growing and it is garnering
much more interest among veteran penetration testers and ethical hackers.

7001
11:30:03,150 --> 11:30:07,716
Kali Linux 的一个主要缺点是硬件要求很高。
A primary drawback of Kali Linux is the extensive hardware requirement.

7002
11:30:08,462 --> 11:30:12,127
为了达到最佳性能，它需要的内存比 Parrot Security 更高。
To perform optimally, it requires higher memory than Parach security.

