现在，安装需要一段时间，这取决于提供的 RAM 容量、处理器配置，
以及宿主机对系统性能的影响程度。
Now, this installation will take a while depending on the amount of RAM provided, the processors provided,
and how quickly the performance of the system is being hampered by the host machine.

7147
11:45:20,142 --> 11:45:24,484
在性能较快的系统上，这会很快，而在较小的系统上，这会花一些时间。
On quicker systems, this will be rather quick, while on the smaller ones, this will take a while.

7148
11:45:26,670 --> 11:45:38,020
由于这将在只有 2 GB RAM 的虚拟机上运行，安装需要一些时间，
所以我们将加速视频的这一部分，以免浪费时间去盯着进度条。
Since this is going to take some time to install as it is being run on a virtual machine with only 2 GB of RAM,
we're going to speed up this part of the video so we don't have to waste any more time just watching the progress bar.

7149
11:45:56,577 --> 11:46:01,137
现在核心安装完成了，它要求我们配置软件包管理器。
Now that our core installation is completed, it's asking us to configure a package manager.

7150
11:46:01,742 --> 11:46:10,116
Linux 操作系统中软件包管理器的作用，类似于 Android 移动
设备上的 Google Play Store 和 Apple 设备上的 App Store。
The work of a package manager on Linux operating systems is similar to the Google
Play Store on Android mobile devices and on the App Store for the Apple devices.

7151
11:46:11,246 --> 11:46:20,196
它是安装默认未安装的外部应用程序的接口，比如
Google Chrome 或任何其他可用于浏览互联网的浏览器。
It's an interface to install external applications which are not installed by default,
let's say for Google Chrome or any other browser which can be used to browse the internet.

7152
11:46:21,294 --> 11:46:24,036
现在，它要求我们选择网络镜像。
At this point of time, it's asked us to select a network mirror.

7153
11:46:24,238 --> 11:46:27,108
我们将选择“是”，然后继续操作。
We're going to select as yes and move forward with this.

7154
11:46:28,046 --> 11:46:34,916
接下来，它会要求输入 HTTP 代理，我们可以留空，然后点击继续。
Next, it's going to ask us for a HTTP proxy, which we can leave it as blank and press it as continue forward.

7155
11:46:37,774 --> 11:46:41,732
此时，它正在检查 Kali Linux 安装更新。
At this point of time, it's looking for updates to the Kali Linux installation.

7156
11:46:42,382 --> 11:46:48,292
这将从 Kali 服务器获取新构建，确保安装始终是最新版本。
This will fetch the new builds from the Kali server so the installation is always updated to the latest version.

7157
11:46:50,734 --> 11:46:54,656
现在软件包管理器配置好了，接下来是 GRUB 引导加载程序。
Now that the package manager is configured, we have the grub bootloader.

7158
11:46:55,086 --> 11:46:59,216
Grub 用于在启动时选择操作系统。
The grub is used for selecting the operating system while booting up.

7159
11:46:59,630 --> 11:47:05,092
它的核心功能是确保操作系统能够正确加载且不出错。
Its core functionality is to allow the operating system to be loaded correctly without any faults.

7160
11:47:05,550 --> 11:47:12,484
所以，如果此时它询问是否将 GRUB 引导加载程序安装到主硬盘，我们可以选“是”并点击继续。
So at this point of time, if it asks install the grub bootloader to your primary dive, we can select it as yes and press continue.

7161
11:47:15,278 --> 11:47:18,660
记住，安装是在 dev SDA 上进行的。
Remember the installation was conducted on dev SDA.

7162
11:47:20,270 --> 11:47:25,316
所以我们要选择在之前配置的同一块硬盘上安装 Grubloader。
So we're going to select installation of the Grubloader on the same hard disk that we have configured.

7163
11:47:26,126 --> 11:47:28,100
点击这个，然后点击继续。
Press this one and press continue.

7164
11:47:29,166 --> 11:47:31,364
现在正在安装 Grub 引导加载程序。
So now the Grub bootloader is being installed.

7165
11:47:32,206 --> 11:47:37,860
Grub 非常重要，因为它告诉主板从哪里启动操作系统。
The Grub is highly essential because it shows the motherboard where to start the operating system from.

7166
11:47:38,096 --> 11:47:47,972
即使操作系统安装正确且所有文件顺序无误，如果没有引导加载程序，也无法正常启动 OS。
Even if the operating system is installed correctly and all the files are in correct order,
the absence of a bootloader will not be able to launch the OS properly.

7167
11:47:52,334 --> 11:47:54,916
如你所见，安装终于完成了。
As you can see, the installation is finally complete.

7168
11:47:55,630 --> 11:48:01,380
现在我们可以点击继续，它将完成最后的更改。
So now we can press on continue and it's going to finalize the changes.

7169
11:48:49,856 --> 11:48:50,096
然后
And

7170
11:48:50,096 --> 11:48:51,456
这就是你的主页。
this is your homepage.

7171
11:48:51,950 --> 11:48:58,596
我们可以在这里看到已安装的应用程序，它们被全球许多安全分析师用于渗透测试。
We can see the installed applications over here, which are being used for penetration testing by multiple security analysts worldwide.

7172
11:49:01,614 --> 11:49:08,196
所有这些都预装在 Kali Linux 中，其他的可以使用我们配置好的 APT 软件包管理器来安装。
All of these come pre-installed with Kali Linux, and others can be installed using the APT package manager that we had configured.

7173
11:49:10,222 --> 11:49:11,876
我们可以在这里看到我们的全名。
We can see our full name over here.

7174
11:49:13,134 --> 11:49:16,004
至此，我们的 Kali Linux 安装就完成了。
And with this, our installation of the Kali Linux is complete.

7175
11:49:16,718 --> 11:49:25,828
不是秘密，我们大部分的网络使用都是易受攻击的，无
论是通过危险的即时通讯应用还是有缺陷的操作系统。
It's no secret that the vast bulk of our internet usage is vulnerable to hacking,
whether it's through hazardous messaging apps or faulty operating systems.

7176
11:49:26,734 --> 11:49:33,348
为了填补数字安全方面的空白，渗透测试已成为漏洞评估的标准做法。
Penetration testing has become the norm for vulnerability assessment in order to fill this vacuum in digital security.

7177
11:49:34,126 --> 11:49:38,212
Kali Linux 是这场对抗黑客战争中广为人知的操作系统。
Kali Linux is a well-known operating system in this fight against hackers.

7178
11:49:38,896 --> 11:49:52,196
Kali Linux 是专门为渗透测试人员设计的发行版，它拥有多层功能，
我们将在今天的课程中进行讲解，并看看该操作系统提供的工具和功能。
Kali Linux, a distribution designed specifically for penetration testers, has layers of features that we will go over in today's
lesson and take a look at some of the tools and features that the operating system has to offer.

7179
11:49:53,102 --> 11:49:58,148
让我们来看看视频的主题以及该操作系统提供的功能。
Let's take a look at the video's topics and features that the operating system has to offer.

7180
11:49:59,054 --> 11:50:01,220
让我们看看视频的主题。
Let's take a look at the video's topics.

7181
11:50:03,296 --> 11:50:07,716
我们首先从学习 Kali Linux 等操作系统的要求开始。
We start by learning the requirements of an operating system like Kali Linux.

7182
11:50:09,198 --> 11:50:13,156
我们将进一步了解该 OS 的核心功能及其复杂之处。
We learn more about the core features of the OS and its intricacies.

7183
11:50:14,254 --> 11:50:22,468
接下来，我们来看看渗透测试的五个不同阶段，这些阶段决定了漏洞评估的总体流程。
Moving on, we take a look at the five distinct stages of penetration
testing that dictate the flow of vulnerability assessment in general.

7184
11:50:24,046 --> 11:50:31,524
接下来，我们将学习 Kali Linux 中一些专门用于道德黑客目的的重要工具。
Next, we learn about some important tools that can be found on Kali Linux which are geared specifically for ethical hacking purposes.

7185
11:50:32,238 --> 11:50:42,340
最后，我们将进行广泛的演示，操作一些基础终端命令、代理工具，
以及几款来自该操作系统核心的高度认可的软件。
And finally, we have an extensive demonstration where we work on some basic terminal commands, proxy tools,
and a couple of highly regarded software from the crux of the operating system.

7186
11:51:02,318 --> 11:51:07,204
在当今世界，一个组织最宝贵的资产是其信息或数据。
In today's world, an organization's most valuable asset is its information or data.

7187
11:51:07,950 --> 11:51:11,684
无论是公共机构还是私营企业，这一规律都适用。
This is true for all kinds of businesses, be it public or private.

7188
11:51:12,046 --> 11:51:16,324
他们每天都要处理海量的敏感信息。
On a daily basis, they all deal with enormous amounts of sensitive information.

7189
11:51:16,910 --> 11:51:22,244
因此，恐怖组织、黑客团队和网络窃贼经常对他们发动攻击。
As a consequence, terrorist groups, hacking teams, and cyber thieves often attack them.

7190
11:51:22,894 --> 11:51:30,084
为了确保安全和保护，企业会使用各种安全措施并定期更新其索引。
To ensure this safety and protection, businesses use a variety of security measures and regularly update their index.

7191
11:51:30,638 --> 11:51:37,476
在数字化时代，组织必须采取主动措施，定期评估并更新其安全防护。
Organizations must be proactive in this age of digitalization by regularly assessing and updating their security.

7192
11:51:38,256 --> 11:51:41,988
黑客每天都在寻找突破防火墙的新方法。
Everyday hackers discover new methods to breach firewalls.

7193
11:51:42,496 --> 11:51:47,204
道德黑客或白帽黑客为安全提供了全新的视角。
Ethical hackers or white hat hackers provide a fresh perspective on security.

7194
11:51:47,790 --> 11:51:50,916
他们通过进行渗透测试来验证安全措施。
They conduct penetration tests to validate security measures.

7195
11:51:51,342 --> 11:51:57,284
通常，他们会渗透你的网络，并提供有关你安全态势的相关信息。
Generally, they will penetrate your networks and give you relevant information about your security posture.

7196
11:51:57,870 --> 11:52:02,980
一旦组织掌握了这些知识，就可以相应地升级其安全流程。
Once an organization has this knowledge, it may upgrade its security procedures accordingly.

7197
11:52:05,870 --> 11:52:11,396
最新版本的 Kali Linux 预装了 600 多种渗透测试工具。
The latest version of Kali Linux comes with more than 600 penetration tools pre-installed.

7198
11:52:13,550 --> 11:52:26,724
在审查了 Backtrack 中包含的每种工具后，开发人员剔除了大量要么根本无法运行，
要么与提供相同或类似功能的其他工具重复的工具。
After reviewing every tool that was included in Backtrack, developers have eliminated a great number of tools that either simply did
not work or which duplicated other tools that provided the same or similar functionality.

7199
11:52:27,310 --> 11:52:39,588
有时在进行渗透测试或黑客攻击时，我们必须自动化我们的活动，
因为可能有数百种条件和有效载荷需要测试，手动检查所有内容非常耗时。
Occasionally, when conducting penetration testing or hacking, we must automate our activities since there may be hundreds of
conditions and payloads to test, and manually examining everything is time consuming.

7200
11:52:40,270 --> 11:52:45,028
为了提高生产力，我们利用 Kali Linux 自带的工具。
To improve our productivity, we utilize tools that come prepackaged with Kali Linux.

7201
11:52:45,486 --> 11:52:50,564
这些工具不仅节省了我们的时间，还能准确地捕获和处理数据。
These tools not only save us time but also accurately capture and process the data.

7202
11:52:52,750 --> 11:53:03,812
Kali Linux 团队由一小群人组成，他们是唯一被信任提交软件包并与软件源交互的人，
所有操作都是通过多个安全协议完成的。
The Kali Linux team is made up of a small group of individuals who are the only ones trusted to commit packages and interact with the
repositories, all of which is done using multiple secure protocols.

7203
11:53:04,558 --> 11:53:11,524
限制外部资产对关键代码库的访问，可以大大降低源码污染的风险。
Restricting access of critical code bases to external assets greatly reduces the risk of source contamination.

7204
11:53:12,910 --> 11:53:25,892
虽然渗透测试工具往往是用英文编写的，但开发人员确保了 Kali 包含真正的多语言支持，
允许更多用户使用母语操作并找到他们完成工作所需的工具。
Although penetration tools tend to be written in English, the developers have ensured that Kali includes true multilingual support,
allowing more users to operate in the native language and locate the tools they need to do for the job.

7205
11:53:26,624 --> 11:53:40,484
由于像 Raspberry Pi 这样的 ARM 架构单板计算机越来越普及且价格低廉，
开发团队知道 Kali 的 ARM 支持需要尽可能强大，并能实现完全可用的安装。
Since ARM-based single board systems like the Raspberry Pi are becoming more and more prevalent and inexpensive,
the development team knew that Kali's ARM support would need to be as robust as they could manage with fully working installations.

7206
11:53:41,198 --> 11:53:53,220
Kali Linux 可在广泛的 ARM 设备上运行，并且与主发行版集成的 ARM 软件源，
因此 ARM 工具会与发行中的其他工具同步更新。
Kali Linux is available on a wide range of ARM devices and has ARM repositories integrated with the mainline distribution,
so tools for ARM are updated in conjunction with the rest of the distribution tools.

7207
11:53:55,598 --> 11:54:04,292
既然我们了解了像 Kali Linux 这样的操作系统的必要性，
让我们来看看它在道德黑客领域的一些核心功能和提供的资源。
Now that we understand the necessity for an operating system like Kali Linux, let us
take a look at some of its core features and offerings to the ethical hacking world.

7208
11:54:05,198 --> 11:54:14,180
Kali Linux，以前称为 Backtrack Linux，是一个开源 Linux 发行版，
旨在用于高级渗透测试和安全审计。
Kali Linux, formerly known as Backtrack Linux, is an open source Linux
distribution which is aimed at advanced penetration testing and security auditing.

7209
11:54:14,638 --> 11:54:25,540
它包含数百种针对各种信息安全任务的工具，如渗透测试、安全研究、计算机取证和逆向工程。
It contains several hundred tools targeted towards various information security tasks such
as penetration testing, security research, computer forensics, and reverse engineering.

7210
11:54:26,382 --> 11:54:33,508
Kali Linux 是一个多平台解决方案，信息安全专业人员和爱好者都可以访问并免费使用。
Kali Linux is a multi-platform solution accessible and freely available to information security professionals and hobbyists.

7211
11:54:34,126 --> 11:54:39,780
在所有的 Linux 发行版中，Kali Linux 源自 Debian 操作系统。
Among all the Linux distributions, Kali Linux takes its root from the Debian operating system.

7212
11:54:41,326 --> 11:54:49,220
Debian 多年来一直是高度可靠且稳定的发行版，为 Kali Linux 桌面提供了同样强大的基础。
Debian has been a highly dependable and stable distribution for many
years, providing a similarly strong foundation to the Kali Linux desktop.

7213
11:54:51,598 --> 11:55:00,612
虽然该操作系统能够修改安装中的几乎每一个部分，但 Kali Linux 的网络组件默认是禁用状态。
While the operating system is capable of practically modifying every single part of our installation,
the networking components of Kali Linux come disabled by default.

7214
11:55:01,262 --> 11:55:08,772
这样做是为了防止任何外部因素影响安装过程，这在关键环境中可能会带来风险。
This is done to prevent any external factors from affecting the installation procedure,
which may pose a risk in critical environments.

7215
11:55:09,422 --> 11:55:16,516
除了增强安全性，它还为最资深的用户的安全性和控制权提供了更深层次的保障。
Apart from boosting security, it allows a deeper element of security and control to the most enthusiastic of users.

7216
11:55:19,086 --> 11:55:23,492
现在让我们来看看渗透测试的五个阶段。
Let us now take a look at the five stages or phases of penetration testing.

7217
11:55:27,150 --> 11:55:31,332
这是渗透测试的第一阶段，被称为侦察阶段。
This is the first stage of the penetration test, which is known as the reconnaissance phase.

7218
11:55:32,110 --> 11:55:36,164
在这个阶段，安全研究人员会收集有关目标的信息。
In this stage, the security researcher collects information about the target.

7219
11:55:36,654 --> 11:55:42,628
这可以通过主动方式完成，也就是说你可以在不联系目标的情况下收集信息，也可以两者兼顾。
It can be done actively, which means you are collecting information without contacting the target, or even both.

7220
11:55:43,502 --> 11:55:53,508
它帮助安全公司收集有关目标系统、网络组件、活
动机器、开放端口和访问点、操作系统详情等信息。
It helps security firms gather information about the target system, network components,
active machines, open ports and access points, operating system details, etc.

7221
11:55:54,254 --> 11:55:59,908
这项活动可以通过使用公共领域中的可用信息以及使用不同的工具来执行。
This activity can be performed by using information available in the public domain and using different tools.

7222
11:56:01,582 --> 11:56:06,692
下一个阶段更偏向于工具操作而非手动执行，即扫描阶段。
The next phase is more tool-oriented rather than performed manually, and it is the scanning phase.

7223
11:56:07,374 --> 11:56:12,676
渗透测试人员运行一个或多个扫描器工具来收集更多关于目标的信息。
The penetration tester runs one or more scanner tools to gather more information about the target.

7224
11:56:13,198 --> 11:56:18,532
渗透测试人员运行一个或多个扫描器工具来收集关于目标的信息。
The penetration tester runs one or more scanner tools to gather information about the target.

7225
11:56:19,150 --> 11:56:32,068
通过使用各种扫描器，如拨号攻击工具、端口扫描器、网络映射工具和漏洞扫描器，
测试人员收集尽可能多的漏洞，帮助以更高级的方式发起攻击。
By using various scanners such as war dialers, port scanners, network mappers, and vulnerability scanners,
the tester collects as many vulnerabilities which help to turn an attack in a more sophisticated way.

7226
11:56:33,326 --> 11:56:36,704
下一个阶段被称为获取权限阶段。
The next stage is known as the gaining access phase.

7227
11:56:37,582 --> 11:56:45,412
在这个阶段，渗透测试人员尝试与目标建立连接，并利用在前一阶段发现的漏洞。
In this phase, the penetration tester tries to establish a connection with
the target and exploit the vulnerabilities found in the previous stage.

7228
11:56:46,062 --> 11:56:53,124
漏洞利用可能是缓冲区溢出攻击、拒绝服务或 DoS 攻击、会话劫持等多种形式。
Exploitation may be buffer overflow attacks, denial of service or DOS attacks, session hijacking, and many more.

7229
11:56:54,030 --> 11:57:01,892
基本上，渗透测试人员通过使用不同的工具获取权限，从服务器中提取信息和敏感数据。
Basically, penetration tester extracts information and sensitive data from servers by gaining access using different tools.

7230
11:57:03,022 --> 11:57:08,356
在维持权限阶段，渗透测试人员会尝试为自己创建一个后门。
In the maintaining access phase, the penetration tester tries to create a backdoor for himself.

7231
11:57:09,006 --> 11:57:16,420
这有助于他识别系统中的隐藏漏洞，并随后作为网关来夺回系统的控制权。
It helps him to identify hidden vulnerabilities in the system and can later act as a gateway to retrieve control of the system.

7232
11:57:18,446 --> 11:57:27,428
在清除痕迹的最后阶段，渗透测试人员会尝试删除所有日志和足迹，以免管理员识别出他的存在。
In the final phase of covering tracks, the penetration tester tries to remove
all logs and footprints which help the administrator identify his presence.

7233
11:57:28,046 --> 11:57:33,796
这有助于测试人员像黑客一样思考，并采取纠正措施来缓解这些活动。
This helps the tester to think like a hacker and perform corrective actions to mitigate those activities.

7234
11:57:36,206 --> 11:57:45,668
既然我们了解了渗透测试的基础以及道德黑客的操作流程，
现在让我们看看一些可以在 Kali Linux 上使用的知名工具。
Now that we understand the basics of penetration testing and how ethical hackers go about their way,
let us take a look at some notable tools which can be used on Kali Linux.

7235
11:57:51,246 --> 11:57:53,508
处于链条顶端的是 Nmap。
At the top of the chain lies Nmap.

7236
11:57:55,406 --> 11:58:02,820
Nmap 是一个免费且开源的工具端口扫描器，可用于网络发现和安全审计。
Nmap is a free and open source utility port scanner which can be used for network discovery and security auditing.

7237
11:58:03,726 --> 11:58:13,316
许多系统和网络管理员还发现它在网络资产清单、管理服务
升级计划以及监控主机或服务运行时间等任务中非常有用。
Many systems and network administrators also find it useful for tasks such as network
inventory, managing service upgrade schedules, and monitoring host or service uptime.

7238
11:58:16,110 --> 11:58:29,156
