虽然安全测试不能保证 100% 的解决方案，但它在
保护关键数据不落入错误手中方面能起到很大作用。
While security testing cannot guarantee a 100% solution, it can go a long
way in securing those critical data from falling into the wrong hands.

7727
12:49:55,758 --> 12:49:58,148
大家好，我是来自 Simplilearn 的 Babab。
Hey everyone, this is Babab from SimpliLearn.

7728
12:49:58,542 --> 12:50:00,868
欢迎来到这个渗透测试教程。
Welcome to this tutorial on penetration testing.

7729
12:50:01,358 --> 12:50:03,716
让我们来看看今天将涵盖的一些主题。
Let's go through some of the topics we will be covering today.

7730
12:50:06,638 --> 12:50:12,420
我们首先学习渗透测试和道德黑客，以及在 IT 行业中的不同用例。
We start by learning about penetration testing and ethical hacking and the different use cases in the IT industry.

7731
12:50:13,646 --> 12:50:19,108
接下来，我们将了解渗透测试的优势，以及它们如何帮助企业从长远来看节省成本。
Next, we know about the benefits of penetration testing and how they help organizations save money in the long run.

7732
12:50:20,526 --> 12:50:28,068
接着，我们将熟悉不同类型的渗透测试或道德黑客，每种类型都针对不同类别的人员。
Moving on, we familiarize ourselves with the different types of penetration testing or ethical hacking,
with each serving a different category of personnel.

7733
12:50:29,358 --> 12:50:38,788
在下一节中，我们将阅读每一次道德黑客行动中的五个不同阶段，
以及它们如何帮助理清每次渗透测试会话结束时冗长的报告。
In the next section, we read about the five distinct phases in every ethical hacking campaign and how they help clear up the extensive
report at the end of every penetration testing session.

7734
12:50:40,270 --> 12:50:49,392
最后，我们将进行现场演示，看看我们如何检查漏洞，
以及黑客在没有充分安全措施的情况下如何入侵设备。
Finally, we have a live demonstration on how we can check for vulnerabilities and
the ways hackers can break into devices without adequate security measures in place.

7735
12:50:51,694 --> 12:50:54,692
让我们先从了解渗透测试的总体概念开始。
Let's start by learning about penetration testing in general.

7736
12:50:57,550 --> 12:51:01,412
企业可以根据测试的目标来定义渗透测试。
Organizations can define penetration testing based on the objectives of the test.

7737
12:51:02,030 --> 12:51:06,628
所有网络、应用程序、设备和物理安全组件都包含在内。
All networks, applications, devices, and physical security components are included.

7738
12:51:06,992 --> 12:51:10,436
它模仿有害个人或黑客的行为。
It imitates the behavior of harmful individuals or the hackers.

7739
12:51:11,182 --> 12:51:19,940
经验丰富的网络安全专家利用渗透测试来加强公司的安全态势，
并消除任何可能导致其易受攻击的弱点。
Experienced cybersecurity specialists use penetration testing to strengthen a company's
security posture and eliminate any weaknesses that leave it vulnerable to attacks.

7740
12:51:20,272 --> 12:51:26,756
如果正确执行，渗透测试不仅仅是防止窃贼获得未经授权的访问公司系统。
Penetration testing, when done correctly, goes beyond simply preventing
thieves from gaining unauthorized access to a company's systems.

7741
12:51:26,992 --> 12:51:34,820
它生成真实的场景，展示在面对大规模网络攻击时，公司目前的防御措施表现如何。
It generates realistic scenarios that demonstrate how well a company's
present defenses might perform in the face of a full-scale cyber assault.

7742
12:51:35,438 --> 12:51:40,868
这种模拟有助于发现漏洞利用点，并测试 IT 数据泄露安全。
The simulation aids in the discovery of the sites of exploitation and the testing of IT breach security.

7743
12:51:42,126 --> 12:51:49,252
企业可以通过频繁进行渗透测试，获得关于安全流程的专业、公正的第三方意见。
Businesses may acquire professional, unbiased, third-party input on
the security procedures by conducting frequent penetration testing.

7744
12:51:50,094 --> 12:51:56,484
渗透测试虽然相对耗时且昂贵，但可以帮助防止破坏性强且代价高昂的数据泄露。
Pen testing, while relatively time-consuming and costly, can aid in the prevention of highly destructive and expensive breaches.

7745
12:51:57,742 --> 12:52:03,556
白帽黑客利用黑客技术来寻找硬件、软件或网络中的安全缺陷。
A white hat hacker employs hacking talents to find security flaws in hardware, software, or networks.

7746
12:52:03,872 --> 12:52:09,712
另一方面，白帽黑客在进行黑客攻击时遵循法律，而不是像黑帽黑客那样。
On the other hand, white hat hackers follow the rule of law when it comes to hacking instead of black hat hackers.

7747
12:52:10,094 --> 12:52:16,324
他们协助公司进行渗透测试，以分析其安全指数并做出必要的改进。
They assist firms in conducting penetration tests to analyze their security index and make the necessary improvements.

7748
12:52:18,254 --> 12:52:27,140
道德黑客提供对安全政策的全面审计，并且在漏洞奖励的情况下，
可以帮助您识别现有运营系统中的漏洞。
Ethical hacking provides a full audit of your security policies and, in the case of bug bounties,
can assist you in identifying holes in existing operational systems.

7749
12:52:27,392 --> 12:52:31,632
它比渗透测试采取更广泛的网络安全方法。
It takes a far broader approach to cybersecurity than penetration testing.

7750
12:52:32,142 --> 12:52:39,300
渗透测试侧重于系统缺陷，而道德黑客允许操作者利用任何可用的攻击策略。
Whereas penetration testing focuses on system flaws, ethical hacking allows actors to utilize any attack tactics available to them.

7751
12:52:39,854 --> 12:52:51,232
他们可以利用系统配置错误、发送网络钓鱼邮件、发起暴力破解密码攻击、突破物理边界，
或者做任何他们认为能获得关键信息的事情。
They can take advantage of system misconfigurations, send phishing emails, launch brute force password assaults,
breach physical boundaries, or do whatever else they feel will get them access to critical information.

7752
12:52:51,662 --> 12:53:02,724
由于窃贼在不断改变方法并发起多层次的复杂攻击，
这对于确定组织受到网络威胁的暴露程度非常有用。
Because thieves are progressively changing up the approaches and launching multi layered complex attacks,
this is incredibly useful for determining just how exposed the organization is to cyber threats.

7753
12:53:04,206 --> 12:53:09,988
考虑到道德黑客如此广泛的领域，我们有多种渗透测试方法论。
Considering the vast domain that is ethical hacking, we have multiple categories of penetration testing methodologies.

7754
12:53:10,382 --> 12:53:11,876
让我们在下一节中涵盖它们。
Let's cover them in the next section.

7755
12:53:13,070 --> 12:53:18,640
在配置安全系统时，测试对于防止黑客渗透边界至关重要。
When configuring a security system, testing is critical to preventing hackers from penetrating the perimeter.

7756
12:53:19,022 --> 12:53:22,756
有三种类型的测试：黑盒、灰盒和白盒。
There are three sorts of tests: black box, gray box, and white box.

7757
12:53:23,918 --> 12:53:28,240
在黑盒测试中，测试人员在渗透测试期间不会收到任何信息。
In the black box testing, the tester receives no information during the penetration test.

7758
12:53:28,400 --> 12:53:35,428
在这种情况下，渗透测试人员采取无权限攻击者的视角，从初始访问和执行一直到漏洞利用。
In this case, the pen tester takes the method of an unprivileged attacker from initial access and execution until exploitation.

7759
12:53:36,000 --> 12:53:42,880
这种场景最符合现实，展示了没有任何内部知识的攻击者如何瞄准并入侵组织。
This scenario is the most realistic, showcasing how an attacker with no inside knowledge may target and compromise an organization.

7760
12:53:43,310 --> 12:53:46,820
然而，正因如此，这也是成本最高的一种选择。
However, because of this, it is also the most expensive alternative.

7761
12:53:48,206 --> 12:53:57,444
白盒渗透测试，也称为透明盒测试，涉及与测试人
员共享所有的网络和系统信息，包括网络图和密码。
White box penetration testing, which is also known as crystal box testing, entails sharing all network and system information with the
tester, which includes network maps and passwords.

7762
12:53:57,934 --> 12:54:00,960
这可以节省时间并降低项目的总体成本。
This saves time and lowers the overall cost of a project.

7763
12:54:01,390 --> 12:54:08,132
白盒渗透测试有效地模拟了对给定系统的集中攻击，并尽可能利用更多的攻击路径。
A white box penetration test effectively simulates a focused assault on a given system using as many attack paths as feasible.

7764
12:54:09,998 --> 12:54:16,580
在灰盒渗透测试中，也称为透明盒测试，测试人员拥有非常有限的信息。
In a gray box penetration test, also known as a transparent box test, very restricted information is present with the tester.

7765
12:54:17,198 --> 12:54:24,388
灰盒测试有助于了解拥有权限的人员可能获得的访问范围以及他们可能造成的破坏。
Gray box testing is beneficial for understanding the extent of access
a privileged person may get and the possible damage they could wreck.

7766
12:54:25,102 --> 12:54:34,052
灰盒测试实现了深度与效率的结合，可用于模拟内部威胁或已经渗透进网络边界的攻击。
Greybox tests achieve a mix between depth and efficiency and may be used to mimic
either an insider danger or an assault that has infiltrated the network perimeter.

7767
12:54:36,814 --> 12:54:44,740
既然我们已经涵盖了渗透测试的基础知识和相关类别，
那么必须了解这些测试活动对执行机构有哪些好处。
Now that we covered the basics of penetration testing and the relative categories,
one must know how these testing campaigns benefit the organizations conducting them.

7768
12:54:45,518 --> 12:54:48,068
让我们来看看渗透测试的一些优势。
Let us go through a few perks of penetration testing.

7769
12:54:51,278 --> 12:54:58,404
定期的渗透测试可以帮助您的企业评估在线应用程序、内部网络和外部网络的安全性。
Regular penetration testing helps your business assess the security of online applications, internal networks, and external networks.

7770
12:54:58,702 --> 12:55:06,980
它还能帮助您了解为了保护公司人员和资产，需要采取哪些安全措施来达到所需的保护水平。
It also assists you in understanding what security measures are required to achieve
the degree of protection your company needs to protect its people and assets.

7771
12:55:07,566 --> 12:55:13,924
优先处理这些风险可以让公司在预判危险和防止有害攻击方面获得优势。
Prioritizing these risks offer firms an advantage in anticipating hazards and preventing harmful assaults.

7772
12:55:14,798 --> 12:55:18,980
渗透测试就像是现实中的黑客在为真实的黑客攻击做演练。
Penetration testing is similar to a real-life hacker rehearsing for a real-life hack.

7773
12:55:19,360 --> 12:55:25,764
定期的渗透测试可以帮助您在审查 IT 基础设施安全性时采取主动的现实方法。
Regular penetration testing helps you be proactive in your real-world approach to reviewing the security of your IT infrastructure.

7774
12:55:26,240 --> 12:55:32,324
这个进程可以识别您安全中的漏洞，让您在实际攻击发生前修复任何缺陷。
The process identifies gaps in your security, allowing you to correct any flaws before an actual attack happens.

7775
12:55:34,990 --> 12:55:39,040
从数据泄露的影响中恢复无疑是昂贵的。
It is undeniably expensive to recover from the effects of a data breach.

7776
12:55:39,374 --> 12:55:46,720
