用于网络的电信链路或线路可以是模拟的，也可以是数字的。
Telecommunication links or lines for networks can be either analog or digital.

8357
14:08:55,168 --> 14:09:00,868
根据提供商类型或技术类型，它们被分为几种类别。
They're classified in several ways according to the type of provider or the type of technology.

8358
14:09:01,198 --> 14:09:07,396
它们可以分为专线（也称为租用线路）或交换线路。
They can be divided into dedicated circuit, also known as leased lines, or switched circuit.

8359
14:09:07,808 --> 14:09:12,740
让我们在接下来的屏幕中讨论电路交换和分组交换。
Let us discuss circuit switching and packet switching in the following screen.

8360
14:09:13,262 --> 14:09:24,260
电路交换机制通常用于电话网络，例如传统的电话服务 POTS，以及综合业务数字网 ISDN。
Circuit switching mechanism is typically used over the telephone network, plain old
telephone service, POTS, for example, Integrated Services Digital Network, ISDN.

8361
14:09:24,608 --> 14:09:31,556
交换线路允许建立数据连接，可以在需要时发起，并在通信完成后终止。
Switched circuits allow data connections that can be initiated when needed and terminated when communication is complete.

8362
14:09:32,128 --> 14:09:36,644
它的工作原理非常类似于普通电话线路用于语音通信的情况。
This works much like a normal telephone line works for voice communication.

8363
14:09:37,088 --> 14:09:40,036
ISDN 是电路交换的一个很好的例子。
ISDN is a good example of circuit switching.

8364
14:09:40,608 --> 14:09:46,180
分组交换是一种用户共享公共承载资源的技术。
Packet switching is a technology in which users share common carrier resources.

8365
14:09:46,448 --> 14:09:55,716
分组交换允许承载商更有效地利用其基础设施，且客户的成本通常比租用线路低得多。
Packet switching allows the carrier to make more efficient use of its infrastructure,
and the cost to the customer is generally much lower than with leased lines.

8366
14:09:56,174 --> 14:10:01,124
下一个屏幕涵盖基带和宽带电信链路。
The next screen covers baseband and broadband telecommunication links.

8367
14:10:01,518 --> 14:10:11,620
在基带网络中，信号直接注入到通信链路中，因此该链路上的单个信道可用于传输信号。
In baseband networks, the signals are directly injected on the communication link
so that one single channel is available on that link for transmitting signals.

8368
14:10:12,142 --> 14:10:22,244
结果是，整个通信信道的容量都被用于传输一个数据信号，且通信每次只能在一个方向上移动。
As a result, the entire capacity of the communication channel is used to transmit one data signal,
and communication can move in only one direction at a time.

8369
14:10:22,608 --> 14:10:24,580
这就是半双工通信。
Half-duplex communication.

8370
14:10:25,168 --> 14:10:40,708
在宽带网络中，在可用频带内定义的不同载波频率可以携带模拟信号，
例如图像处理器或数据调制解调器产生的信号，就像它们被放置在独立的基带信道上一样。
In a broadband network, different carrier frequencies defined within the available band can carry analog signals,
such as those generated by image processors or a data modem, as if they were placed on separate baseband channels.

8371
14:10:41,168 --> 14:10:50,116
通过将相邻的载波频率隔开一定的间隙来避免干扰，这个间隙取决于所携带信号的频带要求。
Interference is avoided by separating adjacent carrier frequencies with
a gap that depends on the band requirements of the carried signals.

8372
14:10:50,528 --> 14:11:00,324
两个站点之间同时进行数据或控制传输接收的条件被称为全双工连接。
The conditions when simultaneous data or control transmission reception
takes place between two stations is called a full duplex connection.

8373
14:11:00,848 --> 14:11:05,092
现在让我们转向下一个屏幕中不同类型的网络。
Let us now turn to the different types of networks in the next screen.

8374
14:11:05,710 --> 14:11:19,748
个人局域网 PANS 是微型计算机网络，用于电话、PDA、打印机、摄像机、
扫描仪以及个人使用的其他计算机设备的通信。
Personal area networks, PANS, is a microcomputer network used for communications in telephones, PDAs, printers, cameras, scanners,
among other computer devices being used by an individual person.

8375
14:11:20,288 --> 14:11:27,716
局域网，LANs，是覆盖有限区域的计算机网络，例如家庭、办公室或校园。
Local area networks, LANs, are computer networks that cover a limited area, such as a home, office, or campus.

8376
14:11:28,208 --> 14:11:36,516
广域网，WANs，是覆盖广泛区域的计算机网络，例如城市、地区、国家或国际链路。
Wide area networks, WANs, are computer networks that cover a broad area, such as a city, region, nation, or an international link.

8377
14:11:37,008 --> 14:11:40,528
互联网就是一个例子，它是广域网最大的例子。
The internet is an example, the largest example of a WAN.

8378
14:11:41,248 --> 14:11:46,820
城域网，MANS，是范围限制在城市或地区的广域网。
Metropolitan Area Networks, MANS, are WANs that are limited to a city or region.

8379
14:11:47,168 --> 14:11:52,004
通常，城域网的数据传输速率比广域网更高。
Usually, MANS are characterized by higher data transfer rates than WANs.

8380
14:11:52,528 --> 14:12:01,348
存储区域网，SANS，是局域网的一种变体，专门用于将存储设备连接到服务器和其他计算设备。
Storage area networks, SANS, are a variation of LANs and are dedicated
to connecting storage devices to servers and other computing devices.

8381
14:12:01,728 --> 14:12:05,796
SANS 集中处理数据的存储和管理流程。
SANS centralized the process for the storage and administration of data.

8382
14:12:06,288 --> 14:12:11,108
在下一个屏幕中，我们将看看无线网络，这也是一种网络类型。
In the next screen, we will look at wireless networks, which are also a type of network.

8383
14:12:12,046 --> 14:12:21,188
无线技术使一个或多个设备能够在没有物理连接的情
况下进行通信，也就是说，不需要网络或外设电缆。
Wireless technologies enable one or more devices to communicate without physical connections, that is,
without requiring network or peripheral cabling.

8384
14:12:21,568 --> 14:12:36,068
无线网络技术利用无线电频率传输，通过自由空间传输电磁信号作为数据传输手段，
而有线技术则通过电缆传输电信号。
The technology in wireless networks uses radio frequency transmissions, electromagnetic signals,
through free space as the means for transmitting data, whereas wired technologies use electrical signals through cables.

8385
14:12:36,608 --> 14:12:44,644
无线网络作为设备之间，以及设备与传统有线网络之间的传输机制。
Wireless networks serve as the transport mechanism between devices and among devices and the traditional wired networks.

8386
14:12:45,088 --> 14:12:52,356
无线网络种类繁多且多样，但通常根据覆盖范围分为四类。
Wireless networks are many and diverse but are frequently categorized into four groups based on their coverage range.

8387
14:12:52,768 --> 14:13:01,892
这些包括广域网、局域网、无线个人网络和无线自组网。
These are wide area networks, local area networks, wireless personal networks, and wireless ad hoc networks.

8388
14:13:02,350 --> 14:13:06,340
下一个屏幕列出了无线网络的风险。
The following screen lists the risks of a wireless network.

8389
14:13:06,926 --> 14:13:22,980
无线网络的风险包括敏感信息的拦截、设备的丢失或被盗、设备的滥用、设备中包含的数据丢失、
设备造成的分心，以及使用设备可能产生的健康影响。
Risks of wireless networks include interception of sensitive information, loss or theft of devices, misuse of devices,
loss of data contained in the devices, distractions caused by the devices, and possible health effects of device usage.

8390
14:13:23,408 --> 14:13:26,756
在下一个屏幕中，我们来看看无线网络的类型。
In the next screen, we look at types of wireless networks.

8391
14:13:27,406 --> 14:13:39,396
无线广域网，WWAN，是连接大地理区域的不同网络的过程，
旨在实现更广泛的 IT 资源共享和连接。
Wireless wide area network, WWAN, this is the process of linking different networks
over a large geographical area to allow wider IT resource sharing and connectivity.

8392
14:13:39,808 --> 14:13:45,380
无线广域网通过无线电、卫星和移动电话技术连接。
Wireless wide area networks are connected via radio, satellite, and mobile phone technologies.

8393
14:13:45,808 --> 14:13:55,684
使用无线电、卫星和移动电话技术的无线广域网可
以补充甚至与更传统的基于电缆的网络系统竞争。
Wireless wide area network using radio satellite and mobile phone technologies can
complement and compete with more traditional systems of cable-based networking.

8394
14:13:56,208 --> 14:14:10,756
IEEE 82.11 的有线等效隐私加密使用对称私钥，这意味着终
端用户的无线网络接口卡 NIC 和接入点必须拥有相同的密钥。
IEEE 82.11's wired equivalent privacy encryption uses symmetric private keys, which means the end user's radio-based network interface
card NIC, and access point must have the same key.

8395
14:14:11,168 --> 14:14:17,220
这导致定期向每个网络接口卡分发新密钥变得困难。
This leads to difficulties periodically involved with distributing new keys to each network interface card.

8396
14:14:17,568 --> 14:14:24,644
由于使用静态密钥，许多黑客攻击工具可以轻易破解相对薄弱的 WEP 加密机制。
With static keys, several hacking tools easily break through the relatively weak WEP encryption mechanisms.

8397
14:14:25,088 --> 14:14:28,964
无线网络类型在下一个屏幕继续。
Wireless networks types continue in the next screen.

8398
14:14:29,838 --> 14:14:44,772
Wi-Fi 保障访问，WPA、WPA2，是较新的安全协议，利用公钥
加密技术在用户和接入点之间提供有效的身份验证和加密。
Wi-Fi Protected Access, WPA, WPA2, is newer security protocols that utilize public key cryptography techniques to provide effective
authentication and encryption between users and access points.

8399
14:14:45,248 --> 14:14:53,252
无线个人局域网，WPANs，是连接无线设备到彼此的短程无线网络。
Wireless personal area networks, WPANs, are short-range wireless networks that connect wireless devices to one another.

8400
14:14:53,648 --> 14:14:57,956
WPAN 技术中最主流的形式是 Bluetooth。
The most dominant form of WPAN technology is Bluetooth.

8401
14:14:58,448 --> 14:15:02,148
Bluetooth 连接极短距离内的无线设备。
Bluetooth links wireless devices at very short distances.

8402
14:15:02,448 --> 14:15:09,060
连接 WPAN 模式设备最古老的方法是使用红外 IR 通信。
The oldest way to connect devices in a WPAN fashion is using infrared IR communications.

8403
14:15:09,488 --> 14:15:12,900
无线网络类型在下一个屏幕继续。
Wireless network types continues in the next screen.

8404
14:15:13,550 --> 14:15:20,612
自组网是旨在动态连接远程设备（如手机、笔记本电脑和 PDA）的网络。
Ad hoc networks are networks designed to dynamically connect remote devices such as cell phones, laptops, and PDAs.

8405
14:15:20,928 --> 14:15:30,980
这些网络被称为“即时网络”，因为它们的网络拓扑结构是变化的，
而 WLAN 或 WPAN 使用的是固定的网络基础设施。
These networks are termed ad hoc because of their shifting network
topologies, whereas WLANs or WPANs use a fixed network infrastructure.

8406
14:15:31,248 --> 14:15:40,836
即时网络保持随机的网络配置，依靠由无线链路连接的移动路由器系统，使设备能够进行通信。
Ad hoc networks maintain random network configurations, relying on a system of
mobile routers connected by wireless links to enable devices to communicate.

8407
14:15:41,408 --> 14:15:55,460
无线应用协议 WAP 是一种多层协议和相关技术，它将互联网内容带到无线移动设备上，
例如个人数字助理、PDA 和手机。
Wireless Application Protocol, WAP, is a multilayered protocol and related technologies that bring internet content to wireless mobile
devices such as personal digital assistants, PDAs, and cell phones.

8408
14:15:55,918 --> 14:15:58,980
下一屏讨论虚拟专用网络。
The next screen discusses virtual private networks.

8409
14:15:59,470 --> 14:16:13,188
虚拟专用网络 VPN 通过在公共互联网上通过虚拟连接发送加密数据包，安全地扩展企业网络，
连接到远程办公室、居家办公人员、销售人员和业务合作伙伴。
A virtual private network, VPN, extends the corporate network securely via encrypted packets sent out via virtual connections over the
public internet to distant offices, home workers, salespeople, and business partners.

8410
14:16:13,648 --> 14:16:20,068
虚拟专用网络允许网络管理员以高成本效益扩大企业网络的覆盖范围。
Virtual private network allows network managers to cost-efficiently increase the span of the corporate network.

8411
14:16:20,528 --> 14:16:32,950
它们还允许远程网络用户安全且轻松地访问企业，让公司能够与业务合作伙伴安全通信，
让供应链管理更高效，并让服务提供商通过提供具有增值服务的实质性带宽增长来扩大业务。
They also allow remote network users to securely and easily access their corporate enterprise,
corporations to securely communicate with business partners, supply chain management to be efficient and effective,

8412
14:16:32,950 --> 14:16:40,196
它们还允许远程网络用户安全且轻松地访问企业，让公司能够与业务合作伙伴安全通信，
让供应链管理更高效，并让服务提供商通过提供具有增值服务的实质性带宽增长来扩大业务。
and service providers to grow their businesses by providing substantial incremental bandwidth with value-added services.

8413
14:16:40,686 --> 14:16:43,556
接下来的屏幕列出了 VPN 类型。
The following screen lists VPN types.

8414
14:16:44,142 --> 14:16:55,588
不同类型的虚拟专用网络包括远程访问 VPN，用于
安全地将远程办公人员和移动用户连接到企业 WAN。
The different types of virtual private networks include remote access VPN, which is
used to connect telecommuters and mobile users to the Enterprise WAN in a secure manner.

8415
14:16:56,048 --> 14:17:08,068
内网 VPN 用于连接企业 WAN 内的分支机构，外网 VPN
用于让业务合作伙伴获得有限的相互企业网络访问权限。
Intranet VPN, used to connect branch offices within an Enterprise WAN and extranet VPN,
used to give business partners limited access to each other's corporate network.

8416
14:17:08,654 --> 14:17:11,876
在下一屏，让我们看看网络组件。
In the next screen, let us look at network components.

8417
14:17:12,622 --> 14:17:20,356
网络组件包括网络主机、传输介质、网络基础设施组件和网络软件。
Network components include network hosts, transmission media, network infrastructure components, and network software.

8418
14:17:20,768 --> 14:17:24,580
网络主机包括服务器、PC 和打印机。
Network hosts include servers, PCs, printers.

8419
14:17:24,928 --> 14:17:31,140
传输介质包括光纤、同轴电缆和铜质UTP电缆等。
Transmission media includes fiber, coaxial cable, and copper UTP cable, among others.

8420
14:17:31,648 --> 14:17:45,490
网络基础设施组件包含重要的网络组件，如服务器、路由器、交换机、集线器、调制解调器，
以及提供数据交换和控制规则、并提供跨不同组件端到端通信进程的网络软件和无线网络。
Network infrastructure components whose significant network components include servers, routers, switches, hubs, modems,
and wireless networks and network software that provide the rules for exchange and control

8421
14:17:45,490 --> 14:17:50,884
网络基础设施组件包含重要的网络组件，如服务器、路由器、交换机、集线器、调制解调器，
以及提供数据交换和控制规则、并提供跨不同组件端到端通信进程的网络软件和无线网络。
of data and process of communication across the different components from end to end.

8422
14:17:51,406 --> 14:17:53,732
接下来的屏幕列出了网络服务。
The following screen lists network services.

8423
14:17:54,158 --> 14:18:12,128
一些网络服务包括文件共享、电子邮件服务、打印服务、远程访问服务或终端仿真、目录服务、
网络管理、动态主机配置协议 DHCP 以及域名系统 DNS。
Some network services include file sharing, email services, print services, remote access services or terminal emulation,
directory services, network management, dynamic host configuration protocol, DHCP, and domain name service, DNS.

8424
14:18:12,558 --> 14:18:25,180
但是，在评估云提供商的安全性时，非常重要的一点是区分云服务提供商实施和运营的安全措施
