基本上，AWS 责任共担模型定义了哪些安全控制属于你，哪些属于 AWS 的责任。
Basically, the AWS Shared Responsibility Model defines which security controls are yours and which are the responsibility of AWS.

8429
14:18:49,934 --> 14:18:54,308
