And this diagram here gives you an overview of who owns what.

8434
14:19:21,966 --> 14:19:25,572
AWS 责任共担模型有一些例外情况。
There are some exceptions to the AWS shared responsibility model.

8435
14:19:26,094 --> 14:19:36,356
例如，对于 RDS、DynamoDB 和 Redshift 等 AWS 管理的服务，AWS 负责的不仅仅是硬件和网络。
For example, with AWS managed services like RDS, DynamoDB, and Redshift,
AWS is responsible for more than just the hardware and the networks.

8436
14:19:36,814 --> 14:19:43,200
在这些情况下，AWS 负责安全配置，例如补丁修复、杀毒软件等。
In these cases, AWS is responsible for the security configuration, like patching, antivirus, etc.

8437
14:19:43,630 --> 14:19:47,556
