And you're just responsible for account management and user access.

8438
14:19:49,870 --> 14:19:54,788
Amazon Web Services 非常重视云安全和合规性。
Amazon Web Services takes cloud security and compliance extremely seriously.

8439
14:19:55,502 --> 14:20:02,084
消费者最大的担忧之一就是云端不安全，这是我经常听到的内容。
One of the biggest concerns of consumers is that the cloud is not secure, and it's something I hear time and time again.

8440
14:20:02,638 --> 14:20:14,532
但事实上，事实并非如此，因为 AWS 投入了巨大的资源来保障 AWS 云的安全，
并确保它符合要求的合规保证计划。
But in fact, that could not be further from the truth, as AWS invests huge resources into securing the AWS cloud and making sure that
it's compliant with the required assurance programs.

8441
14:20:16,526 --> 14:20:26,244
AWS 云合规性可以让客户准确了解 Amazon 为了维护云安全和数据保护而采取了哪些控制措施。
AWS Cloud Compliance allows customers to understand exactly what controls have
been put in place by Amazon to maintain cloud security and data protection.

8442
14:20:27,054 --> 14:20:37,092
然而，AWS 并不承担全部责任，因为对于构建在 AWS
云基础设施之上的系统，合规责任属于最终用户。
However, AWS doesn't take full responsibility, as for systems that are built on top of AWS cloud infrastructure,
the compliance responsibility belongs to the end user.

8443
14:20:37,998 --> 14:20:43,748
AWS 符合大量的金融、医疗、政府等领域的合规保证计划。
AWS meets a large amount of the assurance programs for finance, healthcare, government, and many more.

8444
14:20:44,110 --> 14:20:47,940
这里是 AWS 符合的一些合规保证计划的列表。
And here's a list of some of the assurance programs AWS is compliant with.

8445
14:20:48,430 --> 14:20:52,047
你可以看到里面有一些知名标准，比如 HIPAA、FedRAMP 和 ISO。
And you can see there's some big names in there like HIPAA, FedRAMP and ISO.

8446
14:20:53,307 --> 14:21:00,087
但仅仅因为 AWS 拥有所有这些合规保证计划，并不意味着你的应用程序就是合规的。
But just because AWS have all these compliance assurance programs, it doesn't mean that your applications are compliant.

8447
14:21:00,287 --> 14:21:05,316
你仍然需要对你的应用程序进行一些操作，才能使其完全符合这些计划。
There's still stuff you'll need to do with your applications to make them fully compliant with these programs.

8448
14:21:07,214 --> 14:21:09,348
让我们从基础设施即服务开始。
Let's start with infrastructure as a service.

8449
14:21:09,998 --> 14:21:19,460
EC2、S3 和 VPC 完全由客户控制，因此你必须执行所有的安全配置和管理任务。
EC2, S3 and VPC are completely under customer control, so you have to perform all the security configuration and management tasks.

8450
14:21:20,142 --> 14:21:23,040
虚拟实例完全由你控制。
The virtual instances are completely controlled by you.

8451
14:21:23,310 --> 14:21:26,148
你有根权限，而 AWS 没有。
You have root access, AWS does not.

8452
14:21:26,638 --> 14:21:37,444
AWS 没有访问你的实例或客户操作系统的访问权限，他们无法通过 SSH 或 RDP 登录你的服务器，
因此他们不知道你的实例里发生了什么。
AWS has no access rights to your instances or guest operating systems, and they cannot SSH or RDP into your servers,
so they have no idea what's going on on your instances.

8453
14:21:38,094 --> 14:21:46,788
如果你向 AWS 提交支持工单，你会发现他们无法登录
你的实例来帮助你解决问题，你必须使用屏幕共享。
And you'll find this out if you ever raise a support ticket with AWS that they are unable to log on to your instances to help you with
your problems, you have to do screen sharing.

8454
14:21:47,118 --> 14:21:50,372
这就是 AWS 提供的安全属性。
So that's the security attribute that AWS provides.

8455
14:21:52,398 --> 14:22:00,836
AWS 有一套存储退役流程，旨在防止客户数据暴露给未经授权的人员。
AWS has a storage decommissioning process that is designed to prevent customer data from being exposed to unauthorized individuals.

8456
14:22:01,358 --> 14:22:08,836
客户实例无法访问原始磁盘设备，相反，你看到的是虚拟化磁盘。
Customer instances have no access to raw disk devices, and instead you're presented with virtualized disks.

8457
14:22:09,294 --> 14:22:19,492
AWS 自有的磁盘虚拟化层会自动重置客户使用的每一个存储块，
这样客户的数据就永远不会暴露给其他人。
AWS proprietary disk virtualization layer automatically resets every block of
storage used by the customer so that customer's data is never exposed to another.

8458
14:22:20,046 --> 14:22:29,700
类似地，当内存从主机中释放时，也会由虚拟机管理
程序进行擦除，在完全擦除之前，它无法再次使用。
In a similar way, memory is also scrubbed by the hypervisor when it's unallocated
from a host and is unavailable for use again until it is completely scrubbed.

8459
14:22:31,726 --> 14:22:39,940
在网络方面，AWS 防范拒绝服务、中间人攻击、IP欺骗、端口扫描和数据包嗅探。
With the network, AWS protects against denial of service, man in the middle, IP spoofing, port scanning, and packet sniffing.

8460
14:22:40,654 --> 14:22:52,132
它通过 AWS 控制的主机防火墙基础设施来防止 IP欺骗，并且
它不允许实例发送源 IP 地址或 MAC地址不是其自身的流量。
It prevents IP spoofing by AWS controlled, host-based firewall infrastructure, and it will not allow an instance to send traffic with
a source IP address or MAC address other than its own.

8461
14:22:52,846 --> 14:23:03,460
通过使用安全组和访问控制列表来防止拒绝服务，这样你
可以最大限度地减少公共入口点并减少应用程序的攻击面。
Denial of service is prevented through the use of security groups, access control lists so that you can minimize public entry points
and reduce the surface area of your applications.

8462
14:23:04,078 --> 14:23:15,076
你可以将数据库和不面向互联网的资源放在私有子网中，并
使用堡垒机通过 SSH 和 RDP 访问隐藏在私有子网中的实例。
You can protect databases and non-internet facing resources in private subnets and
use Bastion servers for SSH and RDP access to instances hidden in private subnets.

8463
14:23:15,726 --> 14:23:20,964
你可以将弹性负载均衡器放在带有入站和出站限制的安全组中。
You can put your elastic load balancers in security groups with inbound and outbound restrictions.

8464
14:23:22,702 --> 14:23:32,752
Amazon EC2 提供防火墙解决方案，默认配置为拒绝所有模式，
因此你必须开放应用程序运行所需的端口。
Amazon EC2 provides a firewall solution that by default is configured in deny all mode,
so you have to open up the ports you require for your applications to work.

8465
14:23:33,134 --> 14:23:42,628
通过网络安全，你可以使用 HTTPS 代替 HTTP，还可以使用 VPN 提供加密隧道访问 AWS。
With network security, you can use HTTPS instead of HTTP, and you can use VPN to provide encrypted tunnel access to AWS.

8466
14:23:44,174 --> 14:23:53,092
AWS 允许你进行漏洞扫描，但你必须提前申请权限，并且必须限制在您自己的实例上。
AWS allows you to perform vulnerability scans, but you have to request permission in advance to perform one,
and you have to limit it to your own instances.

8467
14:23:53,550 --> 14:23:55,552
这是你可能会在考试中看到的内容。
And this is something you may see on the exam.

8468
14:23:55,632 --> 14:23:59,552
这是一个热门问题：你能够运行漏洞扫描吗？
It's a popular question, are you able to run vulnerability scans?

8469
14:23:59,822 --> 14:24:03,812
答案是肯定的，但前提是你必须获得亚马逊的许可。
And the answer is yes, but only after you've got permission from Amazon.

8470
14:24:04,942 --> 14:24:10,180
人们经常问，亚马逊的公司网络是否与 AWS 网络隔离？
People often ask, is the Amazon corporate network segregated from the AWS network?

8471
14:24:10,542 --> 14:24:13,444
答案是肯定的，这是通过网络安全实现的。
And the answer is yes, using network security.

8472
14:24:13,902 --> 14:24:22,052
在同一台物理机器上运行的不同实例，是通过 AWS 使用的 Xen 虚拟机管理程序相互隔离的。
Different instances running on the same physical machine are isolated from each other via the Xen hypervisor, which is what AWS uses.

8473
14:24:22,606 --> 14:24:31,396
此外，AWS 防火墙位于虚拟机管理程序层，处于物理网络接口和实例的虚拟接口之间。
Also, the AWS firewall resides within the hypervisor layer, between
the physical network interface and the instance's virtual interface.

8474
14:24:31,854 --> 14:24:41,152
因此，所有数据包都必须通过这个层，这意味着任何并行的实例，
对该实例的访问权限与互联网上的任何其他主机一样。
So all packets have to pass through this layer, meaning that any instances running
alongside have no more access to that instance than any other host on the internet.

8475
14:24:41,774 --> 14:24:45,252
物理 RAM 也使用类似的机制进行分离。
Physical RAM is also separated using similar mechanisms.

8476
14:24:46,926 --> 14:24:51,236
AWS 提供多种选项来保护您的用户凭据。
AWS provides multiple options to secure your user credentials.

8477
14:24:51,822 --> 14:25:02,212
除了传统的用户名和密码，我们还有多因素身份验证，还有访问密钥和密钥对，以及 X509 证书。
You have good old username and passwords, we have multi-factor authentication,
then there's the access keys and the key pairs, and also X509 certificates.

8478
14:25:02,702 --> 14:25:14,244
这些方法是通过向用户提供证书和私钥来确保在线媒体安全，
这样只有持有密钥和证书的用户才能查看您在线发布的媒体。
And these are a way of making media online secure by providing a certificate and a private key to a user so that only the user with
the key and the certificate can view the media that you've placed online.

8479
14:25:15,566 --> 14:25:24,740
AWS 提供 AES256 加密功能，可以对 EC2 实例或 EBS 存储上的数据进行加密。
AWS provides the ability to encrypt with AES256 encryption so that data on EC2 instances or EBS storage is encrypted.

8480
14:25:25,230 --> 14:25:31,492
为了实现低延迟和高效运行，该功能仅在更强大的实例类型上可用。
For it to happen with low latency and to be efficient, it's only available on the more powerful instance types.

8481
14:25:32,750 --> 14:25:36,420
AWS 在负载均衡器上提供 SSL 卸载。
AWS offers SSL termination on load balancers.

8482
14:25:36,974 --> 14:25:44,292
这意味着任何在弹性负载均衡器和 Web 服务器之间传
输的流量都是未加密的，这样可以减轻它们的负载。
So this means any traffic that passes between elastic load balancers and web servers is unencrypted, so the load is taken off them.

8483
14:25:44,686 --> 14:25:54,468
因此，您可以确保您的数据在进入亚马逊之前是完全加密的，一旦进入其中，
就可以进行解密以提高速度并让您的应用程序运行得更快。
So you can ensure that your data is fully encrypted all the way into Amazon and then once
it's in there it can be unencrypted to speed up and make your applications work faster.

8484
14:25:55,822 --> 14:26:01,956
AWS Direct Connect 提供了一种替代互联网来利用 AWS 云服务的方案。
AWS Direct Connect provides an alternative to using the internet to utilising AWS Cloud Services.

8485
14:26:02,574 --> 14:26:07,236
所以在我们所有的演示中，我一直是通过我的浏览器连接到 AWS。
So in all the demonstrations we've been using, I've been connecting to AWS via my web browser.

8486
14:26:07,758 --> 14:26:10,820
但是，如果您使用 Direct Connect，您可以更改这一点。
However, if you use Direct Connect, you can change this.

8487
14:26:11,470 --> 14:26:20,644
原本通过互联网传输的数据，现在可以通过 AWS 与您
的数据中心或公司网络之间的专用网络连接来交付。
So data that would have previously been transported over the internet can now be delivered for a private network connection between
AWS and your data center or your corporate network.

8488
14:26:21,070 --> 14:26:31,312
它允许您使用您的私有 IP 空间来访问 S3 等公共
服务，以及在您的 VPC 内运行的 EC2 等私有资源。
So it allows you to access public services such as S3 and private
resources such as EC2 running within your VPC using your private IP space.

8489
14:26:31,758 --> 14:26:37,604
这也意味着您可以将办公室的 IP 地址范围扩展到您的虚拟私有云中。
It also means you can extend your IP address range of your office into your virtual private cloud.

8490
14:26:39,150 --> 14:26:46,660
AWS CloudTrail 是一个 Web 服务，它会记录您账户的 AWS API 调用，并将日志文件发送给您。
AWS Cloud Trail is a web service that records AWS API calls for your account and delivers log files to you.

8491
14:26:47,598 --> 14:27:01,188
记录的信息包括 API 调用者的身份、API 调用时间、API 调用者的源 IP 地址、请求参数，
以及 AWS 服务返回的响应元素。
The recorded information includes the identity of the API caller, the time of the API call, the source IP address of the API caller,
the request parameters, and the response elements returned by the AWS service.

8492
14:27:02,158 --> 14:27:10,820
CloudTrail 生成的 AWS API 调用历史记录可用于安全分析、资源变更跟踪和合规性审计。
The AWS API call history produced by CloudTrail enables security analysis, resource change tracking, and compliance auditing.

8493
14:27:11,374 --> 14:27:23,204
正如您所知，审计是当今 IT 世界的热门话题，因此启用 CloudTrail 来为您执行此操作非常重
要，除了了解它的用途和为什么要使用它之外，您不需要了解太多关于 Cloud Trail 的信息。
Now as you know, auditing is a hot topic in today's IT world, so enabling CloudTrail to do this for you is very important,
and you don't need to know much more about Cloud Trail other than what it's for and why you would use it.

8494
14:27:25,070 --> 14:27:31,748
Amazon CloudWatch 是用于监控 AWS 云资源以及您在 AWS 上运行的应用程序的监控服务。
Amazon CloudWatch is a monitoring service for AWS Cloud Resources and the applications you run on AWS.

8495
14:27:32,494 --> 14:27:39,332
CloudWatch 支持对 EC2 和其他 Amazon 云服务的监控，这样当出现问题时，您可以收到警报。
CloudWatch enables monitoring for EC2 and other Amazon Cloud services so you can get alerts when things go wrong.

8496
14:27:40,046 --> 14:27:51,310
您可以使用 Amazon CloudWatch 来收集和跟踪指标，从而获得资源利用率、
应用程序性能和整体运行状况的全方位可见性，并利
You can use Amazon CloudWatch to collect and track metrics, so you can get system-wide visibility into resource utilization,
application performance, and overall operational health, and you can

8497
14:27:51,310 --> 14:27:51,820
用这些洞察来做出反应，确保您的应用程序平稳运行。
You can use Amazon CloudWatch to collect and track metrics, so you can get system-wide visibility into resource utilization,
application performance, and overall operational health, and you can

8498
14:27:51,820 --> 14:27:56,228
用这些洞察来做出反应，确保您的应用程序平稳运行。
use these insights to react and keep your applications running smoothly.

8499
14:27:58,062 --> 14:28:00,112
CloudWatch 提供两种类型的监控。
CloudWatch offers two types of monitoring.

8500
14:28:00,334 --> 14:28:11,748
基础监控是免费提供的，每五分钟轮询一次，提供 10 个指标、
5 GB 的数据摄入和 5 GB 的数据存储。
There's basic monitoring, which is included free of charge and polls every five minutes and gives you 10 metrics,
five gigabytes of data ingestion and five gigabytes of data storage.

8501
14:28:12,352 --> 14:28:23,108
还有详细监控，这按每个实例每月的价格收费，但它每分钟轮询一次，
所以如果你想要更详细的监控，就可以付费购买。
Then there's detailed monitoring, and this costs more as a price per instance per month, but it polls every minute,
so if you want more detailed monitoring, then you can pay for it.

8502
14:28:24,270 --> 14:28:32,912
AWS CloudWatch 允许你记录 EBS、EC2、Elastic Load Balancer 和 Amazon S3 等服务的指标。
AWS CloudWatch allows you to record metrics for services such as EBS, EC2, Elastic Load Balancer, and Amazon S3.

8503
14:28:33,582 --> 14:28:40,388
利用这些指标，你可以将它们添加到仪表板中，以提供有关当前状况的视觉或文本通知。
And using these metrics, you can add them to dashboards to give visual or text-based notifications of what's going on.

8504
14:28:40,797 --> 14:28:44,868
这是 Amazon CloudWatch 中仪表板的一个示意图。
And This is a diagram of a dashboard in Amazon CloudWatch.

8505
14:28:45,518 --> 14:28:52,644
指标是在虚拟机管理程序层级的，所以你可以获取
CPU、磁盘、网络等信息，但你看不到内存使用情况。
Metrics are at the hypervisor level, so you can get things like CPU, disk, network, but you cannot see memory usage.

8506
14:28:53,326 --> 14:28:57,188
随着你向 AWS 账户添加更多资源，指标就会出现。
Metrics appear as you add more resources to your AWS account.

8507
14:28:58,510 --> 14:29:04,356
你可以根据 CloudWatch 监控创建事件，例如触发 Lambda 函数。
You can create events based on your CloudWatch monitoring, for example triggering Lambda functions.

8508
14:29:05,102 --> 14:29:14,020
比如如果 EBS 卷满了，你可以触发一个事件，从而从卷中删除并归档数据，或者创建一个新卷。
So perhaps if an EBS volume fills up, you could trigger an event so that
data is removed and archived from the volume or a new volume is created.

8509
14:29:14,318 --> 14:29:15,940
所以有很多你可以操作的事情。
So there's many things you can do.

8510
14:29:17,102 --> 14:29:24,740
你可以在 EC2 实例上安装 CloudWatch 代理程序，
这将把关于实例的监控数据发送到 CloudWatch。
You can install CloudWatch agents on EC2 instances, and this will send monitoring data about the instance to CloudWatch.

8511
14:29:25,262 --> 14:29:32,132
这样你就可以监控 Apache 中的 HTTP 响应代码，或者统计应用程序日志中的异常。
So you can monitor things like HTTP response codes in Apache or you can count exceptions in application logs.

8512
14:29:35,022 --> 14:29:38,628
你可以设置警报，根据资源使用情况发出警告。
You can set alarms to warn based on resource usage.

8513
14:29:39,118 --> 14:29:44,196
例如，如果 CPU 利用率太高，它就可以发送通知。
For example, if CPU utilization is too high, then it could send a notification.

8514
14:29:44,910 --> 14:29:52,388
它还可以自动扩缩容，所以如果你的 CPU 达到极限，你可以启动另一个实例来处理部分负载。
It can also auto-scale, so if your CPU is maxed out, you can get another instance launched to take care of some of the load.

8515
14:29:53,070 --> 14:30:01,796
或者你可以将 CloudWatch 监控警报发送到 EC2 操
作，比如在发生某些情况时恢复实例或重启实例。
Or you can send CloudWatch monitoring alarms to EC2 actions, to say recover an instance or reboot an instance if something happens.

8516
14:30:02,606 --> 14:30:07,072
你还可以使用警报来关闭实例，它不仅仅用于启动实例。
You can also use alarms to shut down instances, it isn't just used for starting them up.

8517
14:30:07,342 --> 14:30:11,812
所以如果你有闲置实例，你可以让 CloudWatch 帮你把它们关闭。
So if you have idle instances, you can get CloudWatch to shut them down for you.

8518
14:30:14,510 --> 14:30:20,832
在这次演示中，我们将看看 AWS CloudWatch 以及如何利用它来关闭闲置实例。
In this demonstration, we're going to take a look at AWS CloudWatch and how we can use it to shut down idle instances.

8519
14:30:29,710 --> 14:30:36,868
在开始这次演示之前，我启动了一个 Amazon Linux 实
例并让它运行了 10 分钟，只是为了让我们有一些数据。
So before I started this demonstration, I launched an Amazon Linux instance and let it run for 10 minutes just so we'd have some data.

8520
14:30:37,358 --> 14:30:41,092
现在我要去管理工具，然后点击 CloudWatch。
So now I'm going to go to Management Tools and click on CloudWatch.

8521
14:30:43,278 --> 14:30:45,700
这把我们带到了 CloudWatch 仪表板。
And this brings us to the CloudWatch dashboard.

8522
14:30:46,766 --> 14:30:56,004
我们要做的就是创建一个新仪表板，点击创建仪表
板，这样我们就可以查看新实例的监控统计数据了。
So what we're going to do is we're going to create a new dashboard and we'll click on create dashboard so that we can have a look at
the monitoring statistics for our new instance.

8523
14:30:56,430 --> 14:31:00,256
那我们就给它起个名字，就叫 simply learn。
So let's just give it a name and we'll call it just simply learn.

8524
14:31:00,496 --> 14:31:01,700
换个花样。
Just for a change.

8525
14:31:03,278 --> 14:31:05,028
好的，这里显示创建仪表板。
Okay, so it says create dashboard.

8526
14:31:05,582 --> 14:31:10,736
现在我们有了选项，是想在仪表板上放文本类还是指标图表小部件？
And now we get the option do we want to put text-base or metric graphs widgets to our dashboard?

8527
14:31:10,926 --> 14:31:12,676
我们要选择指标图表。
And we're going to select metric graphs.

8528
14:31:13,102 --> 14:31:14,308
那我们就点击配置。
So we'll click on configure.

8529
14:31:15,022 --> 14:31:19,748
然后我们面前会出现我 AWS 账户中所有可用的 CloudWatch 指标。
And then we're presented with all the CloudWatch metrics that I have available in my AWS account.

8530
14:31:20,270 --> 14:31:25,316
显然我刚刚启动了一个 EC2 实例，所以我将点击 EC2 指标。
So obviously I've just launched an EC2 instance, so I'm going to click on EC2 metrics.

8531
14:31:26,414 --> 14:31:29,668
我的新服务器叫 Simplilearn CloudWatch Demo。
And my new server is called Simply Learn CloudWatch Demo.

8532
14:31:30,190 --> 14:31:34,736
我想添加 CPU 利用率。
So I want to add CPU utilization.

8533
14:31:34,896 --> 14:31:35,776
点一下这个。
So let's click on that.

8534
14:31:35,918 --> 14:31:41,028
让我创建这个小组件，现在它就出现在我们的仪表板上了。
So let me create this widget, and then that now appears on our dashboard.

8535
14:31:41,582 --> 14:31:42,416
我们可以再添加一些。
So we can add more.

8536
