8571
14:35:14,670 --> 14:35:25,700
AWS 受信任顾问在成本优化、安全、容错和性能提升四个类别中提供最佳实践或检查。
AWS Trusted Advisor provides best practices or checks in four categories
cost optimization, security, fault tolerance and performance improvement.

8572
14:35:26,478 --> 14:35:31,076
检查状态通过仪表板页面上的颜色代码来显示。
