14:40:51,822 --> 14:41:00,932
拥有一个没有直接互联网路径的私有子网，是保护
内部计算资源免受未经授权的访问的最佳方法之一。
Having a private subnet with no direct path to the internet is one of the best
ways to protect your internal computing resources against unauthorized access.

8624
14:41:01,774 --> 14:41:04,260
第二层级是网络 ACL。
The second level is the network ACLs.

8625
14:41:04,558 --> 14:41:08,804
提供定义子网默认安全行为的能力。
