14:42:12,046 --> 14:42:18,180
在这个例子中，私有子网中的数据库服务器发起了一个公共互联网资源的请求。
In this example, a database server in a private subnet raises a request for a public internet resource.

8636
14:42:18,862 --> 14:42:27,492
由于为私有子网定义的路由表规则，AWS 会通过 NAT
的私有 IP 将此非本地请求路由到 NAT 服务器。
Because of the routing table rules defined for the private subnet, AWS
routes this non-local request to the NAT server via the NAT's private IP.

8637
14:42:28,142 --> 14:42:30,967
NAT 服务器执行重写请求的功能。
The NAT server performs the function of rewriting the request.

8638
14:42:31,438 --> 14:42:41,344
因此，对于外部资源来说，看起来像是 NAT 通过其 154.10.1.3 的公有 IP 在请求此资源。
So to the external resource, it appears that the NAT is requesting this resource via its public IP of 154.10.1.3.

8639
14:42:41,934 --> 14:42:54,180
当外部资源做出响应时，NAT 会反转这一过程，更改原本发往 NAT 公有 IP 地址的数据包，
并将其重新定向到数据库服务器的私有 IP 地址。
When the external resource responds, the NAT reverses the process, changes the packets originally addressed to the NAT's public IP
address, and readdresses them to the private IP address of the database server.

8640
14:42:54,704 --> 14:43:02,564
通过这种方式，仅拥有私有 IP 地址的众多私有实例就可以通过 NAT 实例向互联网发起公共请求。
This way, numerous private instances with only a private IP address can make public requests to the Internet via the NAT instance.

8641
14:43:03,182 --> 14:43:07,780
请记住，NAT 上的源和目的检查必须禁用。
Keep in mind, the source and destination checking must be disabled on the NAT.

8642
14:43:08,974 --> 14:43:13,636
在为 NAT 配置路由表时，你必须记住几点。
While configuring route tables for NAT, you have to keep in mind a few points.

8643
14:43:14,158 --> 14:43:18,020
你可以创建路由表并将它们分别与子网关联。
You can create route tables and associate them each with a subnet.

8644
14:43:18,798 --> 14:43:22,660
公有子网通过互联网网关路由非本地流量。
Public subnets route non-local traffic through the Internet Gateway.

8645
14:43:23,374 --> 14:43:28,132
私有子网通过 NAT 实例或 NAT 网关路由非本地流量。
Private subnets route non-local traffic through the NAT instance or NAT gateway.

8646
14:43:29,070 --> 14:43:33,092
你在使用 NAT 时可能会遇到的一个常见场景是端口转发。
A common scenario that you might face with Nats is port forwarding.

8647
14:43:33,646 --> 14:43:38,340
你已经学习了如何使用 NAT 为私有子网提供互联网访问。
You have learned how to use NAT to provide access for the private subnet to the Internet.

8648
14:43:38,958 --> 14:43:45,220
但如果你想开放私有子网中的特定资源，并让它在互联网上可用呢？
But what if you wanted to open up a specific resource in the private subnet and make it available from the Internet?

8649
14:43:45,646 --> 14:43:54,116
例如，假设你在私有子网的一台机器上运行一个内部缺陷跟踪数据库，
它作为 Web 服务器运行在 80 端口。
For example, assume that you have an internal defect tracking database
running as a web server on port 80 on a machine in your private subnet.

8650
14:43:54,576 --> 14:44:02,820
你想通过 NAT 将此资源暴露给互联网，以便选定的客户和合作伙伴能够看到你的开发进程。
You want to expose this resource to the internet via your NAT so that
select customers and partners have visibility into your development process.

8651
14:44:03,662 --> 14:44:12,132
要使用 NAT 实例实现此场景，你必须登录到该实
例，并配置它将所有请求转发到 NAT 的 80 端口。
To enable this scenario using a NAT instance, you have to log in to the
instance and configure it to forward all requests to port 80 of your NAT.

8652
14:44:13,006 --> 14:44:17,796
流量将被转发到你私有子网中的 Amazon EC2 实例上。
The traffic will be forwarded onto an Amazon EC2 instance in your private subnet.

8653
14:44:18,414 --> 14:44:22,148
不过，NAT 网关目前还不支持端口转发。
However, the NAT gateway does not support port forwarding yet.

8654
14:44:22,862 --> 14:44:27,684
所以，如果你的基础设施需要这个功能，你就需要设置一个 NAT 实例。
So if this feature is required in your infrastructure, you need to set up a NAT instance.

8655
14:44:29,326 --> 14:44:40,484
你可以在 VPC 的公有子网中使用 NAT 实例，让私有子网
中的实例能够发起对互联网或其他 AWS 服务的外出流量。
You can use a NAT instance in a public subnet in your VPC to enable instances in the
private subnet to initiate outbound traffic to the Internet or other AWS services.

8656
14:44:41,102 --> 14:44:46,372
但你可以防止互联网上的其他人发起入站流量到这些实例。
But you can prevent the instances from receiving inbound traffic initiated by someone on the internet.

8657
14:44:47,118 --> 14:44:54,308
这张幻灯片展示了私有子网中运行的实例与互联网通过 NAT 实例之间的通信。
This slide illustrates the communication between the instances running
in the private subnet and the Internet through the NAT instance.

8658
14:44:55,182 --> 14:45:01,860
主路由表将私有子网实例的流量发送到公有子网中的 NAT 实例。
The main route table sends the traffic from the instances in the private subnet to the NAT instance in the public subnet.

8659
14:45:02,670 --> 14:45:06,852
NAT 实例将流量发送到 VPC 的互联网网关。
The NAT instance sends the traffic to the Internet gateway for the VPC.

8660
14:45:07,246 --> 14:45:11,396
流量会被归属到 NAT 实例的弹性 IP 地址。
The traffic is attributed to the elastic IP address of the NAT instance.

8661
14:45:11,982 --> 14:45:15,492
NAT 实例为响应指定一个高端口号。
The NAT instance specifies a high port number for the response.

8662
14:45:15,982 --> 14:45:23,620
如果有响应返回，NAT 实例会根据响应的端口号将其发送到私有子网中的实例。
If a response comes back, the NAT instance sends it to an instance in the private subnet based on the port number for the response.

8663
14:45:25,038 --> 14:45:31,748
要将 Amazon EC2 实例配置为 NAT，你必须在实例上启用 IP 伪装。
To configure an Amazon EC2 instance as a NAT, you must enable IP masquerading on the instance.

8664
14:45:32,174 --> 14:45:39,716
这可以通过手动操作完成，或者你可以搜索 AWS 社区提供的预配置好的 NAT AMI 镜像。
It can be done manually or you can search for an AWS community AMI image that is pre-configured to serve as a NAT.

8665
14:45:40,462 --> 14:45:46,020
确保你选择的镜像具有与你所使用的实例系列匹配的正确虚拟化类型。
Ensure that you choose an image with the correct virtualization type for the instance family you are using.

8666
14:45:46,510 --> 14:45:53,188
例如，如果你打算将 NAT 部署为 T2 实例，就不能使用 PV 镜像。
For example, you cannot use a PV image for your NAT if you plan to deploy the NAT as a T2 instance.

8667
14:45:53,870 --> 14:45:57,828
确保 NAT 上的源检查和目的检查已禁用。
Ensure that the source and destination checking is disabled on the NAT.

8668
14:45:58,446 --> 14:46:08,164
源和目的检查是 Amazon EC2 实例的一项功能，它
会指示实例丢弃非专门发给该实例的网络数据包。
Source and destination checking is a feature on Amazon EC2 instances that informs the
instance to drop network packets that are not specifically addressed to the instance.

8669
14:46:08,814 --> 14:46:17,060
由于 NAT 实例的工作是作为其他实例网络流量的代理，因此必须禁用此功能。
As the job of a NAT instance is to serve as a proxy for the network
traffic of other instances, this feature must be disabled on your NAT.

8670
14:46:18,286 --> 14:46:22,692
请记住，单个 NAT 实例可能会成为单点故障。
Keep in mind that a single NAT instance can become the single point of failure.

8671
14:46:23,054 --> 14:46:34,500
因此，如果你正在使用 NAT 实例且高可用性对你的设置很重要，
那么可以考虑实施双可用区 NAT 实例设计，作为高可用故障转移解决方案。
So if you are using a NAT instance and high availability is important for your setup,
then consider implementing a two availability zone NAT instance design as a high availability failover solution.

8672
14:46:35,182 --> 14:46:38,692
当与自动扩展结合使用时，它的效果会更显著。
It will prove more effective when used together with auto-scaling.

8673
14:46:39,310 --> 14:46:43,524
对于 Web 访问，你还可以使用 Squid Proxy 架构。
For web access, you can also use Squid Proxy architecture.

8674
14:46:44,622 --> 14:46:59,908
目前最现代且推荐的方法是使用网络地址转换或 NAT 网关，
让私有子网中的实例连接到互联网或其他 AWS 服务，同时防止互联网发起与这些实例的连接。
The most modern and recommended way to enable instances in a private subnet to connect to the Internet or other AWS services,
but prevent the Internet from initiating a connection with those instances is to use a network address translation or NAT gateway.

8675
14:47:00,590 --> 14:47:06,244
NAT 网关是 AWS 管理的高可用且可自动扩展的服务。
A NAT gateway is a highly available and automatically scalable service managed by AWS.

8676
14:47:06,766 --> 14:47:09,892
然而，NAT 网关并不是免费服务。
However, a NAT gateway is not a free service.

8677
14:47:10,318 --> 14:47:14,244
NAT 网关按每小时使用量和数据处理量收费。
A NAT gateway is charged for hourly usage and data processing.

8678
14:47:14,798 --> 14:47:19,716
此外，Amazon EC2 的数据转移费用也同样适用。
In addition, Amazon EC two charges for data transfer also apply.

8679
14:47:20,526 --> 14:47:26,016
NAT 网关在可用区内具有冗余性，但在整个区域内不具备。
A NAT gateway is redundant inside the availability zone, but not in the whole region.

8680
14:47:26,574 --> 14:47:34,724
如果 NAT 网关所在的可用区宕机，其他可用区中的资源将失去互联网访问能力。
In the event that the availability zone of the NAT gateway is down,
resources in the other availability zones will lose Internet access.

8681
14:47:34,958 --> 14:47:47,588
为了创建独立于可用区的架构，你可以在每个可用区创建一个 NAT 网关，
并配置路由以确保资源使用相同可用区内的 NAT 网关。
To create an availability zone independent architecture, you can create a NAT gateway in each availability zone and configure the
routing to ensure that resources use the NAT gateway in the same availability zone.

8682
14:47:48,718 --> 14:47:55,140
NAT 网关支持高达每秒 10 Gbps 的带宽突发流量。
A NAT gateway supports bursts of up to 10 gigabits per second or 10 gbps of bandwidth.

8683
14:47:55,758 --> 14:48:06,180
如果你需要的突发流量超过 10 Gbps，可以通过将资源拆分到
多个子网并为每个子网创建一个 NAT 网关来分配工作负载。
If you require more than a 10 Gbps burst, you can distribute the workload by splitting
your resources into multiple subnets and creating a NAT gateway in each subnet.

8684
14:48:07,054 --> 14:48:10,340
NAT 网关需要一个弹性 IP 地址。
A NAT gateway requires one elastic IP address.

8685
14:48:10,766 --> 14:48:16,292
NAT 网关创建后，你无法将其与弹性 IP 地址解绑。
You cannot disassociate an elastic IP address from a NAT gateway after it has been created.

8686
14:48:16,942 --> 14:48:30,948
如果你需要为 NAT 网关使用不同的弹性 IP 地址，必须创建一个带有所需地址的新 NAT 网关，
更新你的路由表，然后在不再需要时删除现有的 NAT 网关。
If you need to use a different elastic IP address for your NAT gateway, you must create a new NAT gateway with the required address,
update your route tables, and then delete the existing NAT gateway if it is no longer required.

8687
14:48:31,566 --> 14:48:39,204
NAT 网关支持传输控制协议、用户数据报协议和互联网控制消息协议。
A NAT gateway supports transfer control protocol, user datagram protocol, and the Internet Control Message Protocol.

8688
14:48:39,982 --> 14:48:43,172
你不能将安全组与 NAT 网关关联。
You cannot associate a security group with a NAT gateway.

8689
14:48:43,726 --> 14:48:50,916
你只能使用私有子网中实例的安全组来控制到这些实例的进出流量。
You can only use the security groups for your instances in the private subnet to control the traffic to and from those instances.

8690
14:48:51,822 --> 14:48:59,300
你可以使用网络 ACL 来控制 NAT 网关所在子网的进出流量。
You can use a network ACL to control the traffic to and from the subnet in which the NAT gateway is located.

8691
14:48:59,758 --> 14:49:02,948
网络 ACL 适用于 NAT 网关的流量。
The network ACL applies to the NAT gateway's traffic.

8692
14:49:03,566 --> 14:49:08,740
NAT 网关使用 1024 到 65535 端口。
A NAT gateway uses the ports 1024 through 65535.

8693
14:49:09,646 --> 14:49:19,524
创建 NAT 网关时，它会获得一个弹性网络接口，并自
动从你的子网 IP 地址范围中分配一个私有 IP 地址。
When a NAT gateway is created, it receives an elastic network interface that's
automatically assigned a private IP address from the IP address range of your subnet.

8694
14:49:20,142 --> 14:49:24,964
你可以在 Amazon EC2 控制台中查看 NAT 网关的网络接口。
You can view the NAT Gateway's network interface in the Amazon EC2 console.

8695
14:49:25,742 --> 14:49:29,700
在这次演示中，我们将学习如何创建和使用 NAT 网关。
In this demonstration, we'll learn how to create and use NAT Gateway.

8696
14:49:30,158 --> 14:49:34,980
在之前的演示中，我们创建了一个带有私有和公共子网的新 VPC。
In the previous demonstration, we created a new VPC with private and public subnet.

8697
14:49:37,518 --> 14:49:41,284
在这次演示中，我在私有子网中创建了一个实例。
For this demonstration, I have created an instance in a private subnet.

8698
14:49:44,142 --> 14:49:47,460
它没有公共 IP，只有私有 IP。
It does not have a public IP, but only a private one.

8699
14:49:47,822 --> 14:49:50,052
所以它无法访问互联网。
So it does not have access to the internet.

8700
14:49:51,854 --> 14:50:00,100
我在公共子网中又创建了一个实例作为 Bastion
host，然后我们将从该主机使用 SSH 进行端口转发。
I created one more instance in a public subnet to be used as Bastion host, and then from that host, we'll use SSH for port forwarding.

8701
14:50:02,030 --> 14:50:07,812
现在让我们登录到私有实例，验证它是否真的能从 VPC 外部进行 ping。
Now let's log into the private instance and verify if it really can ping from outside the VPC.

8702
14:50:10,158 --> 14:50:12,196
首先，让我们检查一下 Bastion host。
First, let's check the Bastion host.

8703
14:50:14,190 --> 14:50:15,844
我们试着从它 ping 一些东西。
We'll try to ping something from it.

8704
14:50:19,054 --> 14:50:23,172
Google 的 URL 对测试网络连接非常有用。
The Google URL proves very useful for testing network connections.

8705
14:50:36,238 --> 14:50:38,372
好的，我们可以看到它正在工作。
Okay, so we can see it is working.

8706
14:50:39,150 --> 14:50:42,340
接下来，让我们试着从其他地方 ping 私有实例。
Next, let's try to ping the private instance somewhere else.

8707
14:50:42,672 --> 14:50:44,580
所以它是 165。
So it's 165.

8708
14:50:47,918 --> 14:50:50,276
好的，私有实例可以 ping 通。
Okay, the private instance is pingable.

8709
14:50:50,670 --> 14:50:52,580
我们现在试着 SSH 连接到它。
We'll now try to SSH to it.

8710
14:50:57,166 --> 14:51:02,820
如你所见，我们已经在私有实例里了，所以 Bastion host 也运行正常。
As you can see, we are in the private instance, so the Bastion host is also working fine.

8711
14:51:03,598 --> 14:51:07,268
现在让我们试着从私有实例 ping 互联网上的东西。
And now let's try to ping something on the internet from the private instance.

8712
14:51:09,838 --> 14:51:13,152
如你所见，私有网络正在连接到互联网。
As you can see, the private network is connecting to the internet.

8713
14:51:13,646 --> 14:51:15,492
我们先让这个 ping 继续运行一会儿。
We'll leave this ping running for now.

8714
14:51:18,190 --> 14:51:21,252
现在我们继续创建 NAT 网关。
And now let's proceed with creating the NAT gateway.

8715
14:51:23,694 --> 14:51:24,900
我们进入服务。
We'll go to services.

8716
14:51:29,262 --> 14:51:30,468
然后选择 BPC。
Then BPC.

8717
14:51:36,206 --> 14:51:37,732
接着进入 NAT 网关。
And then to Nat Gateways.

8718
14:51:40,270 --> 14:51:41,796
我们要创建一个 NAT 网关。
We'll create a NAT gateway.

8719
14:51:48,110 --> 14:51:50,596
我们要把它创建在公有子网中。
And we are going to create it in public subnet.

8720
14:51:55,246 --> 14:51:57,092
它需要一个弹性 IP。
It wants an elastic IP.

8721
14:51:57,518 --> 14:52:01,956
目前我们还没有任何弹性 IP，所以我们要创建一个新的。
Right now we do not have any elastic IPs, and so we will create a new one.

8722
14:52:07,534 --> 14:52:09,860
现在我们准备好创建 NAT 网关了。
We are now ready to create a NAT gateway.

8723
14:52:21,006 --> 14:52:24,804
如你所见，NAT 网关的状态显示为“待处理”。
As you can see, the status of the NAT gateway is shown as pending.

8724
14:52:25,230 --> 14:52:26,628
这需要几分钟时间。
It takes a couple of minutes.

8725
14:52:30,894 --> 14:52:32,132
现在它已经启动并运行了。
Now it is up and running.

8726
14:52:32,590 --> 14:52:35,300
现在让我们编辑私有子网的路由表。
Let's now edit the route table for the private subnet.

8727
14:52:36,686 --> 14:52:37,892
我们进入子网，
We'll go to subnets,

8728
14:52:42,638 --> 14:52:45,220
私有子网，然后是路由表。
private subnet, and then route table.

8729
14:52:47,662 --> 14:52:52,932
点击路由表链接，或者既然我们知道了 ID，也可以从路由表列表中选择它。
Click the route table link, or now that we know the ID, we can pick it from the route table list.

8730
14:53:05,038 --> 14:53:07,876
选择路由表，现在让我们编辑它的路由。
Select the route table, and now let's edit its routes.

8731
14:53:14,894 --> 14:53:16,964
我们现在要再添加一条路由。
We'll now add one more route to it.

8732
14:53:26,990 --> 14:53:33,476
这样，所有超出默认 VPC CIDR block 的流量，都会通过我们的 NAT 网关发出。
So all the traffic that goes outside the default VPC, CIDR block, will go out our NAT gateway.

8733
14:53:51,246 --> 14:53:53,017
如果你愿意，还可以添加更多路由。
You can add more routes if you want.

8734
14:53:53,550 --> 14:53:54,756
我们现在点击保存。
We'll click save now.

8735
14:53:59,726 --> 14:54:03,172
如你所见，私有实例已经开始 ping Google 了。
As you can see, the private instance has started pinging Google.

8736
14:54:03,470 --> 14:54:06,756
所以 NAT 网关和路由表运行正常。
So the Nat Gateway and the route table are working fine.

8737
14:54:23,407 --> 14:54:29,287
安全组通过协议、端口以及源或目的来控制对成员实例的访问。
Security groups control access to their member instances by protocol, port, and source or destination.

8738
14:54:30,190 --> 14:54:40,420
你可以使用单个 IP 地址、CIDR block 或资源的 ID，例如实例 ID 或安全组 ID，作为源或目的。
You can use a single IP address, CIDR block, or ID of the resource, for
example, instance ID or security group ID as the source or destination.

8739
14:54:42,574 --> 14:54:50,724
关于安全组的一些重要事项是，一个 ENI 最多只能关联 5 个安全组，这是一个软限制。
Some important things about security groups are only 5x security groups can be associated with an ENI, which is a soft limit.

8740
14:54:51,214 --> 14:54:56,516
每个 VPC 有 100 个安全组的限制，这也是一个软限制。
There is a limit of 100X security groups per VPC, which is a soft limit.

8741
14:54:57,102 --> 14:54:59,588
默认情况下，不允许任何入站流量。
By default, no inbound traffic is allowed.

8742
14:54:59,886 --> 14:55:02,276
然而，所有的出站流量都是允许的。
However, all outbound traffic is allowed.

8743
14:55:02,862 --> 14:55:06,724
针对入站请求的所有出站流量都是允许的。
All outbound traffic in response to an inbound request is permitted.

8744
14:55:07,182 --> 14:55:11,812
默认情况下，属于同一个安全组的实例之间无法互相通信。
Instances that are part of the same security group cannot communicate with each other by default.

8745
14:55:12,462 --> 14:55:15,920
让我们来看看一些安全组运行的示例。
Let's take a look at some examples of security groups in action.

8746
14:55:16,080 --> 14:55:30,820
在第一个例子中，源描述为 0.0.0.0.0，表示互联网上的任何
计算机都可以访问我们实例上监听 80 端口的 Web 服务器。
In the first example, there is a source description of 0.0.0.0.0 to specify that any computer from anywhere on the internet can access
a web server on our instance that is listening on port 80.

8747
14:55:31,182 --> 14:55:38,884
请注意，限制 IP 访问的安全组实际上是使用 CIDR 记法来指定 IP 范围的。
Note that security groups that restrict access by IP actually specify an IP range using CIDR notations.

8748
14:55:39,662 --> 14:55:44,132
在第二个例子中，仅允许来自特定 IP 地址的访问。
In the second example, access is allowed only from a specific IP address.

8749
14:55:44,814 --> 14:55:50,212
在第三个例子中，仅允许来自特定安全组的 SSH 访问。
In the third example, SSH access is allowed only from a particular security group.

8750
14:55:51,630 --> 14:55:56,068
安全组有一些重要的限制，需要大家留意。
There are some important limitations for security groups that you need to keep in mind.

8751
14:55:56,846 --> 14:56:00,516
每个安全组的规则数量软限制为 50 条。
The number of rules per security group is soft limited by 50.

8752
14:56:01,390 --> 14:56:04,516
安全组的数量软限制为 5 个。
The number of security groups is soft limited by 5.

8753
14:56:05,454 --> 14:56:10,724
默认情况下，每个 VPC 的最大安全组数量限制为 100 个。
The maximum number of security groups is limited to 100 per VPC by default.

8754
14:56:12,302 --> 14:56:17,124
默认情况下，您的 AWS 账户限制为 100 个安全组。
Your AWS account is limited to 100 security groups by default.

8755
14:56:17,710 --> 14:56:29,540
虽然您可以增加这个限制，但拥有大量的安全组不仅会对您的网络产生负面的性能影响，
还会影响到托管在相同硬件上的其他网络。
While you can increase this limit, having a large number of security groups can lead to a negative performance impact not just on your
network, but on other networks hosted on the same hardware as well.

8756
14:56:30,222 --> 14:56:33,348
最好保持在 100 个安全组的限制之内。
It's best to stay within the 100 security group limit.

8757
14:56:33,838 --> 14:56:48,100
随着 VPC 中安全组数量的增加，您应该基于 CIDR block 创建安全组，而不是基于 EC2 服务器、
网络接口和其他安全组等资源 ID 来创建。
And as the number of security groups in your VPC increases, you should create security groups based around CIDR blocks instead of
around resource IDs such as EC2 servers, network interfaces, and other security groups.

8758
14:56:49,678 --> 14:56:55,268
在 VPC 内部，安全控制是使用安全组和 NACLs 来实现的。
Within a VPC, security is controlled using security groups and NACLs.

8759
14:56:55,854 --> 14:57:00,484
NACLs 与 VPC 内的特定子网相关联。
The NACLs are associated with specific subnets within a VPC.

8760
14:57:01,038 --> 14:57:08,004
由于 NACLs 是无状态的，必须同时定义入站和出站规则，即入站和出站。
As NACLs are stateless, both inbound and outbound rules, ingress and egress, must be defined.

8761
14:57:08,526 --> 14:57:15,780
您可以通过指定规则类型来定义入站和出站规则，例如自定义 TCP。
You can define the inbound and outbound rules by specifying the type of rule, for example, custom TCP.

8762
14:57:16,558 --> 14:57:17,892
提供一个规则编号。
Providing a rule number.

8763
14:57:18,286 --> 14:57:21,764
请记住，规则是按从低到高的顺序处理的。
Keep in mind, rules are processed from the lowest to the highest.

8764
14:57:22,702 --> 14:57:26,596
定义允许或拒绝的出入端口范围。
Defining the port range that will be allowed or denied in or out.

8765
14:57:27,662 --> 14:57:34,116
指定允许或拒绝的出入源或目标 IP 地址或范围。
Specifying the source or destination IP address or range that will be allowed or denied in or out.

8766
14:57:35,214 --> 14:57:41,252
定义好 NACL 后，它可以与 VPC 内的子网相关联。
After the NACL has been defined, it can be associated to subnets within the VPC.

8767
14:57:42,286 --> 14:57:49,860
AWS 官方建议为 VPC 向导提供的四种配置中的每一种都提供一套网络 ACLs。
AWS officially recommends a set of network ACLs for each of the four configurations offered by the VPC wizard.

8768
14:57:50,446 --> 14:57:57,764
由于这些配置涉及提供特定于您私有网络的数值，因此必须手动实施。
As these configurations involve supplying values that are specific to your private network, they must be implemented manually.

8769
14:57:58,958 --> 14:58:04,772
放置群组是单个可用区内高性能实例的物理分组。
Placement groups are physical groupings of high performance instances in a single availability zone.

8770
14:58:05,422 --> 14:58:09,700
这些实例使用增强型网络，并实现最大化的持续吞吐量。
The instances use enhanced networking with maximized consistent throughput.

8771
14:58:10,414 --> 14:58:17,380
放置群组对于集群数据库、大数据并行处理或图形渲染非常有用。
Placement groups are very useful for cluster databases and parallel processing for big data or rendering of graphics.

8772
14:58:18,574 --> 14:58:27,300
AWS 身份与访问管理，即 IAM，是一个帮助安全控制对 AWS 资源访问的 Web 服务。
AWS Identity and Access Management, or IAM, is a web service that helps to securely control access to AWS resources.

8773
14:58:28,174 --> 14:58:34,756
IAM 提供了一个集中式环境，您可以在其中管理用户、组、角色和权限。
IAM provides a centralized environment in which you can administer users, groups, roles, and permissions.

8774
14:58:35,406 --> 14:58:45,892
IAM 与 AWS 集成，在服务、应用程序接口（API）和资源层面提供细粒度的访问控制。
IAM is integrated with AWS, providing granular level access control at
the service, application program interface or API, and resource levels.

8775
14:58:46,798 --> 14:58:52,196
AWS IAM 是一项免费服务，涵盖所有的 AWS 区域。
AWS IAM is a free service which spans across all AWS regions.

8776
14:58:52,622 --> 14:58:58,628
通过 IAM，您可以实现企业目录与 AWS 之间的身份联合。
With IAM, you can enable identity federation between your corporate directory and AWS.

8777
14:58:59,374 --> 14:59:10,852
这意味着您可以使用现有的企业身份来授予访问 AWS 资源（如 Amazon S3 存储桶）的权限，
而无需为用户创建新的 AWS 身份。
This means you can use existing corporate identities to grant secure access to AWS resources, such as Amazon S3 buckets,
without creating new AWS identities for the users.

8778
14:59:11,630 --> 14:59:18,020
您可以创建用户，并定义组和角色，以安全地控制对 AWS 资源的访问。
You can create users and define groups and roles to securely control access to AWS resources.

8779
14:59:19,502 --> 14:59:24,004
AWS 提供多种安全保护 AWS 资源的方法。
AWS provides various ways of securing the AWS resources.

8780
14:59:24,782 --> 14:59:31,204
IAM 用户、IAM 组、IAM 角色、IAM 访问密钥。
IAM users, IAM groups, IAM roles, IAM Access Keys.

8781
14:59:31,694 --> 14:59:34,436
您将在课程中详细了解其中的每一个。
You'll learn about each of them in detail in the lesson.

8782
14:59:36,654 --> 14:59:41,572
IAM 用户不是独立的账户，它们是您账户内的用户。
IAM users are not separate accounts, they are users within your account.

8783
14:59:41,998 --> 14:59:48,004
您可以创建 IAM 用户，并根据您想要提供的权限，将他们添加到组中或从组中删除。
You can create IAM users and add or delete them from groups based on the permissions you want to provide.

8784
14:59:48,622 --> 14:59:53,700
IAM 提供唯一的安全凭据，可用于访问 AWS。
IAM provides unique security credentials that can be used to access AWS.

8785
14:59:54,318 --> 15:00:03,076
IAM 消除了共享密码或访问密钥的必要性，并方便您根据需要启用或禁用用户的访问权限。
IAM eliminates the need to share passwords or access keys and makes it
easy to enable or disable a user's access as is considered appropriate.

8786
15:00:03,918 --> 15:00:12,484
AWS IAM 允许您创建多个用户，并在他们的 AWS 账户中管理每个用户的权限。
AWS IAM enables you to create multiple users and manage the permissions for each of these users within their AWS account.

8787
15:00:13,102 --> 15:00:18,532
您可以为每个用户提供独立的密码，用于访问 AWS 管理控制台。
You can provide each user with its own password for access to the AWS management console.

8788
15:00:19,182 --> 15:00:24,228
您可以管理用户的密码，包括强度、关联和重置。
You can manage the user's passwords, including strength, link, and password reset.

8789
15:00:24,942 --> 15:00:34,212
您还可以为每个用户创建单独的访问密钥，以便用户可以通过程序请求来操作您账户中的资源。
You can also create an individual access key for each user so that the
user can make programmatic requests to work with resources in your account.

8790
15:00:34,510 --> 15:00:37,668
您可以根据需要随时撤销访问密钥。
You can revoke the access key as and when required.

8791
15:00:38,382 --> 15:00:45,220
AWS IAM 允许您为特权用户管理多因素身份验证（MFA）。
AWS IAM allows you to administer multifactor authentication, or MFA, for privileged users.

8792
15:00:45,806 --> 15:00:48,836
请注意，用户不一定非得是人类。
Note that a user does not necessarily have to be a human.

8793
15:00:49,262 --> 15:00:59,396
您可以创建一个 IAM 用户，为在您的 AWS 或企业网
络中运行且需要访问 AWS 的应用程序生成访问密钥。
You can create an IAM user in order to generate an access key for an
application that runs in your AWS or corporate network and needs AWS access.

8794
15:01:01,742 --> 15:01:09,892
默认情况下，新的 IAM 用户没有权限执行任何 AWS 操作或访问任何 AWS 资源。
A new IAM user by default is not authorized to perform any AWS action or access any AWS resources.

8795
15:01:10,446 --> 15:01:12,740
您需要为用户提供访问权限。
You need to provide access to the users.

8796
15:01:13,358 --> 15:01:22,564
您可以为少数用户分配管理权限，他们反过来可以
管理您的 AWS 资源，并创建和管理其他 IAM 用户。
You can assign administrative permissions to a few users, who in turn
can administer your AWS resources and create and manage other IAM users.

8797
15:01:23,278 --> 15:01:29,296
拥有独立 IAM 用户的一个优点是，您可以分别为每个用户分配权限。
An advantage of having individual IAM users is that you can assign permissions individually to each.

8798
15:01:29,486 --> 15:01:33,412
在分配权限时，最好遵循最小权限原则。
It's best to use a least privileged policy when assigning permissions.

8799
15:01:33,838 --> 15:01:42,340
将用户的权限限制在他们工作所需的 AWS 操作和资源范围内，可以减少出错的概率。
Limiting a user's permissions to just the AWS actions and resources
that the user needs for his or her job reduces chances of mistakes.

8800
15:01:42,862 --> 15:01:46,596
您可以根据需要随时增加访问权限。
You can always increase access permissions as and when required.

8801
15:01:47,150 --> 15:01:53,316
然而，在大型组织中为个人分配权限可能会变成维护噩梦。
However, assigning permissions to individuals in a big organization can become a maintenance nightmare.

8802
15:01:53,742 --> 15:02:00,196
随着列表越来越长，很难评估具体授予了哪些用户哪些权限。
As the list keeps getting longer, it becomes difficult to assess which particular user has been granted what permissions.

8803
15:02:00,814 --> 15:02:07,108
使用组可以简化同时为大量用户添加或移除权限的任务。
Using groups simplifies the task of adding or removing permissions to a large number of users simultaneously.

8804
15:02:08,782 --> 15:02:12,260
IAM 组是 IAM 用户的集合。
An IAM group is a collection of IAM users.

8805
15:02:12,750 --> 15:02:19,332
IAM 组允许你按功能、部门或责任级别定义一组权限。
IAM groups allow you to define sets of permissions by function, department, or level of responsibility.

8806
15:02:19,822 --> 15:02:35,972
为了增强 AWS 账户的安全性，强烈建议你根据最小权限原则创建一组对应的组，
即仅授予用户和应用程序执行分配任务所需的必要权限。
To provide added security to your AWS account, it is strongly encouraged that you create a set of groups corresponding to the least
privileged principle, which is grant your users and applications the necessary permissions to perform only the tasks assigned to them.

8807
15:02:36,622 --> 15:02:46,148
例如，对于仅负责生成账单报告的用户，没有理由授予其 EC2 读取权限。
For example, there is no reason to assign EC2 read permissions to a
user whose only job with regard to AWS is to generate billing reports.

8808
15:02:46,894 --> 15:02:51,332
关于 IAM 组，有几点需要注意。
There are a few points that you need to keep in mind with regard to IAM groups.

8809
15:02:51,886 --> 15:02:56,804
一个组可以包含多个用户，而一个用户也可以属于多个组。
A group can contain many users, and a user can belong to multiple groups.

8810
15:02:57,742 --> 15:02:59,332
组不能嵌套。
Groups can't be nested.

8811
15:02:59,726 --> 15:03:02,564
它们只能包含用户，而不能包含其他组。
They can only contain users and not other groups.

8812
15:03:03,534 --> 15:03:08,516
AWS 账户中没有默认组会自动包含所有用户。
There's no default group that automatically includes all users in the AWS account.

8813
15:03:09,006 --> 15:03:14,180
如果你想要一个默认组，你需要创建它并将每个新用户分配到该组中。
If you want to have a default group, you need to create it and assign each new user to it.

8814
15:03:15,406 --> 15:03:21,444
你可以拥有的组数量有限，且用户可以加入的组数量也有限制。
There's a limit to the number of groups you can have and a limit to how many groups a user can be a part of.

8815
15:03:22,350 --> 15:03:26,500
现在让我们通过一个例子来了解 IAM 组是如何工作的。
Let's now study an example to understand how IAM groups work.

8816
15:03:28,206 --> 15:03:32,388
这张图展示了一个为小型公司创建的组示例。
The diagram presents an example of groups created for a small company.

8817
15:03:32,910 --> 15:03:40,132
公司所有者创建了一个 admins 组，并添加用户到
其中，以便随着公司的成长来创建和管理其他用户。
The company owner creates an admins group and adds users to it to create and manage other users as the company grows.

8818
15:03:40,814 --> 15:03:44,132
admins 组创建了一个 development 组和一个 test 组。
The admins group creates a development group and a test group.

8819
15:03:44,622 --> 15:03:50,084
这些组中的每一个都由与 AWS 交互的用户、人类和应用程序组成。
Each of these groups consists of users, humans, and applications that interact with AWS.

8820
15:03:50,606 --> 15:03:53,860
每个用户都有一套独立的身份凭据。
Each user has an individual set of security credentials.

8821
15:03:54,574 --> 15:03:57,988
在这个例子中，每个用户属于一个组。
In this example, each user belongs to a single group.

8822
15:03:58,478 --> 15:04:01,476
不过，用户也可以同时属于多个组。
However, users can belong to multiple groups as well.

8823
15:04:01,934 --> 15:04:09,604
例如，如果你需要授予来自 development 组的某人管理员权限，只需将其添加到 admins 组即可。
For instance, if you need to grant a permission from the development group admin privileges,
you can simply add that person to the admins group.

8824
15:04:10,286 --> 15:04:15,300
结果就是，这个人现在同时属于 development 组和 admins 组。
As a result, the person now belongs to both the development group and the admins group.

8825
15:04:16,878 --> 15:04:24,164
到目前为止，我们讨论了利用特定于用户的唯一身份来访问 AWS 资源。
Till now, we have discussed accessing the AWS resources with the help of unique identities that are particular to a user.

8826
15:04:24,590 --> 15:04:30,276
不过，你也可以扮演角色，为了特定任务临时获取权限。
However, you can also assume a role to temporarily take on permissions for a specific task.

8827
15:04:30,990 --> 15:04:40,452
角色允许你定义用户或服务访问资源所需的一组权限，但这些权限不绑定到任何 IAM 用户或组上。
A role lets you define a set of permissions to access the resources that a user or service needs,
but the permissions are not attached to any IAM user or group.

8828
15:04:40,942 --> 15:04:44,836
相反，在运行时，用户可以通过程序方式扮演角色。
Instead, at runtime, users can programmatically assume a role.

8829
15:04:45,390 --> 15:04:54,180
当角色被扮演时，AWS 会提供临时身份凭据，用户或应用程序可以使用这些凭据向 AWS 发送请求。
When a role is assumed, AWS provides temporary security credentials that the user or application can use to make requests to AWS.

8830
15:04:54,766 --> 15:05:02,052
因此，你不需要为每个需要访问资源的实体创建长期身份凭据。
Consequently, you don't need to create long term security credentials for each entity that requires access to a resource.

8831
15:05:02,734 --> 15:05:07,364
AWS 会每天自动轮换身份凭据。
AWS rotates the security credentials automatically on a daily basis.

8832
15:05:07,726 --> 15:05:13,060
新凭据将在旧凭据过期前至少五分钟可用。
The new credentials become available at least five minutes prior to the expiration of the old ones.

8833
15:05:14,478 --> 15:05:22,340
你需要根据要求为用户、组或角色分配权限，以便他们能够安全地访问 AWS 资源。
You need to assign permissions to a user, group, or role as required so they can securely access the AWS resources.

8834
15:05:22,894 --> 15:05:30,468
要分配权限，你需要创建一个策略并将其附加，策略是一个明确列出权限的 JSON 文档。
To assign permissions, you need to create and attach a policy, which is a JSON document that explicitly lists the permissions.

8835
15:05:31,150 --> 15:05:34,756
策略可以让你指定以下操作。
A policy lets you specify the following Actions.

8836
15:05:35,182 --> 15:05:36,708
你将允许哪些操作？
What actions will you allow?

8837
15:05:37,198 --> 15:05:40,080
每个 AWS 服务都有其特定的操作集。
Each AWS service has its own set of actions.

8838
15:05:40,398 --> 15:05:48,292
例如，你可以允许用户使用 Amazon S3 的列出存储桶操作，
该操作会返回存储桶中项目的相关信息。
For example, you might allow a user to use the Amazon S3 list bucket action, which returns information about the items in a bucket.

8839
15:05:48,910 --> 15:05:52,132
任何你没有明确允许的操作都会被拒绝。
Any action that you don't explicitly allow are denied.

8840
15:05:53,134 --> 15:05:57,412
资源：你将在哪些资源上允许这些操作？
Resources On which of these resources will you allow the action?

8841
15:05:57,998 --> 15:06:04,740
例如，你将允许用户在哪些特定的 Amazon S3 存储桶上执行列出存储桶操作？
For example, on which specific Amazon S3 buckets will you allow the user to perform the list bucket action?

8842
15:06:05,390 --> 15:06:10,244
用户无法访问你未明确授予权限的资源。
Users cannot access a resource that you have not explicitly granted permissions to.

8843
15:06:11,118 --> 15:06:15,440
效果：当用户请求访问时，效果会是什么？
Effect What will be the effect when a user requests access?

8844
15:06:15,726 --> 15:06:17,700
你是要允许还是拒绝它？
Are you going to allow or deny it?

8845
15:06:18,382 --> 15:06:21,860
默认情况下，AWS 资源对用户是拒绝访问的。
AWS resources are denied to users by default.

8846
15:06:22,318 --> 15:06:27,588
你需要指定你希望允许特定用户访问特定资源。
You need to specify that you want to allow a particular user access to a specific resource.

8847
15:06:29,294 --> 15:06:35,300
另一种安全访问 AWS 资源的方法是通过 IAM 访问密钥。
Another way of securely accessing the AWS resources is via IAM access keys.

8848
15:06:35,758 --> 15:06:41,252
IAM 访问密钥是加密生成的密钥，代表你的账户。
The IAM access keys are cryptographically generated keys that represent your account.

8849
15:06:41,902 --> 15:06:48,196
访问密钥由两个部分组成：访问密钥 ID 和私钥。
The access key consists of two components, the access key ID and the secret access key.

8850
15:06:48,782 --> 15:06:53,700
这两个密钥都可以在 AWS Web 控制台中为 IAM 用户生成。
Both keys can be generated for an IAM user in the AWS Web Console.

8851
15:06:54,478 --> 15:06:59,812
密钥 ID 唯一标识用户凭据，可以视为公开信息。
The key ID uniquely identifies user credentials and can be considered public knowledge.

8852
15:07:00,462 --> 15:07:04,580
私钥用于对所有请求进行加密签名。
The secret access key is used to cryptographically sign all requests.

8853
15:07:04,974 --> 15:07:11,012
它是用户的私密信息，绝不应公开发布或与未经授权的人员共享。
It's private to the user and should never be publicly posted or shared with unauthorized personnel.

8854
15:07:11,630 --> 15:07:14,884
如果被入侵，密钥可以且必须被撤销。
If compromised, the key can and must be revoked.

8855
15:07:15,342 --> 15:07:20,800
你绝不应该将访问密钥放在任何可能被第三方发现的地方。
You should never place your access keys anywhere where they can be potentially discovered by third parties.

8856
15:07:21,070 --> 15:07:31,492
第三方可以扫描 GitHub 等源代码软件源来寻找 AWS 凭据，
并使用这些凭据以你的名义创建 AWS 资源，费用由你承担。
Third parties can scan source code repositories, such as GitHub for AWS credentials,
and use those credentials to spin up their own AWS resources at your expense.

8857
15:07:32,238 --> 15:07:39,076
你可以为你的主账户创建访问密钥，但 AWS 强烈不建议这样做。
You can create access keys for your master account, however, AWS strongly discourages this practice.

8858
15:07:39,534 --> 15:07:51,268
更安全的做法是在 IAM 中创建一个用户，将该用户分配到具有工具或应用程序所需权限子集的组
中，然后为该用户生成访问密钥。
It is safer to generate a user in IAM, assign that user to a group with the subset of permissions required by your tools or
application, and then generate an access key for that user.

8859
15:07:53,582 --> 15:07:57,200
仅靠密码安全不足以保护你的账户。
Password only security is not enough to secure your account.

8860
15:07:57,582 --> 15:08:03,684
密码很容易通过社会工程学或恶意软件（如按键记录器）被入侵。
Passwords can be easily compromised through social engineering or by malwares, such as a keystroke logger.

8861
15:08:04,302 --> 15:08:11,204
为了提供额外的账户安全级别，你可以启用多因素身份验证或 MFA。
To provide an additional level of account security, you can enable multifactor authentication or MFA.

8862
15:08:11,758 --> 15:08:16,932
有了 MFA，用户需要提供密码和一次性响应令牌。
With MFA, users need to supply a password and a one-time response token.

8863
15:08:17,358 --> 15:08:20,036
这个令牌可以通过两种方式生成。
This token can be generated in one of two ways.

8864
15:08:20,750 --> 15:08:22,116
一种是通过软件。
One by software.

8865
15:08:22,606 --> 15:08:30,372
可以使用像 Google Authenticator 这样的软件应用，在
iPhone 和 Android 上生成来自智能手机或平板电脑的令牌。
Software applications, such as Google Authenticator for iPhone and
Android, can be used to generate a token from a smartphone or a tablet.

8866
15:08:31,342 --> 15:08:32,900
另一种是通过硬件。
Two, by hardware.

8867
15:08:33,518 --> 15:08:38,788
AWS 支持通过 Gemalto 销售的钥匙扣和显示卡设备。
AWS supports key fob and display card devices sold through Gemalto.

8868
15:08:39,406 --> 15:08:49,220
物理或硬件令牌生成器比软件设备提供更高一层的安全性，
因为软件设备更难防止未经授权的使用。
Physical or hardware token generators provide an additional level of security over software devices,
since software devices are harder to secure against unauthorized usage.

8869
15:08:50,030 --> 15:08:59,236
软件和硬件设备都通过一次性流程进行配置，从而将令牌设备与您的 AWS 或 IAM 账户同步。
Both software and hardware devices are configured through a one-time process
through which the token devices are synchronized with your AWS or IAM account.

8870
15:09:00,142 --> 15:09:03,108
确保妥善保管您的 MFA 令牌生成器。
Make sure to safeguard your MFA token generators.

8871
15:09:03,534 --> 15:09:13,764
如果物理令牌丢失或被盗，或者软件生成器被删除（例
如在设备擦除过程中），您将不得不禁用账户上的 MFA。
If a physical token is lost or stolen, or a software generator is deleted, for example, as part of a device swipe,
you will have to disable MFA on your account.

8872
15:09:14,350 --> 15:09:19,140
在禁用之前，您需要向 AWS 提供身份验证证明。
And before disabling, you will have to provide a proof of identity to AWS.

8873
15:09:19,950 --> 15:09:29,796
既然您已经学习了如何使用 MFA 来保护您的 AWS 账户，
接下来您将学习 AWS 推荐的关于账户安全的最佳实践。
Now that you have learned how to use MFA to secure your AWS account, you will
learn about the AWS recommended best practices regarding account security.

8874
15:09:30,542 --> 15:09:34,724
不要传播有关您的主账户或根 AWS 账户的信息。
Do not circulate information about your master or root AWS account.

8875
15:09:35,630 --> 15:09:40,484
将系统管理职能委派给遵循最小权限原则的 IAM 管理组。
Delegate system administration functions to least privileged IAM admin groups.

8876
15:09:41,390 --> 15:09:45,668
强制要求根级别访问必须进行多因素身份验证。
Make multi factor authentication mandatory for root level access.

8877
15:09:46,574 --> 15:09:51,396
将硬件 MFA 设备存放在安全的地方，例如 Vault。
Physically secure hardware MFA devices in a safe place such as a vault.

8878
15:09:52,334 --> 15:09:56,932
除了账户持有者，不要与任何人共享主账户信息。
Do not share master account information with anyone other than the account holder.

8879
15:09:57,934 --> 15:10:01,284
使用 IAM 角色来提供跨账户访问。
Use IAM roles to provide cross account access.

8880
15:10:02,702 --> 15:10:07,140
在保护好账户后，下一步是保护您的实例。
After securing your account, the next step is to secure your instances.

8881
15:10:07,534 --> 15:10:15,332
您可以通过决定在员工入职和离职时如何授予和撤销权限，来定义实例级别的安全性。
You can define the instance level security by deciding how to grant and revoke permissions as employees enter and leave the company.

8882
15:10:16,206 --> 15:10:25,732
对于 Windows 实例，您可以使用 AWS 目录服务，根据现
有的 Windows 用户和组来授予或撤销对机器的访问权限。
For Windows instances, you can leverage the AWS directory service to grant
and revoke access to machines based on existing Windows users and groups.

8883
15:10:26,734 --> 15:10:35,588
对于 Linux 实例，您可以使用屏幕上显示的命令来添加用户、生成新的密钥对，
并将它们添加到新用户的文件中。
For Linux instances, you can add users, generate new key pairs, and append
them to a new user's file with the commands displayed on the screen.

8884
15:10:36,398 --> 15:10:45,444
制定全集群用户管理的策略，例如创建包含您公司
所有当前用户的 Amazon Machine Images 或 AMIs。
Devise a strategy for fleet-wide user management, such as creating Amazon
Machine Images or AMIs containing all the current users of your company.

8885
15:10:46,606 --> 15:11:00,516
使用 Chef、Puppet 或 Ansible 等配置管理应用，简化在大量机器上授予和撤销访问的流程，
通常可以将流程简化为几个简单的命令。
Use configuration management applications such as Chef, Puppet, or Ansible, to simplify the process of granting and revoking access
across a large number of machines, often reducing the process to a few simple commands.

8886
15:11:01,550 --> 15:11:06,980
现在让我们学习 AWS 推荐的关于实例安全的最佳实践。
Let's now learn the AWS recommended best practices regarding instance security.

8887
15:11:07,694 --> 15:11:11,012
在启动实例时，您应该使用 IAM 角色。
You should use IAM roles when launching instances.

8888
15:11:11,406 --> 15:11:14,052
避免给单个用户授予权限。
Avoid giving permissions to individual users.

8889
15:11:14,798 --> 15:11:17,124
使用最小权限原则的访问政策。
Use least privilege access policies.

8890
15:11:17,614 --> 15:11:20,580
不要给用户授予超出要求的权限。
Do not give the user more privileges than required.

8891
15:11:21,454 --> 15:11:24,548
保护并管理访问或密钥令牌。
Guard and manage access or secret key tokens.

8892
15:11:24,942 --> 15:11:27,940
将您的访问密钥令牌存放在安全的地方。
Store your access key tokens in a secure place.

8893
15:11:28,782 --> 15:11:30,852
保持安全补丁处于最新状态。
Keep security patches up to date.

8894
15:11:31,118 --> 15:11:39,236
订阅你所使用的操作系统和应用程序的安全邮件列表，并及时应用补丁和更新。
Subscribe to security mailing lists of the operating systems and applications you're using,
and apply patches and updates in a timely manner.

8895
15:11:40,206 --> 15:11:42,244
使用 NAT 和 Bastion Host。
Use a NAT and Bastion Host.

8896
15:11:42,670 --> 15:11:47,108
如果不需要，不要将你的 EC2 资源暴露在互联网上。
Do not expose your EC2 resources to the Internet if it is not required.

8897
15:11:48,206 --> 15:11:53,028
你不应该使用 root 级别或主账户的访问权限或密钥。
You should not use root level or master account access or secret keys.

8898
15:11:53,454 --> 15:12:01,380
你不需要经常使用主账户，因此强烈建议移除其访问密钥或避免生成它们。
You do not need to use the master account regularly, so it is highly recommended to remove its access keys or avoid generating them.

8899
15:12:02,318 --> 15:12:06,564
不要将访问或密钥嵌入到代码中，或者将它们提交到 Git。
Embed access or secret keys in the code or commit them to Git.

8900
15:12:07,182 --> 15:12:14,564
记住，任何拥有你访问密钥的人，对你的 AWS 资源都拥有和你同等的访问权限。
Remember that anyone who has your access keys has the same level of access as you to your AWS resources.

8901
15:12:18,062 --> 15:12:23,556
在本主题中，你将学习 AWS 与客户之间的责任共担。
In this topic, you'll learn about the responsibilities shared between AWS and the customer.

8902
15:12:25,102 --> 15:12:32,484
责任共担模型定义了 AWS 与客户在安全方面的共同责任。
The shared responsibility model defines the responsibilities shared between AWS and the customers with regard to security.

8903
15:12:33,358 --> 15:12:48,610
AWS 负责云的安全，即底层基础设施；客户负责云中的安全，即建立在基础设施上的资源，
包括 AWS、EC2 实例，以及安装在上面的操作系统和应用程序、访问实例的账户、
AWS is responsible for the security of the cloud, that is, the underlying infrastructure,
and the customer is responsible for security in the cloud, that is, the resources built on the infrastructure, which include AWS,

8904
15:12:48,610 --> 15:12:56,440
AWS 负责云的安全，即底层基础设施；客户负责云中的安全，即建立在基础设施上的资源，
包括 AWS、EC2 实例，以及安装在上面的操作系统和应用程序、访问实例的账户、
EC2 instances, and the operating systems and applications installed on them, accounts that access the instances,
security group that allows outside access to the instances, VPC subnet within which the instances reside.

8905
15:12:56,440 --> 15:13:04,036
允许外部访问实例的安全组，以及实例所在的 VPC 子网。
EC2 instances, and the operating systems and applications installed on them, accounts that access the instances,
security group that allows outside access to the instances, VPC subnet within which the instances reside.

8906
15:13:04,718 --> 15:13:07,300
以及对 S3 存储桶的外部访问。
external access to the S3 buckets.

8907
15:13:09,326 --> 15:13:14,020
客户责任的一个关键部分涉及渗透测试。
A crucial part of a customer's responsibility involves penetration testing.

8908
15:13:14,702 --> 15:13:22,820
渗透测试是指通过扫描系统、应用程序或网络，来寻找攻击者可以利用的漏洞。
Penetration testing is the practice of scanning a system, application,
or network to search for vulnerabilities that an attacker can exploit.

8909
15:13:23,566 --> 15:13:28,868
要对你的 EC2 实例进行渗透测试，你需要申请权限。
To perform penetration testing of your EC two instances, you need to request for permission.

8910
15:13:29,390 --> 15:13:33,828
关于渗透测试申请，你需要记住以下几点。
You need to keep in mind the following points regarding penetration testing requests.

8911
15:13:34,542 --> 15:13:37,444
所有的渗透测试都需要获得权限。
Permission is required for all penetration tests.

8912
15:13:38,254 --> 15:13:46,596
要申请权限，你必须使用与要测试的实例相关的根凭据登录到 AWS 门户。
To request permission, you must be logged into the AWS portal using
the root credentials associated with the instances you want to test.

8913
15:13:47,022 --> 15:13:53,380
否则，AWS 漏洞渗透测试申请表将无法正确预填。
Otherwise, the AWS vulnerability penetration testing request form will not pre-populate correctly.

8914
15:13:54,478 --> 15:14:00,196
AWS 策略仅允许对你拥有的 EC2 和 RDS 实例进行测试。
AWS policy only permits testing of EC2 and RDS instances that you own.

8915
15:14:00,750 --> 15:14:06,180
禁止对任何其他 AWS 服务或 AWS 拥有的资源进行测试。
Tests against any other AWS service or AWS owned resources are prohibited.

8916
15:14:07,118 --> 15:14:17,060
目前，Amazon 不允许对小型或微型 RDS 实例，以及 M1 小型或 T1 微型 EC2 实例进行测试。
Currently, Amazon does not permit testing of small or micro RDS instances, M1 small or T1 micro EC2 instances.

8917
15:14:18,880 --> 15:14:23,280
你已经了解了客户在安全方面的责任。
You have already learned what the customers' responsibilities regarding security are.

8918
15:14:23,918 --> 15:14:27,760
现在让我们快速了解一下 AWS 的责任。
Let's now quickly learn what the responsibilities of AWS are.

8919
15:14:28,718 --> 15:14:36,000
AWS 提供广泛的网络和安全监控系统，为你的实例提供安全的运行环境。
AWS offers extensive networking and security monitoring systems to provide a secure environment for your instances.

8920
15:14:36,718 --> 15:14:52,820
AWS 负责确保以下内容：物理和环境安全、火灾探测与抑制、不间断电源、为服务器保持恒温、
电力、机械和生命支持系统的管理、存储设备报废、业务连
AWS is responsible for ensuring the following: physical and environmental security, fire detection and suppression,
uninterruptible power supply, maintaining a constant temperature for servers, management of electrical, mechanical,

8921
15:14:52,820 --> 15:14:56,320
AWS 负责确保以下内容：物理和环境安全、火灾探测与抑制、不间断电源、为服务器保持恒温、
电力、机械和生命支持系统的管理、存储设备报废、业务连
and life support systems, storage device decommissioning, business, continuity
management, availability, incident response, company-wide, executive review.

8922
15:14:56,320 --> 15:15:03,876
续性管理、可用性、事件响应、全公司范围内的执行审查。
and life support systems, storage device decommissioning, business, continuity
management, availability, incident response, company-wide, executive review.

8923
15:15:05,166 --> 15:15:24,350
网络安全、安全网络架构、安全访问、传输保护、Amazon 公司隔离或逻辑与物理之间的职责分离、
容错设计、网络监控与保护、AWS 访问、账户审查与审计、背景调查、密码策略、安全设计原则、
Network security, secure network architecture, secure access, transmission protection, Amazon corporate segregation,
or separation of duties between logical and physical, fault tolerant design, network monitoring and protection, AWS, access,

8924
15:15:24,350 --> 15:15:30,680
网络安全、安全网络架构、安全访问、传输保护、Amazon 公司隔离或逻辑与物理之间的职责分离、
容错设计、网络监控与保护、AWS 访问、账户审查与审计、背景调查、密码策略、安全设计原则、
account review and audit, background checks, password policy, secure design principles, secure software development,
formal design reviews, threat modeling, risk assessments, static code analysis.

8925
15:15:30,680 --> 15:15:39,940
安全软件开发、正式设计审查、威胁建模、风险评估、静态代码分析。
account review and audit, background checks, password policy, secure design principles, secure software development,
formal design reviews, threat modeling, risk assessments, static code analysis.

8926
15:15:40,974 --> 15:15:55,600
变更管理、系统化审查、测试、批准和沟通、从影响最小的区域开始的分阶段部署、影响、
健康状况、阈值和警报的指标、根因分析。
Change management, systematic review, test, approve, and communicate, phased deployment starting with lowest impact areas,
metrics for impact, health, threshold, and alarms, root cause analysis.

8927
15:15:56,000 --> 15:16:01,920
无论你身处世界的哪个角落，感谢你参加 TurundaV 主持的这次 AWS 网络研讨会。
Depending on where you are in the world, thanks for joining us for this AWS webinar with TurundaV.

8928
15:16:02,640 --> 15:16:06,468
AWS 安全，身份与访问管理。
AWS Security, Identity and Access Management.

8929
15:16:07,406 --> 15:16:13,444
当然，安全性对任何应用来说都很重要，但当该应用托管在公有云上时，安全性就变得至关重要。
Security, of course, is essential for any application, but when that application is hosted on a public cloud, security becomes vital.

8930
15:16:13,806 --> 15:16:22,400
所以，Amazon Web Services 作为首选公有云之所以受欢迎，
很大程度上是因为它在市场上拥有最安全的云平台这一口碑。
So the popularity of Amazon Web Services as the preferred public cloud is
largely due to its reputation as the most secure cloud platform on the market.

8931
15:16:22,702 --> 15:16:29,840
AWS 身份与访问管理在提供安全且受控的 AWS 资源访问方面起着关键作用。
AWS identity and access management plays a key role in providing secure and controlled access to AWS resources.

8932
15:16:30,000 --> 15:16:40,720
所以在本次会议中，Tarun 将讲解 IAM 用户、组、角色等等，以便更好地保护您的信息安全。
So in this session, Tarun is going to explain IAM users, groups, roles, and so forth to better secure your information with AWS.

8933
15:16:40,880 --> 15:16:44,800
现在，如果您还不熟悉 Tarun，让我简单介绍一下。
Now, if you are not familiar with Tarun, let me fill you in a little bit.

8934
15:16:44,960 --> 15:16:56,708
他是 AWS 的布道师，也是 AWS 认证的解决方案架构师助理，拥有超过 15 年作为顾问、
技术架构师和项目领导者的工作经验。
He is an evangelist for AWS, an AWS Certified Solutions Architect Associate with more than 15 years of work experience as a
consultant, a technical architect, and a project leader.

8935
15:16:57,038 --> 15:17:04,960
在他的职业生涯中，他曾管理过规模达到 30 人甚至更多的团队，并与包括 India 和 U.S.
大型 MNCs 在内的各种全球客户合作。
Throughout his career, he has managed teams as large as 30 or more, working with various global clients,
including the large MNCs of India and the U.S.

8936
15:17:05,200 --> 15:17:11,172
现在他正与初创公司和组织合作，帮助他们设计并将应用程序迁移到 AWS。
And now he is working with startups and organizations to help them design and migrate their apps to AWS.

8937
15:17:12,206 --> 15:17:22,692
他也是该领域的活跃博主和内容作者，作为培训师，他曾为超过 800 名参与者举办过 AWS 解决
方案架构师助理级别考试的培训课程。
He's also an active blogger and a content writer on this topic, and as a trainer,
he has conducted training sessions for over 800 participants on the AWS Solution Architect Associate Level exam.

8938
15:17:23,534 --> 15:17:32,900
所以我们非常幸运能邀请到他，他一定会为您揭开 AWS 的神秘面纱。
So we're very lucky to have him here, and he's going to definitely be peeling the curtains away from the mystery of AWS for you.

8939
15:17:33,280 --> 15:17:38,400
在开始之前，我只想确保大家都能正常听到我们的声音，并让大家熟悉一下您的仪表板。
Before we get started, I just want to make sure everybody's hearing us okay and familiarize you all with your dashboard.

8940
15:17:38,560 --> 15:17:42,148
请查看仪表板并找到问题模块。
So go ahead and take a look at the dashboard and find the questions module.

8941
15:17:42,320 --> 15:17:46,000
那是给你们用的地方，不是聊天模块，而是问题模块。
That's a place for you, not the chat module, but the questions module.

8942
15:17:46,080 --> 15:17:49,040
请找到那个问题模块，并在里面帮我输入点内容。
Go ahead and find that questions module and type in there for me if you would.

8943
15:17:49,200 --> 15:17:58,400
只需跟 Tarun 打个招呼，让他知道您在场，并且很高兴他准备好开始了，您也期待听到一些干货。
Just say hello to Tarun so that he knows you're here and that you're happy
he's ready to start and you're looking forward to hearing some good stuff.

8944
15:17:58,560 --> 15:17:59,200
好的，收到了。
There we go.

8945
15:17:59,374 --> 15:18:00,160
谢谢你，Martin。
Thank you, Martin.

8946
15:18:00,240 --> 15:18:01,508
谢谢你，Anakul。
Thank you, Anakul.

