因此，只有拥有特定权限级别或特定职位的人才能访问一定数量的数据，而其他人可能无法访问。
So only certain people with certain clearances or certain job titles can have access to certain amount of data,
whereas other people may not have access to it.

9619
16:20:31,152 --> 16:20:36,912
例如，在销售部门工作的人将无法访问人力资源部门访问的数据。
For example, a person working in the sales department will not have access to data that is accessed by the HR department.

9620
16:20:37,072 --> 16:20:43,792
因此，这就是我们所关注的数据分类和保持机密性，即仅将其提供给那些需要它的人。
Thus, that's what we are looking at classification of data and keeping it confidential,
only making it available to those people who require it.

9621
16:20:43,952 --> 16:20:52,832
当我们谈论可信度或数据的完整性时，完整性是指
数据没有被未经授权的人篡改、修改、移除或删除。
When we say trustworthiness or the integrity of that data, the integrity is where
the data has been altered, modified, removed, deleted by unauthorized people.

9622
16:20:52,912 --> 16:20:54,032
所以我们要防止这种情况发生。
So we want to prevent that.

9623
16:20:54,192 --> 16:21:03,152
这意味着当我们说想要保持完整性时，我们是要确保只有在获得允许的情况下，
授权人员才能修改、更改或删除数据。
Which means when we say we want the integrity intact, we want to ensure that only
authorized people can modify, alter, or remove data if they are allowed to do so.

9624
16:21:03,438 --> 16:21:06,512
所以这就是授权和身份验证再次进入视野的地方。
So that's where the authorization and authentication comes into the picture again.

9625
16:21:06,672 --> 16:21:08,272
而且数据还需要是可用的。
And data needs to be available.

9626
16:21:08,432 --> 16:21:15,872
为了保护数据，我可以直接把它锁在保险箱里，把保险
箱扔到深海里，然后说数据是安全的，因为它不会泄露。
For me to safeguard data, I can just lock it up in a safe, throw the safe in the depth of an ocean,
and say that the data is secure because it cannot be leaked out.

9627
16:21:15,982 --> 16:21:20,032
但这样数据就无法提供给授权用户了，因此这些数据就没用了。
But that data is no longer available to authorized users, hence that data is useless.

9628
16:21:20,192 --> 16:21:29,152
对我来说，只有当数据保持机密、保持可信，并且仍然
可供所有获授权访问的用户使用时，数据才具有价值。
For me, data would have value when the data remains confidential, has its trustworthiness intact,
and is still available to all the users that are authorized to access it.

9629
16:21:29,312 --> 16:21:37,152
所以当我们谈论安全时，我们希望在组织拥有的和操作的每一个数字资产上都实现这三个方面。
So when we talk about security, we want these three aspects to be implemented
on any and every digital asset that the organization has and does.

9630
16:21:37,312 --> 16:21:44,832
一旦这三点得到保证，或者至少在一定程度上得到
确保，我们就可以说数据或特定的资产是安全的。
Once these three points are guaranteed or at least assured to a certain
extent, we can then say that the data or that particular asset is secured.

