This is from a governance perspective where we talk about the risk an organization would face, risk management a little bit,
talk about compliance, laws, regulations that the organization has to look forward to or needs to adhere to.

9637
16:22:28,912 --> 16:22:39,152
所以如果你从组织的角度来看，你是在看组织拥有的业务目标，
以及安全如何与这些业务目标保持一致。
So if you look at an organization's from an organization's perspective, you are looking at a business objective that an organization
