9644
16:23:20,912 --> 16:23:24,912
这个标准在组织中实施的审计范围是什么？
What is the scope of that standard that can be implemented in the organization?

9645
16:23:24,992 --> 16:23:32,272
所以他们需要检查这些法律、法规和合规性，并确定哪些需要实施，哪些需要遵守。
So they want to check on these laws, regulations, compliances, and they
need to check which they need to implement and which they need to adhere to.

9646
16:23:32,432 --> 16:23:35,712
一旦确定了这些，他们就会看风险评估。
And once they have identified that, they would look at the risk assessment.

9647
16:23:35,872 --> 16:23:48,020
他们会看到目前的现状，在这些法律、法规和合规性方面，组织面临哪些风险，
如何通过安全手段缓解这些风险，以及一旦实施了安全措施，
They would see where they are positioned right now, what are the risks that the organization faces as far as these laws, regulations,
and compliances are concerned, how they can mitigate those risks with security, and once security has been implemented,

9648
16:23:48,020 --> 16:23:48,060
他们会看到目前的现状，在这些法律、法规和合规性方面，组织面临哪些风险，
如何通过安全手段缓解这些风险，以及一旦实施了安全措施，
how they can move on with the governance of that enterprise over a longer period of time.

9649
16:23:48,060 --> 16:23:52,192
如何在更长的时间跨度内继续进行企业的治理。
how they can move on with the governance of that enterprise over a longer period of time.

9650
16:23:52,352 --> 16:23:57,232
然后，这被分解到剩下的模块中，你可以首先谈论资产安全。
