the OSI layer comes into the picture, how you're going to secure yourself against various network-based attacks like ARP, spoofing,
Mac spoofing, IP address, spoofing, sniffing attacks, man in the middle attacks, and things like that.

9668
16:25:51,744 --> 16:26:03,984
现在，这个领域稍微偏技术一点，它会谈到 OSI 层、TCP 和 UDP，
