识别风险对组织产生的影响，评估风险有两种不同的方式：定量评估或定性评估。
Identifying the impact of the risk that the risk would have on the organization, and there would be two different ways to assess the
risk: a quantitative assessment or a qualitative assessment.

9974
16:56:10,144 --> 16:56:20,544
定量评估在流程上更具可量化性，或者说是数值化的，也就是你要给特定的资产和威胁分配成本。
A quantitative assessment is more quantifiable or is numerical in its process
