9982
16:56:53,230 --> 16:57:04,192
如果我有一条 10 Mbps 的线路，现在因为 ISP 的某些故障，速度降到了 4 Mbps，
我可能就无法在 10 Mbps 线路上开展原本的业务了。
So if I've got a 10 MVPS line and now because of some fault of the ISP, it gets reduced to 4 MVPS,
I may not be able to conduct the business that I would I was doing on a 10 MVPS line.

9983
16:57:04,352 --> 16:57:06,992
那么该设备的质量是否退化了？
Does the quality of that device has degraded?

9984
16:57:07,152 --> 16:57:11,632
呃，所以它正在发生这种情况，它是一个风险并且造成了我的损失，对吧？
Uh thus it is going that does it is a risk and it is causing me losses, right?

9985
16:57:11,712 --> 16:57:16,932
所以定性风险分析在性质上更偏向于描述性，而不是数值性的。
So qualitative risk analysis would be more descriptive in nature rather than be numerical in nature.

9986
16:57:17,774 --> 16:57:26,512
大多数公司或组织会遵循混合策略，因为不可能在每一个场景中都进行定量风险分析。
most of the companies or organizations would follow a hybrid policy because it is not
possible to have a quantitative quantitative risk analysis in each and every scenario.

9987
