Healthcare cybersecurity is a critical and complex field, directly
tied to the protection of sensitive data and the continuity of care.

12719
21:28:36,238 --> 21:28:46,432
随着对数字系统的依赖日益增加，以及医疗环境中联网设备的普及，
对强大网络安全措施的需求从未像现在这样紧迫。
With the increasing reliance on digital systems and the proliferation of connected devices in the healthcare environment,
the need for robust cybersecurity measures has never been more pressing.

12720
