上输入 IP config 命令并按回车，它会列出所有存在的适配器。
So as you can see on the right hand side in the command prompt screen, if once you type in the IP config command on the C prompt and
press enter, it will give you a list of all the adapters that are there.

13323
22:31:56,942 --> 22:31:59,760
你可以看到无线 LAN 适配器，本地连接。
So you can see wireless LAN adapter local area connection.

13324
22:31:59,840 --> 22:32:01,840
媒体已断开，它不存在。
The media is disconnected, it doesn't exist.

13325
22:32:02,030 --> 22:32:12,160
在底部，你会看到 Wi-Fi 连接，无线 LAN 适配器，它可
以显示 IPv6 地址、IPv4 地址、子网掩码和默认网关。
At the bottom, you will see the Wi-Fi connection, wireless LAN adapter, and it can give you the IP version 6 IP address,
IP version 4 address, the subnet mask, and the default gateway.

13326
22:32:12,240 --> 22:32:21,920
这就是让机器识别它处于哪个网络、连接互联网的默认网关是什么、子网掩码是什么、
