13524
22:55:32,782 --> 22:55:34,820
什么是黑盒测试和白盒测试？
What is black box and white box testing?

13525
22:55:35,118 --> 22:55:41,380
所以当你测试软件或测试你的基础设施时，有两种不同的测试可以进行。
So when you are testing a software or you're testing your infrastructure, there are two different tests that you can conduct.

13526
22:55:41,744 --> 22:55:45,220
第一个是黑盒，第二个是白盒。
The first one is a black box, the second one is a white box.

13527
22:55:45,486 --> 22:55:49,744
在黑盒测试中，不会向测试人员提供任何已知信息。
In a black box test, there is no knowledge that is shared with the tester.

13528
22:55:49,824 --> 22:55:58,596
假设你是一名道德黑客，你获得了一个组织的合同，去测试他们开发的一个应用程序。
So let's say you're an ethical hacker and you have been awarded a contract by
an organization to test their current application that they have developed.

13529
22:55:58,944 --> 22:56:03,264
现在他们不会给你任何信息，也不会告诉你这个应用程序是什么。
Now they are not going to give you any information, they are not going to tell you what the application is.

13530
22:56:03,344 --> 22:56:13,104
他们可能只给你一个 IP 地址和端口号，也就是应用程序托管的地方，
现在你必须发出自己的查询，试着弄清楚这个应用程序是什么，试着收集……
They just probably give you an IP address and a port number where the application is hosted,
and now you have to fire in your own queries and try to figure out what the application is, try to gather.

13531
22:56:13,104 --> 22:56:17,024
收集信息，看看最初能收集到哪些信息？
information, see what, uh, what information can be gathered in the first place?

13532
22:56:17,134 --> 22:56:26,148
然后根据这些信息，你会找出自己的方法，识别漏
洞，看看这些漏洞中是否有任何可能导致安全事件。
and based on that, you're going to figure out your way, identify vulnerabilities,
and see if any of those vulnerabilities can lead to a security incident.

13533
22:56:26,384 --> 22:56:33,988
所以，在没有任何知识、对 IT 基础设施或源代码零了解的情况下，这就是黑盒攻击或黑盒测试。
