13538
22:56:54,158 --> 22:57:04,544
因为第一种，黑盒审计，模拟的是外部攻击，即坐在组织外部的外部黑客试图寻找进入的方法。
Because the first one, a black box audit, emulates the attack of an outsider, an
external hacker sitting outside the organization trying to figure their way in.

13539
22:57:04,846 --> 22:57:17,984
而白盒攻击可以模拟内部攻击，比如组织内的一名不满的员工
滥用他们的访问控制或访问权限来获取未经核实的利润，对吧？
Whereas a white box attack can emulate the attack of an insider, so a disgruntled employee within that organization misusing their
access controls or their access rights to make unvalidated profits, right?

13540
22:57:18,446 --> 22:57:30,304
所以有人腐败了，有人收受贿赂，想要出卖公司的密钥，所以他们会尝试寻找漏洞，
尝试窃取数据，并尝试在灰色市场上出售，对吧？
So somebody is corrupt, who has been bribed, who wants to sell out company secrets based,
uh so they're going to try to find out vulnerabilities, try to steal data, and try to sell it on the uh gray market, right?

13541
22:57:30,384 --> 22:57:35,972
所以白盒模拟内部攻击，黑盒模拟外部攻击。
So a white box would emulate uh internal attack, a black box would emulate an external attack.

13542
22:57:36,238 --> 22:57:39,396
进入问题 17，什么是用例测试？
