13543
22:57:40,078 --> 22:57:45,316
现在，用例测试是一种功能测试，它也是一种黑盒测试。
Now, use case testing is a functional test and it is also a black box test.

13544
22:57:45,904 --> 22:57:46,224
对吧？
Right?

13545
22:57:46,478 --> 22:57:47,716
什么是功能测试？
What is a functional test?

13546
22:57:47,982 --> 22:57:51,664
它测试软件创建后的功能。
It tests the functionality of a particular software once it has been created.

13547
22:57:52,846 --> 22:57:54,144
为什么它是黑盒测试？
Why is it a black box test?

13548
22:57:54,304 --> 22:58:03,104
因为用户不知道具体的功能是什么，他们只是想找出每一个场景，
并看看这些场景会产生什么样的响应。
Because the user doesn't know what the functionality is, they just want to find out
each and every scenario and try to see what that scenario generates as a response.

13549
22:58:03,264 --> 22:58:07,748
他们不确定生成的响应是否是正确的。
They are not sure whether that is the appropriate response that should be generated or not.

13550
22:58:08,622 --> 22:58:14,340
他们只是想找出在发出查询后会产生的响应。
They're just trying to find out the response that is going to be generated after they fire off a query.

13551
22:58:14,624 --> 22:58:20,580
所以测试人员使用这种技术来获取测试场景，从而从头到尾运行整个系统。
So this technique is used by testers to get the test scenarios to exercise the whole system from start to finish.

13552
22:58:21,166 --> 22:58:23,876
假设这是一个应用程序的登录机制。
So let's say it's a login mechanism for an application.

13553
22:58:24,216 --> 22:58:24,336
对吧？
right?

13554
22:58:24,704 --> 22:58:31,344
现在，由于是黑盒测试，测试人员此时知道这是一个登录机制。
Now, a user at this point in time, the tester, since it's a black box testing, will know that it is a login mechanism.

13555
22:58:31,504 --> 22:58:35,024
但他们不知道具体使用了哪些登录机制。
They will not know the details of what login mechanisms are being utilized.

13556
22:58:35,184 --> 22:58:48,220
所以他们不知道是否做了输入验证，不知道是否做了输出编码，不知道CGI是如何调用的，
也不知道服务器端如何处理查询，以及数据库如何处理那个特定的查询。
So they wouldn't know whether input validation is done, they wouldn't know whether output encoding is done,
they wouldn't know how the CGI calls are being made, they will not know how the queries are handled at the server side and how the

13557
22:58:48,220 --> 22:58:51,024
所以他们不知道是否做了输入验证，不知道是否做了输出编码，不知道CGI是如何调用的，
也不知道服务器端如何处理查询，以及数据库如何处理那个特定的查询。
database is going to treat that particular query.

13558
22:58:51,246 --> 22:58:54,852
所以他们不知道是否可能遭受SQL注入攻击等等。
So they have no idea whether SQL injection attacks are possible and so on so forth.

13559
22:58:55,214 --> 22:59:02,944
所以对他们来说，无论他们尝试为那个登录机制输入什么，这就是功能性的黑盒测试。
So for them, with whatever input they are going to try to insert for that login mechanism, that's a functional black box test.

13560
22:59:03,182 --> 22:59:14,850
功能性是指登录机制是否正常工作，以及根据输入的类型，是否会产生非预期的输出，
或者他们是否能绕过机制，或者因为遗留的某些缺陷而入侵系统。
The functionality being whether the login mechanism works and based on the type of inputs that are going to put in,
whether it creates an unwarranted output, whether they can bypass the mechanism or

13561
22:59:14,850 --> 22:59:19,524
功能性是指登录机制是否正常工作，以及根据输入的类型，是否会产生非预期的输出，
或者他们是否能绕过机制，或者因为遗留的某些缺陷而入侵系统。
they can hack into the system because of some of the flaws that were left behind.

13562
22:59:20,270 --> 22:59:20,544
对吧？
Right?

13563
22:59:20,942 --> 22:59:24,784
另一个例子是为用户提供文档使用的软件。
Another example here is a software made for users to use for documentation.

13564
22:59:25,070 --> 22:59:27,744
测试人员将测试用户可以执行的所有情况。
The testers will test all the cases that the user can do.

13565
