13568
22:59:34,446 --> 22:59:40,464
这些功能将取决于授予特定用户的访问控制。
So this functionality will depend upon the access controls that have been granted to a particular user.

13569
22:59:40,590 --> 22:59:47,424
所以对于这个特定用户，测试人员此时不知道他们是管理员用户还是普通用户。
So for this particular user, the tester at this point in time, they would
not know whether they are an administrative user or they are a regular user.

13570
22:59:47,662 --> 22:59:55,664
他们只会尝试执行所有操作，然后记录结果，比如“我能够查看”、“我能够添加”、
“我能够编辑”以及“我能够删除”。
They'll just try to do all of these and then write the responses saying I was
able to view, I was able to add, I was able to edit, and I was able to delete.

13571
22:59:55,904 --> 22:59:58,704
然后结果将发送给经理。
Now the result will be then sent to a manager.

13572
22:59:58,784 --> 23:00:11,824
经理将查看结果，然后根据本应授予该特定用户的实际访问控
制，来判断这是一个可接受的情况，还是其中存在任何缺陷。
The manager will look at the results and then, based on the actual access controls that were supposed to be there for this particular
user, then we'll try to identify whether this is an acceptable case or whether there were any flaws within this case.

