进入第18题。
Moving on to question 18.

13574
23:00:14,990 --> 23:00:17,184
什么是静态测试和动态测试？
What is static and dynamic testing?

13575
23:00:17,518 --> 23:00:19,424
这仍然是关于应用程序测试的内容。
Now, this is again in application testing.

13576
23:00:19,726 --> 23:00:23,024
静态测试是在软件开发生命周期的早期阶段进行的。
Static testing is done in an early stage of development lifecycle.

13577
23:00:23,104 --> 23:00:26,224
现在，软件开发生命周期有很多种。
Now, software development lifecycles, there are multiple of those.

13578
23:00:26,478 --> 23:00:27,940
这些生命周期是什么？
What are these life cycles?

13579
23:00:28,622 --> 23:00:34,916
应用程序从创建到提供给客户，有不同的阶段。
There are different stages in which the application is done created and provided to the customer.

13580
23:00:35,214 --> 23:00:49,024
所以，你的第一个阶段是确定应用程序的范围，确定该应用程序的硬件要求，
然后为该应用程序创建流程图、功能图，接着可能开始编码。
So, your first stage would be determining the scope of the application, determining the hardware requirements for that application,
then creating a flow chart for that application, a functional chart for that application, and then maybe start coding.

13581
23:00:49,262 --> 23:00:58,692
然后，架构师介入，测试并验证代码，接着进入测试
阶段，然后是安全测试阶段，最后是用户验收测试。
Then, an architect comes in, tests the code, verifies the code, then the testing phase comes in,
then the security testing phase comes in, and then the user acceptance testing comes in.

13582
23:00:59,184 --> 23:01:11,972
但在每一个阶段，在最早期，我们总是会开始静态测试，看看已经开发的任何代码、
开发的任何范围，这些范围是否正确。
But in every stage, at the very earliest of our stage, a static test will always be started to see whatever code has been developed,
whatever scope has been developed, whether that scope is going to be correct or not.

13583
23:01:12,302 --> 23:01:14,464
这将包括走查和代码审查。
This will include walkthroughs and code review.

13584
23:01:14,544 --> 23:01:15,584
什么是走查？
What is a walkthrough?

13585
23:01:15,758 --> 23:01:24,548
走查就是审查已经生成的文档，并试图找出到目前为止所创建的文档流程中的缺陷。
A walkthrough is going through documents that have been generated and trying to find
faults in the documented journey that has been doc that has been created so far.

13586
23:01:25,038 --> 23:01:32,944
比如说，有人为程序创建了一个工作流或流程图，说明函数将如何被调用以及如何被执行。
So let's say somebody has created a workflow or a flowchart for a program,
how the functions are going to be called and how they're going to be executed.

13587
23:01:33,230 --> 23:01:42,276
那么走查就是由所有相关负责人一起审查那个特定的流程图，找出其中的任何缺陷并进行修正。
So a walkthrough would be where uh all these responsible people will walk through
that particular flowchart and find out any flaws within that and then rectify them.

13588
23:01:42,830 --> 23:01:51,236
如果已经写好了代码，这些代码将被人工审查，并识别出其中的任何缺陷。
If there is any code that has already been written, this code will be
reviewed manually and any flaws within that code would then be identified.

13589
23:01:51,598 --> 23:01:56,484
静态测试总是能在极短的时间内达到 100% 的准确性，因为它是即时的。
Static testing will always be 100% accurate in a very short amount of time because it is immediate.

13590
23:01:56,944 --> 23:02:01,412
你创建了它，然后通过导出来测试它，看看一切是否正常。
You have created it, and then the export is going to test it to see whether everything is fine or not.

13591
23:02:01,824 --> 23:02:02,144
对吧？
Right?

13592
23:02:02,304 --> 23:02:04,144
这完全是关于预防机制的。
It is all about prevention mechanism.

13593
23:02:04,304 --> 23:02:09,344
既然你是在初始阶段就做的，如果你发现任何缺陷，它就会被立即修复。
