23:49:51,472 --> 23:50:00,964
如果我想使用字母表加 5，那么那个字符的间距，也就是该字符的偏移，
将是该特定字符之后的第五个字符，以此类推。
If I want to utilize alphabet plus five, then the spacing, the shifting of that
character will be the fifth character from that particular character, and so on so forth.

14026
23:50:02,766 --> 23:50:06,436
下一个问题：密文和明文有什么区别？
The next question: what is the difference between ciphertext and clear text?

14027
23:50:07,118 --> 23:50:10,521
密文是指经过加密且完全不可读的文本。
