14434
24:35:17,806 --> 24:35:29,590
通过为特定漏洞分配 CVE 标识符，MITRE 让网络安全研究人员、
供应商和组织能够一致地引用漏洞，从而在处理和
By assigning a CVE identifier to a specifically vulnerability, MITRE enables cybersecurity researchers,
vendors and organizations to refer to vulnerabilities consistently, allowing for effective communication and collaboration in

