Now, all of these databases have their own syntax, so you'll have to study most of these databases based on which applications and
which databases you want to provide security for.

14754
25:13:34,800 --> 25:13:48,350
但正如其名，SQL 注入漏洞，或者说结构化查询语言注入漏洞，
是指用户可以恶意注入 SQL 输入或 SQL 声明到查
But as the name suggests, SQL injection vulnerability, or a structured query language injection vulnerability,
is where a user can maliciously inject a SQL input or a SQL statement in a

