Once your computer boots up, it starts a discovery process of identifying its neighbors.

14788
25:17:41,134 --> 25:17:53,520
如果我在特定的子网中，我的机器会主动发送出 ARP 请求和地址解析协议，
以找出哪些机器在同一个网络中且处于在线状态。
So if I'm in a particular subnet, my machine will proactively send out ARP requests and address resolution protocol to find out which
other machines are within the same network and which are live.

14789
25:17:53,680 --> 25:18:00,516
一旦它发出查询，在线机器将回复该查询并附带其 MAC 地址。
Once it sends out a query, a live machine will respond to that query along with its MAC address.

14790
25:18:01,998 --> 25:18:10,084
这些信息随后被存储在被称为 ARP 表，即机器缓存上的 ARP 表中。
This information is then stored in what is known as an ARP table or an ARP table on the machine's cachet.

14791
25:18:10,670 --> 25:18:22,670
所以每当我的机器想要向特定机器发送数据包时，它会查阅 ARP 表，
识别 IP 地址和相关的 MAC 地址，将其打印在数据包上作
So whenever my machine now wants to send out a packet to this particular machine, it will go to the ARP table,
it will identify the IP address and the associated MAC address, it will print that onto the data packet as a destination IP and

14792
25:18:22,670 --> 25:18:24,490
为目标 IP 和目标 MAC，然后将该数据包发送到交换机。
So whenever my machine now wants to send out a packet to this particular machine, it will go to the ARP table,
it will identify the IP address and the associated MAC address, it will print that onto the data packet as a destination IP and

14793
