在中间人攻击中，攻击计算机会获取客户端的 IP 地址。
Now, in the man in the middle attack, the attacker attacking computer takes the IP address of the client.

14870
25:26:22,286 --> 25:26:25,584
服务器在不知情的情况下，继续与攻击者进行通信。
Unaware of this, the server continues to communicate with the attacker.

14871
25:26:25,744 --> 25:26:29,604
现在，如果你还记得之前的题目，我们也谈到了欺骗。
Now, if you remember in a previous question, we have also talked about spoofing.

14872
25:26:29,998 --> 25:26:43,200
所以在这种情况下，攻击者欺骗了他们的 IP 地址，伪装成真实的客户端；基于这种欺骗，
他们可能通过 ARP 欺骗攻击，或者仅仅因为伪造的 IP 地址而成为中间人攻击者。
So, in this scenario, a attacker has spoofed their IP address to replicate themselves as a genuine client,
and now with that spoofing in mind, they might either through a R poisoning

14873
25:26:43,200 --> 25:26:48,624
所以在这种情况下，攻击者欺骗了他们的 IP 地址，伪装成真实的客户端；基于这种欺骗，
他们可能通过 ARP 欺骗攻击，或者仅仅因为伪造的 IP 地址而成为中间人攻击者。
attack or just because of the spoofed IP address become a man in the middle.

14874
25:26:48,704 --> 25:26:58,244
这意味着他们通过伪装成服务器，正在窃听实际客户端与服务器之间的对话。
That means that they are now eavesdropping on the conversation between
the actual client and the server by posing themselves as a server.

14875
25:26:58,544 --> 25:27:09,184
在这种情况下，攻击者成了客户端和服务器之间的中间人，他们可以窃听，
如果愿意的话还可以复制数据，甚至可以修改数据。
In this scenario, the attacker is now a go-between between the client and the server
and can eavesdrop and can copy the data if they want, they can modify the data as well.

14876
